window.COURSE = {"slug": "pytorch", "title": "PyTorch 實作工程完整教學", "shortTitle": "PyTorch", "updated": "2026-10-30", "baseline": "2.15.0", "footerLabel": "PYTORCH 2.15.0 · TENSORS TO TRAINING", "exampleBundle": "examples.zip", "searchHint": "試試 broadcasting、Autograd、DataLoader、AMP、checkpoint 或 DDP。", "groups": [{"id": "start", "number": "01", "title": "從環境到 Tensor", "description": "建立可執行環境，讀懂 dtype、shape、索引與廣播。"}, {"id": "grad", "number": "02", "title": "記憶體、梯度與裝置", "description": "理解 views、計算圖、反向傳播與數值診斷。"}, {"id": "building", "number": "03", "title": "資料與模型的契約", "description": "資料切分、批次、padding、模組、層與損失。"}, {"id": "training", "number": "04", "title": "寫對完整訓練流程", "description": "optimizer、驗證、指標、排程與第一個回歸模型。"}, {"id": "practice", "number": "05", "title": "不同資料的實作練習", "description": "表格、影像、序列、凍結、自訂資料與除錯。"}, {"id": "engineering", "number": "06", "title": "可恢復、可重現的實驗", "description": "存檔、續訓、設定、隨機性與梯度累積。"}, {"id": "performance", "number": "07", "title": "GPU、效能與交付", "description": "記憶體、AMP、Profiler、compile、DDP 與 export。"}, {"id": "finish", "number": "08", "title": "測試與自己的完整專案", "description": "從數值測試到專題、解答、版本遷移與速查。"}], "lessons": [{"id": "01-mental-model", "group": "start", "title": "先看全貌：PyTorch 如何讓模型學習", "summary": "把資料、參數、損失、梯度與更新連成一個可以追蹤的流程。", "tags": ["PyTorch", "Tensor", "training"], "example": "01_tensors.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"pytorch\">先看全貌：PyTorch 如何讓模型學習</h1>\n<p>把資料、參數、損失、梯度與更新連成一個可以追蹤的流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">從一個預測問題開始</h2>\n<p>假設四個特徵描述一筆樣本，模型要選出三種類別之一。資料是 <code>x[N,4]</code>，答案是 <code>y[N]</code>，模型輸出 <code>logits[N,3]</code>。PyTorch 負責數值運算、自動微分與參數管理；你仍要決定資料代表什麼、哪些答案可以用來訓練，以及如何判斷成效。</p>\n<p>本課以撰寫日最新穩定版 <strong>2.15.0</strong> 為基準，查核日期 <strong>2026-10-30</strong>。官方發布於 2026-10-28；安裝包鎖定同一版本以重現。版本會持續演進，下一次更新重新查核，不把「安裝時隨意升級」當成教材驗證。基礎使用 CPU，GPU 章節另列條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">五個角色與一次更新</h2>\n<p>Tensor 保存數值；<code>nn.Module</code> 描述含參數的運算；loss 把預測與答案變成標量；Autograd 算出 loss 對參數的導數；optimizer 使用 <code>.grad</code> 修改參數。<code>backward()</code> 不會自行更新權重，<code>step()</code> 不會替你推導本輪 loss。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\hat y=f_\\theta(x),\\qquad L=\\ell(\\hat y,y),\\qquad \\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta\\nabla_\\theta L\n$$</div>\n<p>上式是最簡單 SGD 的直覺，AdamW 另有動量與狀態。學習率是更新幅度，不是模型的正確率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">執行與觀察</h2>\n<p>先執行本章範例，確認四個數的總和為 10，再看二維矩陣乘法的輸出。之後每章都先寫出 shape、dtype、device，再跑程式核對。網站只展示教材與 JavaScript 數值實驗；實際 PyTorch 程式在你的 Python 環境執行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整學習路線</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>第 1–12 章建立 Tensor、記憶體與梯度直覺。</li>\n<li>第 13–24 章建立資料契約與完整訓練／驗證流程。</li>\n<li>第 25–36 章處理不同資料、存檔、續訓與重現。</li>\n<li>第 37–48 章進入效能、分散式入門、交付與專題。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>先把 CPU 小資料跑通，再加入效能選項。教材的表格、影像與文字資料均為自製合成資料；下降的 loss 是流程檢查，不能推論真實任務表現。深度學習架構的完整理論將由獨立課程承接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>問題：loss 下降但分類結果都一樣，能否宣稱模型學會了？解答：不能。還要看類別分布、驗證集、混淆矩陣與簡單基準。第二題：呼叫 <code>loss.backward()</code> 後權重沒變是否有錯？解答：正常；確認 <code>.grad</code> 後呼叫 optimizer.step 才會更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/01_tensors.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Real CPU tensors: dtype, shape, device and Python conversion.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">values</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">]],</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">float32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;shape&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;dtype&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;device&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;sum&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;matmul&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">values</span> <span class=\"o\">@</span> <span class=\"n\">values</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tolist</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0\">最新正式發布</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html\">官方入門</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 先看全貌：PyTorch 如何讓模型學習\n\n把資料、參數、損失、梯度與更新連成一個可以追蹤的流程。\n\n## 從一個預測問題開始\n\n假設四個特徵描述一筆樣本，模型要選出三種類別之一。資料是 `x[N,4]`，答案是 `y[N]`，模型輸出 `logits[N,3]`。PyTorch 負責數值運算、自動微分與參數管理；你仍要決定資料代表什麼、哪些答案可以用來訓練，以及如何判斷成效。\n\n本課以撰寫日最新穩定版 **2.15.0** 為基準，查核日期 **2026-10-30**。官方發布於 2026-10-28；安裝包鎖定同一版本以重現。版本會持續演進，下一次更新重新查核，不把「安裝時隨意升級」當成教材驗證。基礎使用 CPU，GPU 章節另列條件。\n\n## 五個角色與一次更新\n\nTensor 保存數值；`nn.Module` 描述含參數的運算；loss 把預測與答案變成標量；Autograd 算出 loss 對參數的導數；optimizer 使用 `.grad` 修改參數。`backward()` 不會自行更新權重，`step()` 不會替你推導本輪 loss。\n\n$$\n\\hat y=f_\\theta(x),\\qquad L=\\ell(\\hat y,y),\\qquad \\theta_{t+1}=\\theta_t-\\eta\\nabla_\\theta L\n$$\n\n上式是最簡單 SGD 的直覺，AdamW 另有動量與狀態。學習率是更新幅度，不是模型的正確率。\n\n## 執行與觀察\n\n先執行本章範例，確認四個數的總和為 10，再看二維矩陣乘法的輸出。之後每章都先寫出 shape、dtype、device，再跑程式核對。網站只展示教材與 JavaScript 數值實驗；實際 PyTorch 程式在你的 Python 環境執行。\n\n## 完整學習路線\n\n1. 第 1–12 章建立 Tensor、記憶體與梯度直覺。\n2. 第 13–24 章建立資料契約與完整訓練／驗證流程。\n3. 第 25–36 章處理不同資料、存檔、續訓與重現。\n4. 第 37–48 章進入效能、分散式入門、交付與專題。\n\n先把 CPU 小資料跑通，再加入效能選項。教材的表格、影像與文字資料均為自製合成資料；下降的 loss 是流程檢查，不能推論真實任務表現。深度學習架構的完整理論將由獨立課程承接。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n問題：loss 下降但分類結果都一樣，能否宣稱模型學會了？解答：不能。還要看類別分布、驗證集、混淆矩陣與簡單基準。第二題：呼叫 `loss.backward()` 後權重沒變是否有錯？解答：正常；確認 `.grad` 後呼叫 optimizer.step 才會更新。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/01_tensors.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Real CPU tensors: dtype, shape, device and Python conversion.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    values = torch.tensor([[1., 2.], [3., 4.]], dtype=torch.float32)\n    result = {\"shape\": list(values.shape), \"dtype\": str(values.dtype), \"device\": str(values.device),\n              \"sum\": values.sum().item(), \"matmul\": (values @ values.T).tolist()}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [最新正式發布](https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0)\n- [官方入門](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "pytorch", "name": "先看全貌：PyTorch 如何讓模型學習", "html": "先看全貌：PyTorch 如何讓模型學習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "從一個預測問題開始", "html": "從一個預測問題開始", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "五個角色與一次更新", "html": "五個角色與一次更新", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "執行與觀察", "html": "執行與觀察", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整學習路線", "html": "完整學習路線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "02-installation", "group": "start", "title": "安裝最新版：Python、CPU、CUDA 與環境檢查", "summary": "建立隔離環境，知道安裝了哪個套件，以及硬體能力如何確認。", "tags": ["install", "venv", "CUDA", "2.15.0"], "html": "<h1 id=\"pythoncpucuda\">安裝最新版：Python、CPU、CUDA 與環境檢查</h1>\n<p>建立隔離環境，知道安裝了哪個套件，以及硬體能力如何確認。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先分清三個版本</h2>\n<p>Python 版本決定可安裝哪個 wheel；PyTorch 版本決定 API；GPU driver 與所選套件的 CUDA runtime 決定能否使用 GPU。<code>nvidia-smi</code> 顯示的 CUDA 相容能力，與 <code>torch.version.cuda</code> 顯示的套件建置 runtime，含義不同。CPU 版出現 <code>None</code> 是正常結果。</p>\n<p>2.15.0 的 Python 套件需求為 3.11 以上。本課實測使用 Python 3.11。先用 <code>python --version</code> 與 <code>python -m pip --version</code> 確認同一個解譯器，再在專案根目錄操作。新版 Python 可用性仍需確認對應平台 wheel 與相依套件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"windows-cpu\">Windows 的 CPU 安裝流程</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">11</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">venv</span> <span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span> <span class=\"n\">install</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-upgrade</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">pip</span> <span class=\"n\">install</span> <span class=\"n\">-r</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">requirements</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">txt</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-index-url</span> <span class=\"n\">https</span><span class=\"p\">://</span><span class=\"n\">download</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">org</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">whl</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">cpu</span>\n<span class=\"p\">.\\.</span><span class=\"n\">venv</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">Scripts</span><span class=\"p\">\\</span><span class=\"n\">python</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exe</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">01_tensors</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>這裡直接指定 venv 的 Python，不必修改 PowerShell execution policy。解壓範例包後若目前就在 <code>examples</code>，需求檔改用 <code>requirements.txt</code>，入口改用 <code>01_tensors.py</code>。macOS／Linux 對應 <code>.venv/bin/python</code>；CPU wheel 的平台支援以官方索引為準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">確認環境真的可用</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sys</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sys</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">executable</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">__version__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">version</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_available</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>本課 CPU 結果應包含 <code>2.15.0+cpu</code>、CUDA <code>None</code>、False 與 tensor(6.)。只看 pip 安裝成功不夠；實際 import 會揭露缺少 runtime 或解譯器用錯的問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nvidia-gpu\">要使用 NVIDIA GPU 時</h2>\n<p>到官方安裝選擇器選擇 OS、pip 與符合 driver 的 CUDA build，另開 GPU venv 安裝。不要把 CPU 的 index 指令直接沿用。一般預建 wheel 帶有所需 runtime 依賴；自行編譯 CUDA extension 才會涉及額外 toolkit 與編譯器。沒有 GPU 仍可完成主線。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">常見失敗與練習</h2>\n<p>找不到版本：先看 Python、64 位元架構與 wheel 支援。IDE import 失敗但終端成功：比對 <code>sys.executable</code>。CUDA False：檢查是否裝成 CPU build、driver 與裝置可見性。練習：把目前環境四個資訊存成文字；解答：至少記錄 Python、Torch、build runtime、GPU 可用性，避免只寫「已裝最新版」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://pytorch.org/get-started/locally/\">官方安裝選擇器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/torch/2.15.0/\">2.15.0 套件資訊</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 安裝最新版：Python、CPU、CUDA 與環境檢查\n\n建立隔離環境，知道安裝了哪個套件，以及硬體能力如何確認。\n\n## 先分清三個版本\n\nPython 版本決定可安裝哪個 wheel；PyTorch 版本決定 API；GPU driver 與所選套件的 CUDA runtime 決定能否使用 GPU。`nvidia-smi` 顯示的 CUDA 相容能力，與 `torch.version.cuda` 顯示的套件建置 runtime，含義不同。CPU 版出現 `None` 是正常結果。\n\n2.15.0 的 Python 套件需求為 3.11 以上。本課實測使用 Python 3.11。先用 `python --version` 與 `python -m pip --version` 確認同一個解譯器，再在專案根目錄操作。新版 Python 可用性仍需確認對應平台 wheel 與相依套件。\n\n## Windows 的 CPU 安裝流程\n\n```powershell\npy -3.11 -m venv .venv\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pip install --upgrade pip\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe -m pip install -r pytorch/examples/requirements.txt --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe pytorch/examples/01_tensors.py\n```\n\n這裡直接指定 venv 的 Python，不必修改 PowerShell execution policy。解壓範例包後若目前就在 `examples`，需求檔改用 `requirements.txt`，入口改用 `01_tensors.py`。macOS／Linux 對應 `.venv/bin/python`；CPU wheel 的平台支援以官方索引為準。\n\n## 確認環境真的可用\n\n```python\nimport sys, torch\nprint(sys.executable)\nprint(torch.__version__)\nprint(torch.version.cuda)\nprint(torch.cuda.is_available())\nprint(torch.ones(2, 3).sum())\n```\n\n本課 CPU 結果應包含 `2.15.0+cpu`、CUDA `None`、False 與 tensor(6.)。只看 pip 安裝成功不夠；實際 import 會揭露缺少 runtime 或解譯器用錯的問題。\n\n## 要使用 NVIDIA GPU 時\n\n到官方安裝選擇器選擇 OS、pip 與符合 driver 的 CUDA build，另開 GPU venv 安裝。不要把 CPU 的 index 指令直接沿用。一般預建 wheel 帶有所需 runtime 依賴；自行編譯 CUDA extension 才會涉及額外 toolkit 與編譯器。沒有 GPU 仍可完成主線。\n\n## 常見失敗與練習\n\n找不到版本：先看 Python、64 位元架構與 wheel 支援。IDE import 失敗但終端成功：比對 `sys.executable`。CUDA False：檢查是否裝成 CPU build、driver 與裝置可見性。練習：把目前環境四個資訊存成文字；解答：至少記錄 Python、Torch、build runtime、GPU 可用性，避免只寫「已裝最新版」。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [官方安裝選擇器](https://pytorch.org/get-started/locally/)\n- [2.15.0 套件資訊](https://pypi.org/project/torch/2.15.0/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "pythoncpucuda", "name": "安裝最新版：Python、CPU、CUDA 與環境檢查", "html": "安裝最新版：Python、CPU、CUDA 與環境檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先分清三個版本", "html": "先分清三個版本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "windows-cpu", "name": "Windows 的 CPU 安裝流程", "html": "Windows 的 CPU 安裝流程", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "確認環境真的可用", "html": "確認環境真的可用", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "nvidia-gpu", "name": "要使用 NVIDIA GPU 時", "html": "要使用 NVIDIA GPU 時", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "常見失敗與練習", "html": "常見失敗與練習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "03-project", "group": "start", "title": "專案與執行方式：從 Notebook 到可重現腳本", "summary": "整理入口、資料、設定與產出，避免程式只在目前工作目錄能執行。", "tags": ["Python", "CLI", "project"], "html": "<h1 id=\"notebook\">專案與執行方式：從 Notebook 到可重現腳本</h1>\n<p>整理入口、資料、設定與產出，避免程式只在目前工作目錄能執行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">一個小型工程的邊界</h2>\n<p>Notebook 適合逐步觀察；正式訓練還需要可重新啟動的腳本。核心邏輯放模組，入口只負責讀取參數、呼叫功能與印出摘要。重新執行檔案應建立新的模型，而不是依賴 Notebook 上一格殘留的 optimizer 或梯度。</p>\n<p>範例包有 24 個編號入口、<code>course_core.py</code>、<code>data/custom_samples.json</code>、需求檔與測試。保留整個 <code>examples</code> 資料夾；只複製入口會缺少共用實作。核心模組也是可閱讀原稿，後續完整專題會逐一追蹤它的函式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">檔案路徑與程式入口</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"n\">DATA</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"vm\">__file__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resolve</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parent</span> <span class=\"o\">/</span> <span class=\"s1\">&#39;data&#39;</span> <span class=\"o\">/</span> <span class=\"s1\">&#39;custom_samples.json&#39;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">DATA</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_file</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s1\">&#39;__main__&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p><code>__file__</code> 是程式位置，cwd 是啟動位置。資料路徑相對於程式檔解析，才能從另一個資料夾執行。Windows 多程序也需要 main guard，否則 child import 可能再次啟動訓練。Notebook 不一定提供 <code>__file__</code>，需明確傳資料路徑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">設定、日誌與產物</h2>\n<p>將 seed、batch_size、learning_rate、epochs、模型尺寸整理為設定。實驗輸出記錄 Torch／Python 版本、資料版本、切分方式、前處理與 best checkpoint 準則。模型檔名用新的 run 目錄，避免相同名稱覆蓋先前實驗。本課預設使用 temporary directory，不會到處留下 <code>.pt</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"text\"><pre><span></span><code>my_project/\n  train.py       CLI 入口\n  model.py       模型與 forward\n  data.py        Dataset 與前處理\n  tests/         數值與流程檢查\n  runs/run_001/  設定、metrics、checkpoint\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">讀得懂錯誤訊息</h2>\n<p>由 traceback 最後一段向上看，找出你自己的第一個檔案與行號。<code>ModuleNotFoundError</code> 通常是環境或檔案缺少；shape mismatch 是資料契約；device mismatch 是移動位置不一致。先分類，再縮小到一筆資料，不必每次重新訓練十個 epoch。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>從不同 cwd 執行第 5 例，確認 JSON 仍可讀取。解答的關鍵是以 <code>Path(__file__).parent</code> 建路徑，並一起保留 data 目錄。再刻意只複製單一入口到空資料夾：若找不到 course_core，不是 pip 的 Torch 有問題，而是程式自己的模組未一起搬移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/modules.html\">Python 模組與 main</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html\">PyTorch 入門程式結構</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 專案與執行方式：從 Notebook 到可重現腳本\n\n整理入口、資料、設定與產出，避免程式只在目前工作目錄能執行。\n\n## 一個小型工程的邊界\n\nNotebook 適合逐步觀察；正式訓練還需要可重新啟動的腳本。核心邏輯放模組，入口只負責讀取參數、呼叫功能與印出摘要。重新執行檔案應建立新的模型，而不是依賴 Notebook 上一格殘留的 optimizer 或梯度。\n\n範例包有 24 個編號入口、`course_core.py`、`data/custom_samples.json`、需求檔與測試。保留整個 `examples` 資料夾；只複製入口會缺少共用實作。核心模組也是可閱讀原稿，後續完整專題會逐一追蹤它的函式。\n\n## 檔案路徑與程式入口\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\nDATA = Path(__file__).resolve().parent / 'data' / 'custom_samples.json'\n\ndef main():\n    print(DATA.is_file())\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n```\n\n`__file__` 是程式位置，cwd 是啟動位置。資料路徑相對於程式檔解析，才能從另一個資料夾執行。Windows 多程序也需要 main guard，否則 child import 可能再次啟動訓練。Notebook 不一定提供 `__file__`，需明確傳資料路徑。\n\n## 設定、日誌與產物\n\n將 seed、batch_size、learning_rate、epochs、模型尺寸整理為設定。實驗輸出記錄 Torch／Python 版本、資料版本、切分方式、前處理與 best checkpoint 準則。模型檔名用新的 run 目錄，避免相同名稱覆蓋先前實驗。本課預設使用 temporary directory，不會到處留下 `.pt`。\n\n```text\nmy_project/\n  train.py       CLI 入口\n  model.py       模型與 forward\n  data.py        Dataset 與前處理\n  tests/         數值與流程檢查\n  runs/run_001/  設定、metrics、checkpoint\n```\n\n## 讀得懂錯誤訊息\n\n由 traceback 最後一段向上看，找出你自己的第一個檔案與行號。`ModuleNotFoundError` 通常是環境或檔案缺少；shape mismatch 是資料契約；device mismatch 是移動位置不一致。先分類，再縮小到一筆資料，不必每次重新訓練十個 epoch。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n從不同 cwd 執行第 5 例，確認 JSON 仍可讀取。解答的關鍵是以 `Path(__file__).parent` 建路徑，並一起保留 data 目錄。再刻意只複製單一入口到空資料夾：若找不到 course_core，不是 pip 的 Torch 有問題，而是程式自己的模組未一起搬移。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Python 模組與 main](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/modules.html)\n- [PyTorch 入門程式結構](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "notebook", "name": "專案與執行方式：從 Notebook 到可重現腳本", "html": "專案與執行方式：從 Notebook 到可重現腳本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "一個小型工程的邊界", "html": "一個小型工程的邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "檔案路徑與程式入口", "html": "檔案路徑與程式入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "設定、日誌與產物", "html": "設定、日誌與產物", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "讀得懂錯誤訊息", "html": "讀得懂錯誤訊息", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "04-tensors", "group": "start", "title": "Tensor 的數值契約：建立、dtype、device 與共享儲存", "summary": "學會辨認一個 Tensor 的四個基本屬性，以及資料轉換的成本。", "tags": ["Tensor", "dtype", "device", "NumPy"], "html": "<h1 id=\"tensor-dtypedevice\">Tensor 的數值契約：建立、dtype、device 與共享儲存</h1>\n<p>學會辨認一個 Tensor 的四個基本屬性，以及資料轉換的成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">數值之外還有什麼</h2>\n<p>Tensor 不只是巢狀 list。至少要讀 shape、dtype、device、requires_grad。<code>torch.tensor([1,2])</code> 通常推斷整數，而模型特徵多用 float32；分類索引使用 long。兩者都能印出數字，不表示可以交換使用。浮點 Tensor 才能參與一般可微分訓練。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">常見建立方式</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">]],</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">float32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">zeros</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ones</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones_like</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">indices</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">long</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">noise</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Generator</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p><code>zeros_like</code> 等方式沿用參照 Tensor 的屬性，適合避免忘記 device；但仍要確認實際 dtype 是否符合任務。<code>torch.empty</code> 是未初始化空間，不能把讀到的任意值當作隨機分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">轉換與拷貝的選擇</h2>\n<p><code>.to(dtype=torch.float32)</code> 或 <code>.to(device)</code> 回傳轉換結果；通常要接回變數。<code>torch.tensor(existing)</code> 用來建立拷貝時應注意它會切斷原有計算歷史，需保留微分路徑時使用 Tensor 運算或 clone。NumPy 的 <code>from_numpy</code> 對可支援的 CPU array 會共用記憶體，任一側修改都可能影響另一側；跨 GPU 則需要搬移。</p>\n<p><code>x.item()</code> 只適合單元素 Tensor，轉成 Python 數字後不再有可微分路徑。做訓練日誌可以 <code>loss.detach().item()</code>；若把這個數字再拿來 backward，計算圖已不在。GPU 每批取 item 也可能帶來同步成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">小心數值精度</h2>\n<p>float32 約有七位十進位有效數字，不代表任何運算都精確。大數加小數、很多項相加與不同順序都可能有誤差。測試用 <code>torch.testing.assert_close</code> 設合理容許值；標籤、索引與 shape 則應精確相等。需要梯度檢查時常用 double，並非所有訓練都改 float64。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>建立特徵 <code>[8,4]</code> 與標籤 <code>[8]</code>，列出正確 dtype。解答：特徵 float32、類別索引 long。再比較 <code>a.detach()</code> 與 <code>a.detach().clone()</code> 是否共享數值，第 7 章會實測。讀入整數 JSON 特徵時明確指定 dtype，比期待自動推斷更可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensors.html\">Tensor API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensor_attributes.html\">Tensor attributes</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Tensor 的數值契約：建立、dtype、device 與共享儲存\n\n學會辨認一個 Tensor 的四個基本屬性，以及資料轉換的成本。\n\n## 數值之外還有什麼\n\nTensor 不只是巢狀 list。至少要讀 shape、dtype、device、requires_grad。`torch.tensor([1,2])` 通常推斷整數，而模型特徵多用 float32；分類索引使用 long。兩者都能印出數字，不表示可以交換使用。浮點 Tensor 才能參與一般可微分訓練。\n\n## 常見建立方式\n\n```python\nimport torch\nx = torch.tensor([[1., 2.], [3., 4.]], dtype=torch.float32)\nzeros = torch.zeros(2, 3)\nones = torch.ones_like(x)\nindices = torch.arange(4, dtype=torch.long)\nnoise = torch.randn(2, 3, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(7))\nprint(x.shape, x.dtype, x.device, x.requires_grad)\n```\n\n`zeros_like` 等方式沿用參照 Tensor 的屬性，適合避免忘記 device；但仍要確認實際 dtype 是否符合任務。`torch.empty` 是未初始化空間，不能把讀到的任意值當作隨機分布。\n\n## 轉換與拷貝的選擇\n\n`.to(dtype=torch.float32)` 或 `.to(device)` 回傳轉換結果；通常要接回變數。`torch.tensor(existing)` 用來建立拷貝時應注意它會切斷原有計算歷史，需保留微分路徑時使用 Tensor 運算或 clone。NumPy 的 `from_numpy` 對可支援的 CPU array 會共用記憶體，任一側修改都可能影響另一側；跨 GPU 則需要搬移。\n\n`x.item()` 只適合單元素 Tensor，轉成 Python 數字後不再有可微分路徑。做訓練日誌可以 `loss.detach().item()`；若把這個數字再拿來 backward，計算圖已不在。GPU 每批取 item 也可能帶來同步成本。\n\n## 小心數值精度\n\nfloat32 約有七位十進位有效數字，不代表任何運算都精確。大數加小數、很多項相加與不同順序都可能有誤差。測試用 `torch.testing.assert_close` 設合理容許值；標籤、索引與 shape 則應精確相等。需要梯度檢查時常用 double，並非所有訓練都改 float64。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n建立特徵 `[8,4]` 與標籤 `[8]`，列出正確 dtype。解答：特徵 float32、類別索引 long。再比較 `a.detach()` 與 `a.detach().clone()` 是否共享數值，第 7 章會實測。讀入整數 JSON 特徵時明確指定 dtype，比期待自動推斷更可靠。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Tensor API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensors.html)\n- [Tensor attributes](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensor_attributes.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "tensor-dtypedevice", "name": "Tensor 的數值契約：建立、dtype、device 與共享儲存", "html": "Tensor 的數值契約：建立、dtype、device 與共享儲存", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "數值之外還有什麼", "html": "數值之外還有什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "常見建立方式", "html": "常見建立方式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "轉換與拷貝的選擇", "html": "轉換與拷貝的選擇", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "小心數值精度", "html": "小心數值精度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "05-shapes", "group": "start", "title": "Shape 與軸：索引、切片、維度變換與 reduction", "summary": "在每一步寫下維度，避免數字可以計算但意義已經錯位。", "tags": ["shape", "indexing", "keepdim"], "example": "02_shapes.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"shape-reduction\">Shape 與軸：索引、切片、維度變換與 reduction</h1>\n<p>在每一步寫下維度，避免數字可以計算但意義已經錯位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">每個軸都要有名字</h2>\n<p><code>[N,F]</code> 表示 N 筆樣本與 F 個特徵；<code>[N,C,H,W]</code> 表示影像 batch、channel、高、寬；<code>[N,T,D]</code> 表示序列位置與表示維度。相同數量的元素可以有不同意義。<code>reshape</code> 不會理解哪一軸是時間，更不會自動把 HWC 圖片變成 CHW。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">索引會不會消掉維度</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">float32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>       <span class=\"c1\"># [4]，第一個軸消失</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>     <span class=\"c1\"># [1,4]，保留 batch</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[:,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>    <span class=\"c1\"># [3]</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[:,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># [3,1]</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>                 <span class=\"c1\"># [3]</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">keepdim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>   <span class=\"c1\"># [3,1]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p><code>dim=1</code> 是消去／聚合第 1 軸，並不是「取第一列」。keepdim 保留長度 1 的軸，便於後續廣播。讀程式時以軸名稱代替純數字，例如「對每筆樣本的 feature 平均」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"unsqueezesqueezepermute\">unsqueeze、squeeze、permute</h2>\n<p><code>unsqueeze(1)</code> 將 <code>[N]</code> 變 <code>[N,1]</code>；<code>squeeze(1)</code> 只移除指定長度為 1 的軸。無參數 squeeze 可能把 batch_size=1 的 batch 軸也刪掉，造成訓練時正常、單筆推論失敗。影像 HWC→CHW 使用 permute(2,0,1)，因為它是調換軸，不是單純重排形狀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">最容易漏掉的回歸錯誤</h2>\n<p>預測 <code>[4,1]</code> 減答案 <code>[4]</code>，得到 <code>[4,4]</code>，每一筆預測竟與四個答案比較。程式不一定報錯，loss 甚至會下降。先明確決定回歸契約是兩者 <code>[N,1]</code> 或兩者 <code>[N]</code>，並在 loss 前 assert 相等。第 6 章解釋這是廣播規則的結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p><code>x[2,3,4]</code> 對 dim=1 求和，keepdim=False 輸出 <code>[2,4]</code>；True 為 <code>[2,1,4]</code>。若每個樣本要有一個分數，需再決定聚合哪一軸。不要用 <code>view(-1)</code> 抹平所有維度來消除錯誤，因為那同時抹去了 batch 的意義。執行範例，親眼核對錯誤與修正後的差值形狀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/02_shapes.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Broadcasting is real tensor arithmetic; accepted shapes may still be wrong.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">prediction</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">target</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">float32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;prediction&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;target&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;wrong_difference&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;correct_difference&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unsqueeze</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;keepdim_mean&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">keepdim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensors.html\">Tensor 維度操作</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/broadcasting.html\">Broadcasting</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Shape 與軸：索引、切片、維度變換與 reduction\n\n在每一步寫下維度，避免數字可以計算但意義已經錯位。\n\n## 每個軸都要有名字\n\n`[N,F]` 表示 N 筆樣本與 F 個特徵；`[N,C,H,W]` 表示影像 batch、channel、高、寬；`[N,T,D]` 表示序列位置與表示維度。相同數量的元素可以有不同意義。`reshape` 不會理解哪一軸是時間，更不會自動把 HWC 圖片變成 CHW。\n\n## 索引會不會消掉維度\n\n```python\nimport torch\nx = torch.arange(12, dtype=torch.float32).reshape(3, 4)\nprint(x[0].shape)       # [4]，第一個軸消失\nprint(x[0:1].shape)     # [1,4]，保留 batch\nprint(x[:, 1].shape)    # [3]\nprint(x[:, 1:2].shape)  # [3,1]\nprint(x.sum(dim=1).shape)                 # [3]\nprint(x.mean(dim=1, keepdim=True).shape)   # [3,1]\n```\n\n`dim=1` 是消去／聚合第 1 軸，並不是「取第一列」。keepdim 保留長度 1 的軸，便於後續廣播。讀程式時以軸名稱代替純數字，例如「對每筆樣本的 feature 平均」。\n\n## unsqueeze、squeeze、permute\n\n`unsqueeze(1)` 將 `[N]` 變 `[N,1]`；`squeeze(1)` 只移除指定長度為 1 的軸。無參數 squeeze 可能把 batch_size=1 的 batch 軸也刪掉，造成訓練時正常、單筆推論失敗。影像 HWC→CHW 使用 permute(2,0,1)，因為它是調換軸，不是單純重排形狀。\n\n## 最容易漏掉的回歸錯誤\n\n預測 `[4,1]` 減答案 `[4]`，得到 `[4,4]`，每一筆預測竟與四個答案比較。程式不一定報錯，loss 甚至會下降。先明確決定回歸契約是兩者 `[N,1]` 或兩者 `[N]`，並在 loss 前 assert 相等。第 6 章解釋這是廣播規則的結果。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n`x[2,3,4]` 對 dim=1 求和，keepdim=False 輸出 `[2,4]`；True 為 `[2,1,4]`。若每個樣本要有一個分數，需再決定聚合哪一軸。不要用 `view(-1)` 抹平所有維度來消除錯誤，因為那同時抹去了 batch 的意義。執行範例，親眼核對錯誤與修正後的差值形狀。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/02_shapes.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Broadcasting is real tensor arithmetic; accepted shapes may still be wrong.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    prediction = torch.zeros(4, 1)\n    target = torch.arange(4, dtype=torch.float32)\n    result = {\"prediction\": list(prediction.shape), \"target\": list(target.shape),\n              \"wrong_difference\": list((prediction-target).shape),\n              \"correct_difference\": list((prediction-target.unsqueeze(1)).shape),\n              \"keepdim_mean\": list(prediction.mean(dim=0, keepdim=True).shape)}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Tensor 維度操作](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensors.html)\n- [Broadcasting](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/broadcasting.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "shape-reduction", "name": "Shape 與軸：索引、切片、維度變換與 reduction", "html": "Shape 與軸：索引、切片、維度變換與 reduction", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "每個軸都要有名字", "html": "每個軸都要有名字", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "索引會不會消掉維度", "html": "索引會不會消掉維度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "unsqueezesqueezepermute", "name": "unsqueeze、squeeze、permute", "html": "unsqueeze、squeeze、permute", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "最容易漏掉的回歸錯誤", "html": "最容易漏掉的回歸錯誤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "06-broadcasting", "group": "start", "title": "運算與 Broadcasting：從逐元素到矩陣乘法", "summary": "用具體形狀推算廣播，理解向量化何時正確、何時會意外放大資料。", "tags": ["broadcasting", "matmul", "vectorization"], "html": "<h1 id=\"broadcasting\">運算與 Broadcasting：從逐元素到矩陣乘法</h1>\n<p>用具體形狀推算廣播，理解向量化何時正確、何時會意外放大資料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">逐元素與線性代數</h2>\n<p><code>a*b</code> 是逐元素乘法，<code>a@b</code> 是矩陣乘法。輸入 <code>[N,F]</code> 與權重 <code>[F,C]</code> 矩陣乘積為 <code>[N,C]</code>，每一項是 F 個特徵的加權和。若兩邊同為 <code>[N,F]</code>，逐元素相乘不會幫你聚合 feature；你還需要決定 sum 的軸。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nZ_{n,c}=\\sum_{f=1}^{F} X_{n,f}W_{f,c}+b_c\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">廣播的檢查方法</h2>\n<p>從最右邊對齊各軸，缺少的軸視為 1。兩邊相同或其中一邊是 1 才相容。<code>[3,4] + [4] → [3,4]</code>；<code>[3,4] + [3,1] → [3,4]</code>；<code>[3,4] + [3]</code> 則不相容。這是運算規則，不代表語意正確。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">12.</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">column_bias</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">3.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">4.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">row_mean</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">keepdim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">column_bias</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">row_mean</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"k\">try</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"k\">except</span> <span class=\"ne\">RuntimeError</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">向量化的好處與代價</h2>\n<p>以批次 Tensor 取代 Python 每筆迴圈，通常減少解譯器與裝置呼叫開銷。但 <code>[N,1,D] - [1,M,D]</code> 會產生 <code>[N,M,D]</code> 中間結果；N、M 都很大時，記憶體可能先爆掉。可以分塊或改用矩陣恆等式。廣播讀取本身常以 stride 表示，後續運算輸出仍可能很大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"batch\">batch 矩陣乘法</h2>\n<p><code>[B,N,F] @ [B,F,C] → [B,N,C]</code>，最後兩軸做矩陣乘法，前面的 batch 軸依規則對齊。先從二維推演，再擴充高維，不要依賴試到沒有報錯。<code>nn.Linear(F,C)</code> 的儲存權重為 <code>[C,F]</code>，forward 會使用合適的轉置，與自己寫 <code>[F,C]</code> 的數學記號要分清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p><code>[8,1] - [8]</code> 為何變成 <code>[8,8]</code>？答案：右邊補成 <code>[1,8]</code>，兩個軸分別擴張。若想逐樣本比較，將標籤 unsqueeze(1)，或只對預測 squeeze(1)。若把 pairwise 距離當逐筆 loss，即使沒有 runtime error，學習目標也已改變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/broadcasting.html\">廣播規則</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/torch.html#blas-and-lapack-operations\">torch.matmul</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 運算與 Broadcasting：從逐元素到矩陣乘法\n\n用具體形狀推算廣播，理解向量化何時正確、何時會意外放大資料。\n\n## 逐元素與線性代數\n\n`a*b` 是逐元素乘法，`a@b` 是矩陣乘法。輸入 `[N,F]` 與權重 `[F,C]` 矩陣乘積為 `[N,C]`，每一項是 F 個特徵的加權和。若兩邊同為 `[N,F]`，逐元素相乘不會幫你聚合 feature；你還需要決定 sum 的軸。\n\n$$\nZ_{n,c}=\\sum_{f=1}^{F} X_{n,f}W_{f,c}+b_c\n$$\n\n## 廣播的檢查方法\n\n從最右邊對齊各軸，缺少的軸視為 1。兩邊相同或其中一邊是 1 才相容。`[3,4] + [4] → [3,4]`；`[3,4] + [3,1] → [3,4]`；`[3,4] + [3]` 則不相容。這是運算規則，不代表語意正確。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nx = torch.arange(12.).reshape(3,4)\ncolumn_bias = torch.tensor([1.,2.,3.,4.])\nrow_mean = x.mean(dim=1, keepdim=True)\nprint((x + column_bias).shape)\nprint((x - row_mean).mean(dim=1))\ntry:\n    print(x + torch.ones(3))\nexcept RuntimeError as error:\n    print(type(error).__name__)\n```\n\n## 向量化的好處與代價\n\n以批次 Tensor 取代 Python 每筆迴圈，通常減少解譯器與裝置呼叫開銷。但 `[N,1,D] - [1,M,D]` 會產生 `[N,M,D]` 中間結果；N、M 都很大時，記憶體可能先爆掉。可以分塊或改用矩陣恆等式。廣播讀取本身常以 stride 表示，後續運算輸出仍可能很大。\n\n## batch 矩陣乘法\n\n`[B,N,F] @ [B,F,C] → [B,N,C]`，最後兩軸做矩陣乘法，前面的 batch 軸依規則對齊。先從二維推演，再擴充高維，不要依賴試到沒有報錯。`nn.Linear(F,C)` 的儲存權重為 `[C,F]`，forward 會使用合適的轉置，與自己寫 `[F,C]` 的數學記號要分清楚。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n`[8,1] - [8]` 為何變成 `[8,8]`？答案：右邊補成 `[1,8]`，兩個軸分別擴張。若想逐樣本比較，將標籤 unsqueeze(1)，或只對預測 squeeze(1)。若把 pairwise 距離當逐筆 loss，即使沒有 runtime error，學習目標也已改變。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [廣播規則](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/broadcasting.html)\n- [torch.matmul](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/torch.html#blas-and-lapack-operations)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "broadcasting", "name": "運算與 Broadcasting：從逐元素到矩陣乘法", "html": "運算與 Broadcasting：從逐元素到矩陣乘法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "逐元素與線性代數", "html": "逐元素與線性代數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "廣播的檢查方法", "html": "廣播的檢查方法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "向量化的好處與代價", "html": "向量化的好處與代價", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "batch", "name": "batch 矩陣乘法", "html": "batch 矩陣乘法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "07-views", "group": "grad", "title": "Views、stride 與資料共享：reshape 為何有時複製", "summary": "分清資料的形狀、記憶體布局、共享關係與計算圖關係。", "tags": ["view", "stride", "reshape", "detach", "clone"], "example": "03_views.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"viewsstride-reshape\">Views、stride 與資料共享：reshape 為何有時複製</h1>\n<p>分清資料的形狀、記憶體布局、共享關係與計算圖關係。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">形狀相同不代表布局相同</h2>\n<p>連續矩陣的 stride 告訴你，沿某軸前進一格需跳過多少儲存元素。<code>[3,4]</code> 的典型 stride 是 <code>(4,1)</code>；轉置後 shape <code>[4,3]</code>、stride <code>(1,4)</code>，通常共用原儲存空間。轉置不必先重新排出整塊資料，所以成本小，但不是每種 view 都能直接接在後面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"viewreshapecontiguous\">view、reshape、contiguous</h2>\n<p>view 要求新 shape 與現有 stride 相容，無法滿足時報錯；reshape 可能回傳 view，也可能複製。contiguous 在需要時建立連續布局。不要用「reshape 永遠零拷貝」估算記憶體，也不要遇到任何錯誤都加 contiguous；先確認是否真的需要該順序與布局。</p>\n<h2 id=\"detach-clone\">detach 與 clone 是不同軸線</h2>\n<p>detach 切斷 Autograd 關係，通常仍共享儲存；clone 複製數值，但在一般 grad mode 下可保留微分路徑。要取得不連計算圖、又不受模型後續更新影響的快照，用 <code>value.detach().cpu().clone()</code>。移到 CPU 若原本就在 CPU 可能沒有複製，因此不能只靠 <code>.cpu()</code> 保證獨立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">用實驗建立直覺</h2>\n<p>執行範例，觀察 transpose 後 view 失敗、reshape 成功，再看透過 detached tensor 的 in-place 修改如何改到原值。這裡為了展示共享才修改；訓練中若動到 backward 保存的值，可能觸發版本檢查或破壞假設。不要使用 <code>.data</code> 繞過這些檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>你寫 <code>best = model.state_dict()</code> 後繼續訓練，best 還是當時最好的模型嗎？解答：不能這樣假設；state_dict 的 Tensor 可仍引用目前參數。對每個值 detach、CPU、clone，或立即寫檔，再繼續更新。這正是第 23、31 章保存 best checkpoint 的重點。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/03_views.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Contiguity, shared storage, reshape, detach and clone.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">6.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">float32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">transposed</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">T</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">try</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">transposed</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">view</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">view_failed</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">False</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">except</span> <span class=\"ne\">RuntimeError</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">view_failed</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">True</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">detached</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">cloned</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">detached</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">99</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;original_stride&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stride</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;transpose_stride&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">transposed</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">stride</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;view_failed&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">view_failed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;reshape&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">transposed</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tolist</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;detach_changed_original&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;clone_unchanged&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">cloned</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensor_view.html\">Tensor Views</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html\">序列化與 storage</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Views、stride 與資料共享：reshape 為何有時複製\n\n分清資料的形狀、記憶體布局、共享關係與計算圖關係。\n\n## 形狀相同不代表布局相同\n\n連續矩陣的 stride 告訴你，沿某軸前進一格需跳過多少儲存元素。`[3,4]` 的典型 stride 是 `(4,1)`；轉置後 shape `[4,3]`、stride `(1,4)`，通常共用原儲存空間。轉置不必先重新排出整塊資料，所以成本小，但不是每種 view 都能直接接在後面。\n\n## view、reshape、contiguous\n\nview 要求新 shape 與現有 stride 相容，無法滿足時報錯；reshape 可能回傳 view，也可能複製。contiguous 在需要時建立連續布局。不要用「reshape 永遠零拷貝」估算記憶體，也不要遇到任何錯誤都加 contiguous；先確認是否真的需要該順序與布局。\n\n## detach 與 clone 是不同軸線\n\ndetach 切斷 Autograd 關係，通常仍共享儲存；clone 複製數值，但在一般 grad mode 下可保留微分路徑。要取得不連計算圖、又不受模型後續更新影響的快照，用 `value.detach().cpu().clone()`。移到 CPU 若原本就在 CPU 可能沒有複製，因此不能只靠 `.cpu()` 保證獨立。\n\n## 用實驗建立直覺\n\n執行範例，觀察 transpose 後 view 失敗、reshape 成功，再看透過 detached tensor 的 in-place 修改如何改到原值。這裡為了展示共享才修改；訓練中若動到 backward 保存的值，可能觸發版本檢查或破壞假設。不要使用 `.data` 繞過這些檢查。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n你寫 `best = model.state_dict()` 後繼續訓練，best 還是當時最好的模型嗎？解答：不能這樣假設；state_dict 的 Tensor 可仍引用目前參數。對每個值 detach、CPU、clone，或立即寫檔，再繼續更新。這正是第 23、31 章保存 best checkpoint 的重點。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/03_views.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Contiguity, shared storage, reshape, detach and clone.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    x = torch.arange(6., dtype=torch.float32).reshape(2, 3)\n    transposed = x.T\n    try:\n        transposed.view(-1)\n        view_failed = False\n    except RuntimeError:\n        view_failed = True\n    detached = x.detach()\n    cloned = x.clone()\n    detached[0, 0] = 99\n    result = {\"original_stride\": list(x.stride()), \"transpose_stride\": list(transposed.stride()),\n              \"view_failed\": view_failed, \"reshape\": transposed.reshape(-1).tolist(),\n              \"detach_changed_original\": x[0, 0].item() == 99,\n              \"clone_unchanged\": cloned[0, 0].item() == 0}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Tensor Views](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensor_view.html)\n- [序列化與 storage](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "viewsstride-reshape", "name": "Views、stride 與資料共享：reshape 為何有時複製", "html": "Views、stride 與資料共享：reshape 為何有時複製", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "形狀相同不代表布局相同", "html": "形狀相同不代表布局相同", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "viewreshapecontiguous", "name": "view、reshape、contiguous", "html": "view、reshape、contiguous", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "detach-clone", "name": "detach 與 clone 是不同軸線", "html": "detach 與 clone 是不同軸線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "用實驗建立直覺", "html": "用實驗建立直覺", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "08-autograd", "group": "grad", "title": "Autograd：從手算偏導數到 backward", "summary": "用一個只有單一權重的例子，對照計算圖、leaf Tensor 與梯度。", "tags": ["autograd", "backward", "requires_grad"], "example": "04_autograd.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"autograd-backward\">Autograd：從手算偏導數到 backward</h1>\n<p>用一個只有單一權重的例子，對照計算圖、leaf Tensor 與梯度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先用數字算一次</h2>\n<p>令 x=3、w=2、目標 t=10，預測為 6、平方誤差為 16。loss 對 w 的導數為 -24，因此小幅增加 w 應讓預測接近目標。梯度的正負描述局部變化方向，optimizer 的負號才把它轉成下降更新。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL=(wx-t)^2,\\qquad \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}=2(wx-t)x=-24\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"tensor\">哪些 Tensor 需要梯度</h2>\n<p><code>w=torch.tensor(2.,requires_grad=True)</code> 是由你建立的 leaf。由 w 運算得到的 prediction 與 loss 有 grad_fn；一般 backward 後 leaf 的 <code>.grad</code> 被填入，中間非 leaf 預設不保存 <code>.grad</code>。看不到中間值的 grad 不代表它沒有參與反向傳播；需要觀察時可用 retain_grad。</p>\n<h2 id=\"backward\">backward 的輸入與輸出</h2>\n<p>標量 loss 可以直接 backward；非標量輸出需要指定上游梯度，或先做符合目標的 sum/mean。<code>loss.mean()</code> 會同時改變目標縮放，影響梯度大小。<code>torch.autograd.grad</code> 可直接回傳指定輸入的導數，適合梯度檢查或高階微分；它與把值累加進 <code>.grad</code> 的使用方式不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">可以觀察什麼</h2>\n<p>本章範例連續用相同 w 建立新的 forward，第一次梯度 -24，第二次累積為 -48，清成 None 再算回到 -24。數字完全可手算，適合先確認自己理解，再進入數百個參數的 MLP。記住「新計算圖」與「舊 <code>.grad</code> 是否清除」是兩件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若使用 SGD lr=0.01，第一次更新 w 是 <code>2 - .01*(-24)=2.24</code>，新預測 6.72、loss 約 10.7584。若 lr=1，w 變 26、loss 可能大幅增加；梯度正確不保證步長正確。修改範例加入 optimizer，核對權重和你的手算相同。不要以驗證集來挑每一批更新方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/04_autograd.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A scalar loss with hand-checkable gradient; two fresh forwards accumulate.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">w</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loss</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">first</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">accumulated</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;gradient&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;accumulated_gradient&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">accumulated</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;after_clear&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;hand_gradient&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd mechanics</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Autograd：從手算偏導數到 backward\n\n用一個只有單一權重的例子，對照計算圖、leaf Tensor 與梯度。\n\n## 先用數字算一次\n\n令 x=3、w=2、目標 t=10，預測為 6、平方誤差為 16。loss 對 w 的導數為 -24，因此小幅增加 w 應讓預測接近目標。梯度的正負描述局部變化方向，optimizer 的負號才把它轉成下降更新。\n\n$$\nL=(wx-t)^2,\\qquad \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}=2(wx-t)x=-24\n$$\n\n## 哪些 Tensor 需要梯度\n\n`w=torch.tensor(2.,requires_grad=True)` 是由你建立的 leaf。由 w 運算得到的 prediction 與 loss 有 grad_fn；一般 backward 後 leaf 的 `.grad` 被填入，中間非 leaf 預設不保存 `.grad`。看不到中間值的 grad 不代表它沒有參與反向傳播；需要觀察時可用 retain_grad。\n\n## backward 的輸入與輸出\n\n標量 loss 可以直接 backward；非標量輸出需要指定上游梯度，或先做符合目標的 sum/mean。`loss.mean()` 會同時改變目標縮放，影響梯度大小。`torch.autograd.grad` 可直接回傳指定輸入的導數，適合梯度檢查或高階微分；它與把值累加進 `.grad` 的使用方式不同。\n\n## 可以觀察什麼\n\n本章範例連續用相同 w 建立新的 forward，第一次梯度 -24，第二次累積為 -48，清成 None 再算回到 -24。數字完全可手算，適合先確認自己理解，再進入數百個參數的 MLP。記住「新計算圖」與「舊 `.grad` 是否清除」是兩件事。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若使用 SGD lr=0.01，第一次更新 w 是 `2 - .01*(-24)=2.24`，新預測 6.72、loss 約 10.7584。若 lr=1，w 變 26、loss 可能大幅增加；梯度正確不保證步長正確。修改範例加入 optimizer，核對權重和你的手算相同。不要以驗證集來挑每一批更新方向。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/04_autograd.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A scalar loss with hand-checkable gradient; two fresh forwards accumulate.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    w = torch.tensor(2., requires_grad=True)\n    loss = (w * 3 - 10).square()\n    loss.backward()\n    first = w.grad.item()\n    (w * 3 - 10).square().backward()\n    accumulated = w.grad.item()\n    w.grad = None\n    (w * 3 - 10).square().backward()\n    result = {\"loss\": loss.item(), \"gradient\": first, \"accumulated_gradient\": accumulated,\n              \"after_clear\": w.grad.item(), \"hand_gradient\": 2 * (2 * 3 - 10) * 3}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Autograd mechanics](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "autograd-backward", "name": "Autograd：從手算偏導數到 backward", "html": "Autograd：從手算偏導數到 backward", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先用數字算一次", "html": "先用數字算一次", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "tensor", "name": "哪些 Tensor 需要梯度", "html": "哪些 Tensor 需要梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "backward", "name": "backward 的輸入與輸出", "html": "backward 的輸入與輸出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "可以觀察什麼", "html": "可以觀察什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "09-graph-lifecycle", "group": "grad", "title": "計算圖生命週期與梯度累積：為什麼需要 zero_grad", "summary": "釐清每次 forward 的圖、反向保存的中間量，以及跨 batch 的梯度狀態。", "tags": ["zero_grad", "retain_graph", "graph", "gradient accumulation"], "html": "<h1 id=\"zero_grad\">計算圖生命週期與梯度累積：為什麼需要 zero_grad</h1>\n<p>釐清每次 forward 的圖、反向保存的中間量，以及跨 batch 的梯度狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">三種狀態分開看</h2>\n<p>參數是長期保存的 leaf；forward 建立本輪計算圖；<code>.grad</code> 是參數上的梯度緩衝。一般 backward 後會釋放用於反向計算的中間量，參數與已累積梯度仍存在。下一批 forward 建立新圖，但不會自動清除舊 grad。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">正確的最小迴圈</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">w</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Parameter</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.01</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">target</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">10.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">9.</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loss</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">w</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>zero_grad 在每次有效更新開始清除緩衝；backward 將這次梯度加入；step 讀取梯度。<code>set_to_none=True</code> 讓未得到梯度的參數維持 None，與數值全零並非所有 optimizer 情境都等價。不要使用 <code>if p.grad</code> 判斷 Tensor，應檢查 <code>p.grad is None</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"backward\">為什麼重複 backward 會失敗</h2>\n<p>對同一個 <code>loss</code> 呼叫兩次 backward，可能因保存量已釋放而失敗。通常應重新 forward。<code>retain_graph=True</code> 是需要重用同一圖做多次反向時的工具，不是所有錯誤的修復開關；不必要保留圖會增加記憶體。若想對導數再微分，則涉及 create_graph，目的也不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">日誌不要把圖留住</h2>\n<p><code>history.append(loss)</code> 可能讓 Python 容器一直引用圖。日誌使用 <code>loss.detach().item()</code>；需要批次預測來計算非微分指標時先 detach，必要時搬到 CPU。也不要把每批 loss 相加留到整個 epoch 才 backward，除非你刻意設計並承擔保存所有圖的成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>梯度累積是否永遠是 bug？不是；第 36 章將多個 microbatch 的正確加權梯度合成一次更新。差異在於你清楚知道有效群組何時開始、loss 如何縮放及何時 step。練習把上述 zero_grad 移除，比對第二輪 <code>.grad</code>：它同時包含前一輪導數，與逐批 SGD 不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd 圖的重建與保存</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html\">optimizer 梯度操作</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 計算圖生命週期與梯度累積：為什麼需要 zero_grad\n\n釐清每次 forward 的圖、反向保存的中間量，以及跨 batch 的梯度狀態。\n\n## 三種狀態分開看\n\n參數是長期保存的 leaf；forward 建立本輪計算圖；`.grad` 是參數上的梯度緩衝。一般 backward 後會釋放用於反向計算的中間量，參數與已累積梯度仍存在。下一批 forward 建立新圖，但不會自動清除舊 grad。\n\n## 正確的最小迴圈\n\n```python\nimport torch\nw = torch.nn.Parameter(torch.tensor(2.))\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD([w], lr=.01)\nfor target in [10., 9.]:\n    optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n    loss = (3*w - target).square()\n    loss.backward()\n    optimizer.step()\nprint(w.detach())\n```\n\nzero_grad 在每次有效更新開始清除緩衝；backward 將這次梯度加入；step 讀取梯度。`set_to_none=True` 讓未得到梯度的參數維持 None，與數值全零並非所有 optimizer 情境都等價。不要使用 `if p.grad` 判斷 Tensor，應檢查 `p.grad is None`。\n\n## 為什麼重複 backward 會失敗\n\n對同一個 `loss` 呼叫兩次 backward，可能因保存量已釋放而失敗。通常應重新 forward。`retain_graph=True` 是需要重用同一圖做多次反向時的工具，不是所有錯誤的修復開關；不必要保留圖會增加記憶體。若想對導數再微分，則涉及 create_graph，目的也不同。\n\n## 日誌不要把圖留住\n\n`history.append(loss)` 可能讓 Python 容器一直引用圖。日誌使用 `loss.detach().item()`；需要批次預測來計算非微分指標時先 detach，必要時搬到 CPU。也不要把每批 loss 相加留到整個 epoch 才 backward，除非你刻意設計並承擔保存所有圖的成本。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n梯度累積是否永遠是 bug？不是；第 36 章將多個 microbatch 的正確加權梯度合成一次更新。差異在於你清楚知道有效群組何時開始、loss 如何縮放及何時 step。練習把上述 zero_grad 移除，比對第二輪 `.grad`：它同時包含前一輪導數，與逐批 SGD 不同。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Autograd 圖的重建與保存](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [optimizer 梯度操作](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "zero_grad", "name": "計算圖生命週期與梯度累積：為什麼需要 zero_grad", "html": "計算圖生命週期與梯度累積：為什麼需要 zero_grad", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "三種狀態分開看", "html": "三種狀態分開看", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "正確的最小迴圈", "html": "正確的最小迴圈", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "backward", "name": "為什麼重複 backward 會失敗", "html": "為什麼重複 backward 會失敗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "日誌不要把圖留住", "html": "日誌不要把圖留住", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "10-gradient-debug", "group": "grad", "title": "梯度除錯：chain rule、gradcheck 與 in-place 操作", "summary": "以可手算與數值差分的實驗，區分圖被切斷、梯度為零與數值不穩。", "tags": ["gradcheck", "anomaly", "in-place", "chain rule"], "html": "<h1 id=\"chain-rulegradcheck-in-place\">梯度除錯：chain rule、gradcheck 與 in-place 操作</h1>\n<p>以可手算與數值差分的實驗，區分圖被切斷、梯度為零與數值不穩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"none\">梯度為 None 與零不一樣</h2>\n<p>None 常表示還沒 backward、不是被追蹤的 leaf、路徑沒用到該參數或剛被 zero_grad 清除。零可能是正確導數，例如 ReLU 負區間。先檢查 requires_grad、is_leaf、grad_fn 與 loss 是否真的連到該參數，再調 learning rate。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">中央差分當第二種證據</h2>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}\\approx\\frac{L(w+\\epsilon)-L(w-\\epsilon)}{2\\epsilon}\n$$</div>\n<p>epsilon 太大是截斷誤差，太小是浮點相減誤差。以 double、平滑函數與小張量測試，可避免把 ReLU 折點的不連續判成 Autograd 錯誤。gradcheck 不是在大型隨機 Dropout 訓練圖上隨意執行。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">.4</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">autograd</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">gradcheck</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">lambda</span> <span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sin</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,)))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">三個會切斷路徑的行為</h2>\n<p>先 item 再用 Python 數字重建 loss；將中間值 detach；把 Tensor 轉 NumPy 計算再包回 Tensor。這些操作可能讓數值看起來正常，卻無法回傳原參數的導數。若確實需要不可微分的流程，應明確設計訓練目標，而非用 requires_grad=True 偽造原本的連接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"in-place-anomaly-detection\">in-place 與 anomaly detection</h2>\n<p>以 <code>_</code> 結尾的 add_ 等操作直接修改儲存。若 backward 需要修改前的值，Autograd 的版本檢查會報錯。優先改成 out-of-place；更新參數由 optimizer 或 no_grad 區塊管理。除錯可在小範例使用 <code>with torch.autograd.detect_anomaly():</code> 包住 forward/backward，取得更多位置資訊；它有額外成本，不必一直開在正式訓練。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>寫 <code>loss = torch.tensor(old_loss.item(), requires_grad=True)</code> 後 backward，為何模型 grad 是 None？答案：你創造新的 leaf，它只知道自己的導數，不知道 old_loss 的來源。保留原 loss 直接 backward，日誌另存 detach().item。再試試讓參數完全沒用進 forward，觀察即使 loss 有 grad_fn，該參數仍可沒有 grad。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd mechanics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/gradcheck.html\">Gradcheck mechanics</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 梯度除錯：chain rule、gradcheck 與 in-place 操作\n\n以可手算與數值差分的實驗，區分圖被切斷、梯度為零與數值不穩。\n\n## 梯度為 None 與零不一樣\n\nNone 常表示還沒 backward、不是被追蹤的 leaf、路徑沒用到該參數或剛被 zero_grad 清除。零可能是正確導數，例如 ReLU 負區間。先檢查 requires_grad、is_leaf、grad_fn 與 loss 是否真的連到該參數，再調 learning rate。\n\n## 中央差分當第二種證據\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}\\approx\\frac{L(w+\\epsilon)-L(w-\\epsilon)}{2\\epsilon}\n$$\n\nepsilon 太大是截斷誤差，太小是浮點相減誤差。以 double、平滑函數與小張量測試，可避免把 ReLU 折點的不連續判成 Autograd 錯誤。gradcheck 不是在大型隨機 Dropout 訓練圖上隨意執行。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nx = torch.tensor([.2, -.4], dtype=torch.double, requires_grad=True)\nprint(torch.autograd.gradcheck(lambda v: (v.sin()*v).sum(), (x,)))\n```\n\n## 三個會切斷路徑的行為\n\n先 item 再用 Python 數字重建 loss；將中間值 detach；把 Tensor 轉 NumPy 計算再包回 Tensor。這些操作可能讓數值看起來正常，卻無法回傳原參數的導數。若確實需要不可微分的流程，應明確設計訓練目標，而非用 requires_grad=True 偽造原本的連接。\n\n## in-place 與 anomaly detection\n\n以 `_` 結尾的 add_ 等操作直接修改儲存。若 backward 需要修改前的值，Autograd 的版本檢查會報錯。優先改成 out-of-place；更新參數由 optimizer 或 no_grad 區塊管理。除錯可在小範例使用 `with torch.autograd.detect_anomaly():` 包住 forward/backward，取得更多位置資訊；它有額外成本，不必一直開在正式訓練。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n寫 `loss = torch.tensor(old_loss.item(), requires_grad=True)` 後 backward，為何模型 grad 是 None？答案：你創造新的 leaf，它只知道自己的導數，不知道 old_loss 的來源。保留原 loss 直接 backward，日誌另存 detach().item。再試試讓參數完全沒用進 forward，觀察即使 loss 有 grad_fn，該參數仍可沒有 grad。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Autograd mechanics](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [Gradcheck mechanics](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/gradcheck.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "chain-rulegradcheck-in-place", "name": "梯度除錯：chain rule、gradcheck 與 in-place 操作", "html": "梯度除錯：chain rule、gradcheck 與 in-place 操作", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "none", "name": "梯度為 None 與零不一樣", "html": "梯度為 None 與零不一樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "中央差分當第二種證據", "html": "中央差分當第二種證據", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "三個會切斷路徑的行為", "html": "三個會切斷路徑的行為", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "in-place-anomaly-detection", "name": "in-place 與 anomaly detection", "html": "in-place 與 anomaly detection", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "11-devices", "group": "grad", "title": "Device 與資料搬移：CPU 跑通，再使用 GPU", "summary": "避免模型、輸入、標籤與臨時 Tensor 分散在不同裝置。", "tags": ["device", "CUDA", "to", "buffer"], "html": "<h1 id=\"device-cpu-gpu\">Device 與資料搬移：CPU 跑通，再使用 GPU</h1>\n<p>避免模型、輸入、標籤與臨時 Tensor 分散在不同裝置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">裝置是一份契約</h2>\n<p>Tensor 在哪個 device，決定運算在哪裡進行。將 model 移到 CUDA，不會自動移動後續 DataLoader 送出的 CPU batch。特徵與標籤都要搬；模型 forward 中臨時建立的 zeros 也要與輸入相容。registered buffer 會隨 model.to 移動，普通 Python 屬性中的 Tensor 不會因此自動管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">一個明確的模式</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">device</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;cuda&#39;</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_available</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"s1\">&#39;cpu&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AdamW</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.001</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">long</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">loss</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">functional</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">float</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cpu</span><span class=\"p\">()))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>先移動模型再建立 optimizer，是容易維持參數關係的寫法。此片段會在可用 CUDA 時選用，課程編號入口預設固定 CPU，避免無意間啟用不同測試條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"forward-tensor\">forward 裡建立新 Tensor</h2>\n<p>優先 <code>torch.zeros_like(x)</code>、<code>x.new_zeros(...)</code> 或明確傳 <code>device=x.device</code>。把 Tensor <code>.to(...)</code> 的回傳值接住。需要浮點特徵轉 dtype 與移 device 可以一次 <code>.to(device=device,dtype=torch.float32)</code>；類別索引仍維持 long。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">搬移是否可以更快</h2>\n<p>GPU 資料載入常會比較 pin_memory 與 non_blocking 搬移，是否能重疊還取決於記憶體類型、stream 與後續依賴。不要把 non_blocking=True 當任何硬體都變快的保證。少量資料頻繁 CPU↔GPU 往返，可能比直接在 CPU 更慢；第 35、37 章會量測。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>裝置錯誤出現時，先印 <code>next(model.parameters()).device</code>、x.device 與 y.device。再看 forward 裡是否建立預設 CPU 常數。解答：三者與計算所需 buffer 要一致；存檔時可用 CPU state_dict 方便搬移，載入則以 map_location 明確控制。MPS／XPU 有各自支援範圍，本課可執行主線不把它們冒充 CUDA 等效環境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/cuda.html\">CUDA semantics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">Module 與 buffer</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Device 與資料搬移：CPU 跑通，再使用 GPU\n\n避免模型、輸入、標籤與臨時 Tensor 分散在不同裝置。\n\n## 裝置是一份契約\n\nTensor 在哪個 device，決定運算在哪裡進行。將 model 移到 CUDA，不會自動移動後續 DataLoader 送出的 CPU batch。特徵與標籤都要搬；模型 forward 中臨時建立的 zeros 也要與輸入相容。registered buffer 會隨 model.to 移動，普通 Python 屬性中的 Tensor 不會因此自動管理。\n\n## 一個明確的模式\n\n```python\nimport torch\nmodel = torch.nn.Linear(4, 3)\ndevice = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\nmodel = model.to(device)\noptimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=.001)\nx = torch.zeros(2, 4).to(device)\ny = torch.tensor([0, 1], dtype=torch.long).to(device)\nloss = torch.nn.functional.cross_entropy(model(x), y)\nloss.backward()\noptimizer.step()\nprint(device, float(loss.detach().cpu()))\n```\n\n先移動模型再建立 optimizer，是容易維持參數關係的寫法。此片段會在可用 CUDA 時選用，課程編號入口預設固定 CPU，避免無意間啟用不同測試條件。\n\n## forward 裡建立新 Tensor\n\n優先 `torch.zeros_like(x)`、`x.new_zeros(...)` 或明確傳 `device=x.device`。把 Tensor `.to(...)` 的回傳值接住。需要浮點特徵轉 dtype 與移 device 可以一次 `.to(device=device,dtype=torch.float32)`；類別索引仍維持 long。\n\n## 搬移是否可以更快\n\nGPU 資料載入常會比較 pin_memory 與 non_blocking 搬移，是否能重疊還取決於記憶體類型、stream 與後續依賴。不要把 non_blocking=True 當任何硬體都變快的保證。少量資料頻繁 CPU↔GPU 往返，可能比直接在 CPU 更慢；第 35、37 章會量測。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n裝置錯誤出現時，先印 `next(model.parameters()).device`、x.device 與 y.device。再看 forward 裡是否建立預設 CPU 常數。解答：三者與計算所需 buffer 要一致；存檔時可用 CPU state_dict 方便搬移，載入則以 map_location 明確控制。MPS／XPU 有各自支援範圍，本課可執行主線不把它們冒充 CUDA 等效環境。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [CUDA semantics](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/cuda.html)\n- [Module 與 buffer](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "device-cpu-gpu", "name": "Device 與資料搬移：CPU 跑通，再使用 GPU", "html": "Device 與資料搬移：CPU 跑通，再使用 GPU", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "裝置是一份契約", "html": "裝置是一份契約", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "一個明確的模式", "html": "一個明確的模式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "forward-tensor", "name": "forward 裡建立新 Tensor", "html": "forward 裡建立新 Tensor", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "搬移是否可以更快", "html": "搬移是否可以更快", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "12-numerics", "group": "grad", "title": "數值穩定性：NaN、Inf、mask 與精度", "summary": "先找出第一個失效的運算，再決定是否需要更高精度或不同公式。", "tags": ["NaN", "Inf", "isfinite", "precision", "mask"], "html": "<h1 id=\"naninfmask\">數值穩定性：NaN、Inf、mask 與精度</h1>\n<p>先找出第一個失效的運算，再決定是否需要更高精度或不同公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"backward\">問題可能比 backward 更早</h2>\n<p>loss=NaN 的原因可以是輸入缺失、除以零、log(0)、overflow 或學習率太大。先查資料與 forward 中間量，再查梯度。用 <code>torch.isfinite(tensor).all()</code> 找第一個非有限值；只把最後 loss 的 NaN 改成零，會隱藏上游問題，也可能讓模型停止學習。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">用穩定的運算式</h2>\n<p>分類使用原始 logits 搭配 CrossEntropyLoss，二元分類使用 BCEWithLogitsLoss，比先手寫 exp／sigmoid 再 log 容易保持穩定。對數機率可用 log_softmax 或 logsumexp。數學等價的式子，在有限精度中未必有同樣表現。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">z</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">1000.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">1001.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exp</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isfinite</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logsumexp</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">denominator</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">valid</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">denominator</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ne</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros_like</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">denominator</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">valid</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">1.</span> <span class=\"o\">/</span> <span class=\"n\">denominator</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">valid</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"mask\">mask 要在危險運算之前</h2>\n<p>如果先 <code>1/x</code> 得到 Inf，再用 mask 去掉結果，Autograd 仍可能遇到先前的無效運算。上述範例只對有效分母做除法。Padding 的平均也要以有效 token 數當分母，並拒絕整列全 mask；不能只填零後直接 mean 所有位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">精度與比較</h2>\n<p>float16 的範圍與有效位數不同於 bfloat16、float32；AMP 會依運算選擇型態，不代表所有 Tensor 都改 half。不同硬體與 reduction 次序可有微小誤差。數值測試設定 atol、rtol 時要連回任務尺度；比較分類標籤則用精確一致，不把容許值套在所有東西上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>模型第一個 batch 就 NaN：先看 x/y、標準差、loss 的輸入契約；第十個 epoch 才 NaN：再看梯度範數、更新幅度與中間 activation。解答順序是縮小到一批並固定 seed，記錄首次壞值的位置，確認公式與 dtype，再嘗試降低 lr 或 gradient clipping。clipping 處理大梯度，不能修好本來就無效的標籤或除零。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/numerical_accuracy.html\">Numerical accuracy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd 與無效運算</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 數值穩定性：NaN、Inf、mask 與精度\n\n先找出第一個失效的運算，再決定是否需要更高精度或不同公式。\n\n## 問題可能比 backward 更早\n\nloss=NaN 的原因可以是輸入缺失、除以零、log(0)、overflow 或學習率太大。先查資料與 forward 中間量，再查梯度。用 `torch.isfinite(tensor).all()` 找第一個非有限值；只把最後 loss 的 NaN 改成零，會隱藏上游問題，也可能讓模型停止學習。\n\n## 用穩定的運算式\n\n分類使用原始 logits 搭配 CrossEntropyLoss，二元分類使用 BCEWithLogitsLoss，比先手寫 exp／sigmoid 再 log 容易保持穩定。對數機率可用 log_softmax 或 logsumexp。數學等價的式子，在有限精度中未必有同樣表現。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nz = torch.tensor([1000., 1001.])\nprint(torch.exp(z).isfinite())\nprint(torch.logsumexp(z, dim=0))\ndenominator = torch.tensor([0., 2.])\nvalid = denominator.ne(0)\nresult = torch.zeros_like(denominator)\nresult[valid] = 1. / denominator[valid]\nprint(result)\n```\n\n## mask 要在危險運算之前\n\n如果先 `1/x` 得到 Inf，再用 mask 去掉結果，Autograd 仍可能遇到先前的無效運算。上述範例只對有效分母做除法。Padding 的平均也要以有效 token 數當分母，並拒絕整列全 mask；不能只填零後直接 mean 所有位置。\n\n## 精度與比較\n\nfloat16 的範圍與有效位數不同於 bfloat16、float32；AMP 會依運算選擇型態，不代表所有 Tensor 都改 half。不同硬體與 reduction 次序可有微小誤差。數值測試設定 atol、rtol 時要連回任務尺度；比較分類標籤則用精確一致，不把容許值套在所有東西上。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n模型第一個 batch 就 NaN：先看 x/y、標準差、loss 的輸入契約；第十個 epoch 才 NaN：再看梯度範數、更新幅度與中間 activation。解答順序是縮小到一批並固定 seed，記錄首次壞值的位置，確認公式與 dtype，再嘗試降低 lr 或 gradient clipping。clipping 處理大梯度，不能修好本來就無效的標籤或除零。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Numerical accuracy](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/numerical_accuracy.html)\n- [Autograd 與無效運算](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "naninfmask", "name": "數值穩定性：NaN、Inf、mask 與精度", "html": "數值穩定性：NaN、Inf、mask 與精度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "backward", "name": "問題可能比 backward 更早", "html": "問題可能比 backward 更早", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "用穩定的運算式", "html": "用穩定的運算式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "mask", "name": "mask 要在危險運算之前", "html": "mask 要在危險運算之前", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "精度與比較", "html": "精度與比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "13-datasets", "group": "building", "title": "Dataset 與資料切分：先決定樣本，再談模型", "summary": "將一筆資料的特徵、答案與來源定義清楚，避免切分和前處理洩漏。", "tags": ["Dataset", "split", "leakage", "preprocessing"], "html": "<h1 id=\"dataset\">Dataset 與資料切分：先決定樣本，再談模型</h1>\n<p>將一筆資料的特徵、答案與來源定義清楚，避免切分和前處理洩漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">一筆樣本的契約</h2>\n<p>本課分類樣本是 <code>(features[F], label[])</code>：特徵 float32、標籤 long 純量。Dataset.<strong>len</strong> 回傳筆數，<strong>getitem</strong> 依 index 回傳一筆。不要在這一層先加 batch 維度，否則 DataLoader 堆疊後容易多出 <code>[N,1,F]</code>。文字任務則可以先回傳不同長度 token list，再由 collate 處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">切分先於學習前處理</h2>\n<p>本課 160 筆固定合成資料分成 96 訓練、32 驗證、32 測試。先固定索引，再只用 train 求 mean 與 scale，同一組統計套用到 val/test。若先對全資料計算平均或特徵選擇，驗證資訊已回流。資料有同一人、公司或文件衍生多筆時，應以群組切分；時間問題則考慮依時間切分。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\mu_f=\\frac{1}{N_{train}}\\sum_{i\\in train}x_{i,f},\\qquad z_{i,f}=\\frac{x_{i,f}-\\mu_f}{\\max(\\sigma_f,\\epsilon)}\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">可執行資料檢查</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">make_data</span>\n<span class=\"n\">splits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">prep</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">make_data</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">splits</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">splits</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>此片段放在 examples 內執行。期望 train 各欄均值接近零；val 不一定為零，因為不能各自重新 fit。這個檢查比「整份資料都標準化了」更能發現洩漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dataset_1\">檔案型與串流型 Dataset</h2>\n<p>map-style 由 index 讀取，適合明確的檔案清單；IterableDataset 則代表逐步產生的串流，需要自己處理多 worker 分片，否則各程序可能重複讀取相同內容。先掌握本課 map-style，再針對大規模資料導入串流，不必在小資料先增加複雜性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若同一張圖片增強十次，切分應在增強前還是後？答案：先依原圖／群組切分，再只在 train 增強。若先增強後隨機切分，近乎相同的影像可同時出現在 train 與 val。再用一個全部固定值的 feature，確認 scale 的下限避免除零；下限是數值保護，仍需檢查這欄是否具有資訊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">Dataset 與資料工具</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/data_tutorial.html\">資料教學</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Dataset 與資料切分：先決定樣本，再談模型\n\n將一筆資料的特徵、答案與來源定義清楚，避免切分和前處理洩漏。\n\n## 一筆樣本的契約\n\n本課分類樣本是 `(features[F], label[])`：特徵 float32、標籤 long 純量。Dataset.__len__ 回傳筆數，__getitem__ 依 index 回傳一筆。不要在這一層先加 batch 維度，否則 DataLoader 堆疊後容易多出 `[N,1,F]`。文字任務則可以先回傳不同長度 token list，再由 collate 處理。\n\n## 切分先於學習前處理\n\n本課 160 筆固定合成資料分成 96 訓練、32 驗證、32 測試。先固定索引，再只用 train 求 mean 與 scale，同一組統計套用到 val/test。若先對全資料計算平均或特徵選擇，驗證資訊已回流。資料有同一人、公司或文件衍生多筆時，應以群組切分；時間問題則考慮依時間切分。\n\n$$\n\\mu_f=\\frac{1}{N_{train}}\\sum_{i\\in train}x_{i,f},\\qquad z_{i,f}=\\frac{x_{i,f}-\\mu_f}{\\max(\\sigma_f,\\epsilon)}\n$$\n\n## 可執行資料檢查\n\n```python\nfrom course_core import make_data\nsplits, prep = make_data()\nfor data in splits:\n    x, y = data[0]\n    print(len(data), x.shape, x.dtype, y.shape, y.dtype)\nprint(splits[0].x.mean(dim=0))\n```\n\n此片段放在 examples 內執行。期望 train 各欄均值接近零；val 不一定為零，因為不能各自重新 fit。這個檢查比「整份資料都標準化了」更能發現洩漏。\n\n## 檔案型與串流型 Dataset\n\nmap-style 由 index 讀取，適合明確的檔案清單；IterableDataset 則代表逐步產生的串流，需要自己處理多 worker 分片，否則各程序可能重複讀取相同內容。先掌握本課 map-style，再針對大規模資料導入串流，不必在小資料先增加複雜性。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若同一張圖片增強十次，切分應在增強前還是後？答案：先依原圖／群組切分，再只在 train 增強。若先增強後隨機切分，近乎相同的影像可同時出現在 train 與 val。再用一個全部固定值的 feature，確認 scale 的下限避免除零；下限是數值保護，仍需檢查這欄是否具有資訊。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Dataset 與資料工具](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n- [資料教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/data_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "dataset", "name": "Dataset 與資料切分：先決定樣本，再談模型", "html": "Dataset 與資料切分：先決定樣本，再談模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "一筆樣本的契約", "html": "一筆樣本的契約", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "切分先於學習前處理", "html": "切分先於學習前處理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "可執行資料檢查", "html": "可執行資料檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "dataset_1", "name": "檔案型與串流型 Dataset", "html": "檔案型與串流型 Dataset", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "14-dataloader", "group": "building", "title": "DataLoader：batch、shuffle、workers 與 Windows", "summary": "用六筆樣本追蹤每個 batch，理解尾批與多程序的條件。", "tags": ["DataLoader", "batch_size", "num_workers", "Windows"], "example": "05_dataloader.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"dataloaderbatchshuffleworkers-windows\">DataLoader：batch、shuffle、workers 與 Windows</h1>\n<p>用六筆樣本追蹤每個 batch，理解尾批與多程序的條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dataset-dataloader\">Dataset 與 DataLoader 的分工</h2>\n<p>Dataset 定義單筆內容，DataLoader 決定索引順序、批次、collate 與載入程序。batch_size=4、資料六筆時，預設兩批大小為 4、2。drop_last=True 則只留下第一批。訓練是否丟尾批要有理由；驗證通常保留所有樣本，否則指標分母與資料覆蓋會改變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shuffle-generator\">shuffle 與 generator</h2>\n<p>train 常 shuffle，val/test 不需要。傳入獨立 torch.Generator，可讓資料順序不被其他 global random 呼叫影響。重現還涉及 worker 中用到的 Python／NumPy 隨機性；本課 seed_worker 設 Python random，若加入 NumPy 也需設定它。不能只 seed 一次就假設所有處理都固定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"windows\">Windows 的安全起點</h2>\n<p>先 num_workers=0，錯誤會直接出現在主程序，容易診斷。Dataset 類別、collate_fn 與 worker_init_fn 放模組頂層，入口放 <code>if __name__ == '__main__'</code>。多程序使用可序列化的物件，不用 lambda 當 worker 函式。Notebook 內定義的類別在 spawn 環境可能無法被 child 找到，改用腳本。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">05_dataloader</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span>\n<span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">05_dataloader</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-workers</span> <span class=\"n\">2</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>第二個指令是選配多程序測試，不屬於預設 CPU 單程序驗證。若卡住，先回到 workers=0，縮小資料並確認檔案與 main guard，再加 worker。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pin_memory-persistent_workers\">pin_memory 與 persistent_workers</h2>\n<p>pin_memory 主要用於主機到 GPU 搬移；CPU 主線先不開。persistent_workers 需 workers&gt;0，讓 epoch 間不必反覆建立程序，但程序內 Dataset 狀態也會持續。prefetch_factor 會增加預取資料量與記憶體；多 worker 並非一定更快，小資料的序列化與啟動成本可能更大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>N=10、batch_size=4，保留尾批有 3 次 iteration，大小 <code>[4,4,2]</code>；drop_last 只有 2 次。若 epoch loss 直接平均三個 batch mean，最後兩筆的權重會放大。應以每批實際 N 加權；第 20 章會寫入正式迴圈。執行本章範例，核對六筆標籤總數仍是六。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/05_dataloader.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Default workers=0; the main guard also supports Windows spawn.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">argparse</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.utils.data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DataLoader</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">custom_dataset</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">seed_worker</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ArgumentParser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"vm\">__doc__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;--workers&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">default</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">args</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">workers</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;workers must be nonnegative&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loader</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">DataLoader</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">custom_dataset</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">batch_size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">num_workers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">workers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                        <span class=\"n\">worker_init_fn</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">seed_worker</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Generator</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">batches</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;x&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;y&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;labels&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tolist</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">loader</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;batches&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">batches</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;samples&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">batch</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;y&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">batch</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">batches</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">DataLoader 與平台注意事項</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# DataLoader：batch、shuffle、workers 與 Windows\n\n用六筆樣本追蹤每個 batch，理解尾批與多程序的條件。\n\n## Dataset 與 DataLoader 的分工\n\nDataset 定義單筆內容，DataLoader 決定索引順序、批次、collate 與載入程序。batch_size=4、資料六筆時，預設兩批大小為 4、2。drop_last=True 則只留下第一批。訓練是否丟尾批要有理由；驗證通常保留所有樣本，否則指標分母與資料覆蓋會改變。\n\n## shuffle 與 generator\n\ntrain 常 shuffle，val/test 不需要。傳入獨立 torch.Generator，可讓資料順序不被其他 global random 呼叫影響。重現還涉及 worker 中用到的 Python／NumPy 隨機性；本課 seed_worker 設 Python random，若加入 NumPy 也需設定它。不能只 seed 一次就假設所有處理都固定。\n\n## Windows 的安全起點\n\n先 num_workers=0，錯誤會直接出現在主程序，容易診斷。Dataset 類別、collate_fn 與 worker_init_fn 放模組頂層，入口放 `if __name__ == '__main__'`。多程序使用可序列化的物件，不用 lambda 當 worker 函式。Notebook 內定義的類別在 spawn 環境可能無法被 child 找到，改用腳本。\n\n```powershell\npython pytorch/examples/05_dataloader.py\npython pytorch/examples/05_dataloader.py --workers 2\n```\n\n第二個指令是選配多程序測試，不屬於預設 CPU 單程序驗證。若卡住，先回到 workers=0，縮小資料並確認檔案與 main guard，再加 worker。\n\n## pin_memory 與 persistent_workers\n\npin_memory 主要用於主機到 GPU 搬移；CPU 主線先不開。persistent_workers 需 workers>0，讓 epoch 間不必反覆建立程序，但程序內 Dataset 狀態也會持續。prefetch_factor 會增加預取資料量與記憶體；多 worker 並非一定更快，小資料的序列化與啟動成本可能更大。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nN=10、batch_size=4，保留尾批有 3 次 iteration，大小 `[4,4,2]`；drop_last 只有 2 次。若 epoch loss 直接平均三個 batch mean，最後兩筆的權重會放大。應以每批實際 N 加權；第 20 章會寫入正式迴圈。執行本章範例，核對六筆標籤總數仍是六。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/05_dataloader.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Default workers=0; the main guard also supports Windows spawn.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\nfrom course_core import custom_dataset, seed_worker\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n    parser.add_argument(\"--workers\", type=int, default=0)\n    args = parser.parse_args(argv)\n    if args.workers < 0:\n        parser.error(\"workers must be nonnegative\")\n    loader = DataLoader(custom_dataset(), batch_size=4, shuffle=True, num_workers=args.workers,\n                        worker_init_fn=seed_worker, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(7))\n    batches = [{\"x\": list(x.shape), \"y\": list(y.shape), \"labels\": y.tolist()} for x, y in loader]\n    result = {\"batches\": batches, \"samples\": sum(batch[\"y\"][0] for batch in batches)}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [DataLoader 與平台注意事項](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "dataloaderbatchshuffleworkers-windows", "name": "DataLoader：batch、shuffle、workers 與 Windows", "html": "DataLoader：batch、shuffle、workers 與 Windows", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "dataset-dataloader", "name": "Dataset 與 DataLoader 的分工", "html": "Dataset 與 DataLoader 的分工", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "shuffle-generator", "name": "shuffle 與 generator", "html": "shuffle 與 generator", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "windows", "name": "Windows 的安全起點", "html": "Windows 的安全起點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "pin_memory-persistent_workers", "name": "pin_memory 與 persistent_workers", "html": "pin_memory 與 persistent_workers", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "15-collate", "group": "building", "title": "Collate、Padding 與 mask：把變長資料變成 batch", "summary": "定義 PAD、有效位置與平均分母，讓不同長度序列能正確一起運算。", "tags": ["collate_fn", "padding", "mask", "sequence"], "example": "06_collate.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"collatepadding-mask-batch\">Collate、Padding 與 mask：把變長資料變成 batch</h1>\n<p>定義 PAD、有效位置與平均分母，讓不同長度序列能正確一起運算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為什麼預設堆疊會失敗</h2>\n<p>兩個 token list 長度分別 2 與 3，無法直接 stack 成一般矩形 Tensor。collate_fn 接收一批樣本 list，將內容整理成模型可接受的契約。本課使用 PAD=0，真實 token 從 1 開始，輸出 tokens[N,T]、mask[N,T] 與 labels[N]。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">看懂補零後的意義</h2>\n<p>序列 <code>[1,2]</code> 與 <code>[3]</code> 變成 <code>[[1,2],[3,0]]</code>，mask 為 <code>[[True,True],[True,False]]</code>。PAD 的 embedding 可設 padding_idx=0 以免更新該列，但若最後對兩個位置直接 mean，第二句仍被多除了一次。因此需要 mask 與有效 token 計數，而不只是將 PAD 向量設零。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nh_i=\\frac{\\sum_t m_{i,t}e_{i,t}}{\\sum_t m_{i,t}}\n$$</div>\n<p>分母為零時本課直接拒絕全空序列。正式系統可以設計 EMPTY token 或回傳明確狀態，但不能默默用無意義值冒充有效表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">介面與模型要一起約定</h2>\n<p>mask 的 True 代表有效，是本課模型的契約。其他 Attention API 的 bool mask 可能有不同語意，不能看到 mask 就直接搬用。長度、截斷位置、PAD ID、詞表大小與 label mapping 都應寫進設定，推論時沿用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">批次效率與資料損失</h2>\n<p>長短差很多的序列補到同一最大長度，會浪費計算。可依長度分桶、限制 token budget 或動態 batch，但這會改變 sampler 與有效樣本數。截斷也可能丟掉關鍵訊息，必須評估，而非只追求不 OOM。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>給定 embedding 第一個 token <code>[2,0]</code>、第二個 <code>[0,2]</code>，兩者 mean 為 <code>[1,1]</code>；加入兩個 PAD 後仍應 <code>[1,1]</code>。若變 <code>[.5,.5]</code>，你平均了 padded length。測試套件會檢查增加 PAD 不改預測，以及 padding embedding 的梯度為零；這是行為測試，比只檢查張量有三個維度更有意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/06_collate.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Variable-length token lists become padded tensors and an explicit mask.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">collate_sequences</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">padded</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">labels</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">collate_sequences</span><span class=\"p\">([([</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tokens&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">padded</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tolist</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;mask&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tolist</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;labels&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tolist</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">DataLoader collate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#sparse-layers\">Embedding 與 padding</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Collate、Padding 與 mask：把變長資料變成 batch\n\n定義 PAD、有效位置與平均分母，讓不同長度序列能正確一起運算。\n\n## 為什麼預設堆疊會失敗\n\n兩個 token list 長度分別 2 與 3，無法直接 stack 成一般矩形 Tensor。collate_fn 接收一批樣本 list，將內容整理成模型可接受的契約。本課使用 PAD=0，真實 token 從 1 開始，輸出 tokens[N,T]、mask[N,T] 與 labels[N]。\n\n## 看懂補零後的意義\n\n序列 `[1,2]` 與 `[3]` 變成 `[[1,2],[3,0]]`，mask 為 `[[True,True],[True,False]]`。PAD 的 embedding 可設 padding_idx=0 以免更新該列，但若最後對兩個位置直接 mean，第二句仍被多除了一次。因此需要 mask 與有效 token 計數，而不只是將 PAD 向量設零。\n\n$$\nh_i=\\frac{\\sum_t m_{i,t}e_{i,t}}{\\sum_t m_{i,t}}\n$$\n\n分母為零時本課直接拒絕全空序列。正式系統可以設計 EMPTY token 或回傳明確狀態，但不能默默用無意義值冒充有效表示。\n\n## 介面與模型要一起約定\n\nmask 的 True 代表有效，是本課模型的契約。其他 Attention API 的 bool mask 可能有不同語意，不能看到 mask 就直接搬用。長度、截斷位置、PAD ID、詞表大小與 label mapping 都應寫進設定，推論時沿用。\n\n## 批次效率與資料損失\n\n長短差很多的序列補到同一最大長度，會浪費計算。可依長度分桶、限制 token budget 或動態 batch，但這會改變 sampler 與有效樣本數。截斷也可能丟掉關鍵訊息，必須評估，而非只追求不 OOM。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n給定 embedding 第一個 token `[2,0]`、第二個 `[0,2]`，兩者 mean 為 `[1,1]`；加入兩個 PAD 後仍應 `[1,1]`。若變 `[.5,.5]`，你平均了 padded length。測試套件會檢查增加 PAD 不改預測，以及 padding embedding 的梯度為零；這是行為測試，比只檢查張量有三個維度更有意義。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/06_collate.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Variable-length token lists become padded tensors and an explicit mask.\"\"\"\nimport json\nfrom course_core import collate_sequences\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    padded, mask, labels = collate_sequences([([1, 2], 0), ([3, 4, 5], 1), ([6], 0)])\n    result = {\"tokens\": padded.tolist(), \"mask\": mask.tolist(), \"labels\": labels.tolist()}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [DataLoader collate](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n- [Embedding 與 padding](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#sparse-layers)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "collatepadding-mask-batch", "name": "Collate、Padding 與 mask：把變長資料變成 batch", "html": "Collate、Padding 與 mask：把變長資料變成 batch", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為什麼預設堆疊會失敗", "html": "為什麼預設堆疊會失敗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "看懂補零後的意義", "html": "看懂補零後的意義", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "介面與模型要一起約定", "html": "介面與模型要一起約定", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "批次效率與資料損失", "html": "批次效率與資料損失", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "16-modules", "group": "building", "title": "nn.Module：參數、buffer、子模組與 state_dict", "summary": "讓 optimizer、device 搬移與存檔都能找到真正需要管理的狀態。", "tags": ["nn.Module", "Parameter", "ModuleList", "buffer", "state_dict"], "example": "07_modules.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"nnmodulebuffer-state_dict\">nn.Module：參數、buffer、子模組與 state_dict</h1>\n<p>讓 optimizer、device 搬移與存檔都能找到真正需要管理的狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"module-forward\">Module 管理的不只是 forward</h2>\n<p>繼承 nn.Module 並呼叫 super().<strong>init</strong>，再將層指定為 self 的屬性。透過 <code>model(x)</code> 呼叫 forward，讓 hooks 與框架機制正常運作。不要平常直接用 model.forward(x) 來繞過這層入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">三種狀態</h2>\n<p>Parameter 會出現在 model.parameters，optimizer 才能取得它；buffer 不需要梯度，但可能需要保存與跟隨 device，例如正規化統計；一般 Python 屬性是你的程式狀態，不能假設自動存檔。本章 center 是 register_buffer，所以會出現在 state_dict，也會隨 model.to 移動。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">容器的差別</h2>\n<p><code>self.layers=[nn.Linear(...)]</code> 是普通 list，內部 Module 不會按這個寫法被註冊。用 ModuleList 保留可自行迭代的註冊子模組；Sequential 適合依序串接單一輸入輸出。ModuleList 本身不替你定義 forward，需自行寫迴圈。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">numel</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()))</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">tensor</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">state_dict</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">tuple</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>預設 MLP 的參數數量為 4×12+12+12×3+3=99。Dropout 與 ReLU 無可訓練參數，不代表它們在 forward 沒有效果。透過參數計數可以快速發現忘記註冊的層。</p>\n<h2 id=\"forward\">forward 應保持介面清楚</h2>\n<p>輸入 x[N,4]，回傳 logits[N,3]，loss 在外部計算，方便訓練與推論共用。不要每次 forward 重新建立 Linear，那會使權重反覆初始化且不在既有 optimizer 內。資料尺寸變動也應明確驗證，不依靠隱藏的 reshape 消除錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>執行範例，比較正確模型的 named_parameters、named_buffers、state_keys 與錯誤容器的參數數。解答：plain list 中的 Linear 雖然可以做矩陣運算，optimizer 卻可能完全不知道它存在。修正為 ModuleList，再確認參數計數與 state_dict 都增加，而不是只看 forward 有沒有輸出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/07_modules.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Registered parameters/buffers differ from modules hidden in a plain list.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">CenteredMLP</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"fm\">__init__</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"nb\">super</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"fm\">__init__</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">register_buffer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;center&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">layers</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ModuleList</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ReLU</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">forward</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">center</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">layer</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">layers</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">UnregisteredExample</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"fm\">__init__</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"nb\">super</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"fm\">__init__</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">layers</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Deliberately wrong for model registration.</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">CenteredMLP</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;output_shape&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;parameters&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">name</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">named_parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()],</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;buffers&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">name</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">named_buffers</span><span class=\"p\">()],</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;state_keys&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">state_dict</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;unregistered_parameter_count&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">numel</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">UnregisteredExample</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">())}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">Modules</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html\">神經網路元件</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# nn.Module：參數、buffer、子模組與 state_dict\n\n讓 optimizer、device 搬移與存檔都能找到真正需要管理的狀態。\n\n## Module 管理的不只是 forward\n\n繼承 nn.Module 並呼叫 super().__init__，再將層指定為 self 的屬性。透過 `model(x)` 呼叫 forward，讓 hooks 與框架機制正常運作。不要平常直接用 model.forward(x) 來繞過這層入口。\n\n## 三種狀態\n\nParameter 會出現在 model.parameters，optimizer 才能取得它；buffer 不需要梯度，但可能需要保存與跟隨 device，例如正規化統計；一般 Python 屬性是你的程式狀態，不能假設自動存檔。本章 center 是 register_buffer，所以會出現在 state_dict，也會隨 model.to 移動。\n\n## 容器的差別\n\n`self.layers=[nn.Linear(...)]` 是普通 list，內部 Module 不會按這個寫法被註冊。用 ModuleList 保留可自行迭代的註冊子模組；Sequential 適合依序串接單一輸入輸出。ModuleList 本身不替你定義 forward，需自行寫迴圈。\n\n```python\nfrom course_core import TinyMLP\nmodel = TinyMLP()\nprint(sum(p.numel() for p in model.parameters()))\nfor name, tensor in model.state_dict().items():\n    print(name, tuple(tensor.shape))\n```\n\n預設 MLP 的參數數量為 4×12+12+12×3+3=99。Dropout 與 ReLU 無可訓練參數，不代表它們在 forward 沒有效果。透過參數計數可以快速發現忘記註冊的層。\n\n## forward 應保持介面清楚\n\n輸入 x[N,4]，回傳 logits[N,3]，loss 在外部計算，方便訓練與推論共用。不要每次 forward 重新建立 Linear，那會使權重反覆初始化且不在既有 optimizer 內。資料尺寸變動也應明確驗證，不依靠隱藏的 reshape 消除錯誤。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n執行範例，比較正確模型的 named_parameters、named_buffers、state_keys 與錯誤容器的參數數。解答：plain list 中的 Linear 雖然可以做矩陣運算，optimizer 卻可能完全不知道它存在。修正為 ModuleList，再確認參數計數與 state_dict 都增加，而不是只看 forward 有沒有輸出。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/07_modules.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Registered parameters/buffers differ from modules hidden in a plain list.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\n\nclass CenteredMLP(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.register_buffer(\"center\", torch.zeros(4))\n        self.layers = nn.ModuleList([nn.Linear(4, 6), nn.ReLU(), nn.Linear(6, 3)])\n    def forward(self, x):\n        x = x - self.center\n        for layer in self.layers:\n            x = layer(x)\n        return x\n\nclass UnregisteredExample(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.layers = [nn.Linear(4, 3)]  # Deliberately wrong for model registration.\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    model = CenteredMLP()\n    result = {\"output_shape\": list(model(torch.zeros(2, 4)).shape),\n              \"parameters\": [name for name, _ in model.named_parameters()],\n              \"buffers\": [name for name, _ in model.named_buffers()],\n              \"state_keys\": list(model.state_dict()),\n              \"unregistered_parameter_count\": sum(p.numel() for p in UnregisteredExample().parameters())}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Modules](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n- [神經網路元件](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "nnmodulebuffer-state_dict", "name": "nn.Module：參數、buffer、子模組與 state_dict", "html": "nn.Module：參數、buffer、子模組與 state_dict", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "module-forward", "name": "Module 管理的不只是 forward", "html": "Module 管理的不只是 forward", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "三種狀態", "html": "三種狀態", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "容器的差別", "html": "容器的差別", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "forward", "name": "forward 應保持介面清楚", "html": "forward 應保持介面清楚", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "17-layers", "group": "building", "title": "常用層與 shape：Linear、Conv2d、Embedding 與正規化", "summary": "把每一層當作有明確輸入輸出規格的數值運算。", "tags": ["Linear", "Conv2d", "Embedding", "Dropout", "BatchNorm"], "html": "<h1 id=\"shapelinearconv2dembedding\">常用層與 shape：Linear、Conv2d、Embedding 與正規化</h1>\n<p>把每一層當作有明確輸入輸出規格的數值運算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"linear\">Linear 的最後一軸</h2>\n<p>nn.Linear(F,C) 將最後一軸 F 變成 C。<code>[N,F]→[N,C]</code>，<code>[N,T,F]→[N,T,C]</code>；它不會自動把時間軸平均。權重儲存 <code>[C,F]</code>，bias <code>[C]</code>。加入 ReLU 等非線性，才能讓多層線性網路超越單一線性映射的表示能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"conv2d\">Conv2d 與空間尺寸</h2>\n<p>一般 Conv2d 輸入 NCHW。輸出高度由 kernel、padding、stride、dilation 決定；寬度同理。不要只照別人的 Flatten 後尺寸，應自己推算或用一個 dummy batch 檢查。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nH_{out}=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{H+2P-D(K-1)-1}{S}+1\\right\\rfloor\n$$</div>\n<p>本課 8×8、kernel3、padding1、stride1 保持 8×8，輸出4個 channel，Flatten 是256，而不是64。第26章完整例子直接驗證這個尺寸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"embedding\">Embedding 是查表</h2>\n<p>tokens[N,T] 的 dtype 為 long，Embedding(V,D) 輸出 <code>[N,T,D]</code>。token ID 是索引，不是連續數值特徵。ID 必須落在詞表範圍，padding_idx 指定特殊列。本課不下載 tokenizer 或語言模型，而用明確的手工詞表展示這個操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dropout\">Dropout 與正規化的狀態</h2>\n<p>Dropout 在 train mode 隨機遮蔽，eval 關閉；BatchNorm 在訓練及驗證使用統計的方式不同。LayerNorm 則依指定尾部維度正規化，不使用相同的 running mean 機制。batch_size 小、資料分布不同時，不能只因為都叫 normalization 就互換。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"n\">image</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">conv</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Conv2d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">padding</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">conv</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">image</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># [2,4,8,8]</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ids</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Embedding</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">padding_idx</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)(</span><span class=\"n\">ids</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_1\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>輸入 <code>[2,7,4]</code> 經 Linear(4,3) 得 <code>[2,7,3]</code>；若想句子分類，還要定義 pooling 或選取位置。Conv2d 輸入32×32、K3、P0、S2，輸出高度15。若得到16，重新核對公式的 -1 與 floor，而不是改 Linear 到程式剛好能跑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html\">層與 shape 參考</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 常用層與 shape：Linear、Conv2d、Embedding 與正規化\n\n把每一層當作有明確輸入輸出規格的數值運算。\n\n## Linear 的最後一軸\n\nnn.Linear(F,C) 將最後一軸 F 變成 C。`[N,F]→[N,C]`，`[N,T,F]→[N,T,C]`；它不會自動把時間軸平均。權重儲存 `[C,F]`，bias `[C]`。加入 ReLU 等非線性，才能讓多層線性網路超越單一線性映射的表示能力。\n\n## Conv2d 與空間尺寸\n\n一般 Conv2d 輸入 NCHW。輸出高度由 kernel、padding、stride、dilation 決定；寬度同理。不要只照別人的 Flatten 後尺寸，應自己推算或用一個 dummy batch 檢查。\n\n$$\nH_{out}=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{H+2P-D(K-1)-1}{S}+1\\right\\rfloor\n$$\n\n本課 8×8、kernel3、padding1、stride1 保持 8×8，輸出4個 channel，Flatten 是256，而不是64。第26章完整例子直接驗證這個尺寸。\n\n## Embedding 是查表\n\ntokens[N,T] 的 dtype 為 long，Embedding(V,D) 輸出 `[N,T,D]`。token ID 是索引，不是連續數值特徵。ID 必須落在詞表範圍，padding_idx 指定特殊列。本課不下載 tokenizer 或語言模型，而用明確的手工詞表展示這個操作。\n\n## Dropout 與正規化的狀態\n\nDropout 在 train mode 隨機遮蔽，eval 關閉；BatchNorm 在訓練及驗證使用統計的方式不同。LayerNorm 則依指定尾部維度正規化，不使用相同的 running mean 機制。batch_size 小、資料分布不同時，不能只因為都叫 normalization 就互換。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nimage = torch.zeros(2,1,8,8)\nconv = nn.Conv2d(1,4,3,padding=1)\nprint(conv(image).shape)  # [2,4,8,8]\nids = torch.tensor([[1,2,0]])\nprint(nn.Embedding(8,4,padding_idx=0)(ids).shape)\n```\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n輸入 `[2,7,4]` 經 Linear(4,3) 得 `[2,7,3]`；若想句子分類，還要定義 pooling 或選取位置。Conv2d 輸入32×32、K3、P0、S2，輸出高度15。若得到16，重新核對公式的 -1 與 floor，而不是改 Linear 到程式剛好能跑。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [層與 shape 參考](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "shapelinearconv2dembedding", "name": "常用層與 shape：Linear、Conv2d、Embedding 與正規化", "html": "常用層與 shape：Linear、Conv2d、Embedding 與正規化", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "linear", "name": "Linear 的最後一軸", "html": "Linear 的最後一軸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "conv2d", "name": "Conv2d 與空間尺寸", "html": "Conv2d 與空間尺寸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "embedding", "name": "Embedding 是查表", "html": "Embedding 是查表", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "dropout", "name": "Dropout 與正規化的狀態", "html": "Dropout 與正規化的狀態", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "18-losses", "group": "building", "title": "損失函數的資料契約：CE、BCE 與 MSE", "summary": "分清 logits、機率、索引與浮點標籤，避免多套一次 activation。", "tags": ["CrossEntropyLoss", "BCEWithLogitsLoss", "MSELoss", "logits"], "example": "08_losses.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"cebce-mse\">損失函數的資料契約：CE、BCE 與 MSE</h1>\n<p>分清 logits、機率、索引與浮點標籤，避免多套一次 activation。</p>\n<h2 id=\"crossentropyloss\">多類單選：CrossEntropyLoss</h2>\n<p>對 N 筆、C 類，模型回傳 logits[N,C]，本課標籤是 long[N]，值在0到C-1。不要先 softmax 再送 CE，因為 CE 會以 logits 計算對數正規化。API 也支援特定機率目標形式，但本課一般分類以索引標籤為主，不混用兩種契約。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL=-\\frac1N\\sum_i\\log\\frac{\\exp(z_{i,y_i})}{\\sum_c\\exp(z_{i,c})}\n$$</div>\n<p>logits 是未正規化分數，可為任意實數。推論取 argmax 不需先 softmax；要展示相對機率才 softmax，仍要另行評估校準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bcewithlogitsloss\">二元與多標籤：BCEWithLogitsLoss</h2>\n<p>單一二元任務可用 logits[N,1] 與 float targets[N,1]，值為0或1；多標籤則兩者 <code>[N,C]</code>，每類可獨立為真。本課先不加 sigmoid，直接用 BCEWithLogitsLoss。binary 單輸出若用 argmax(dim=1)，永遠只有第0欄，應依 sigmoid 機率或 logits 門檻決策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mseloss\">回歸：MSELoss</h2>\n<p>預測與答案的 shape 明確相同，且均為浮點。<code>[N,1]</code> 與 <code>[N]</code> 會觸發非預期廣播；在 loss 前 assert。target 尺度會影響 MSE、梯度與 lr 的實際作用。比較不同資料集的 MSE 時，也要看單位與前處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"reduction\">reduction、權重與忽略位置</h2>\n<p>mean、sum、none 決定縮放。token loss 忽略 PAD 時，分母通常是有效 token，而非樣本數；加入 class weight 後 mean 的分母也需按函數定義理解。本課 train_epoch 的樣本加權公式只對未加權、每樣本一筆的分類契約成立，不直接套到所有 segmentation 或 token 任務。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>三類單選：輸出[N,3] raw logits、target long[N]。三種可同時成立的標籤：輸出[N,3]、target float[N,3]，使用 BCEWithLogits。回歸兩個數：輸出及target都是float[N,2]。執行本章範例，刻意改錯dtype與shape，學會辨認錯誤訊息與不一定報錯的廣播陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/08_losses.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Raw logits, class indices, binary floating targets and matched regression.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">logits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">2.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">classes</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">long</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">binary_logits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">binary_targets</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([[</span><span class=\"mf\">1.</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">]])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">target</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;cross_entropy&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">classes</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;binary_cross_entropy&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">binary_cross_entropy_with_logits</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">binary_logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">binary_targets</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;mse&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mse_loss</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">prediction</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_3\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#loss-functions\">損失函數列表與定義</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 損失函數的資料契約：CE、BCE 與 MSE\n\n分清 logits、機率、索引與浮點標籤，避免多套一次 activation。\n\n## 多類單選：CrossEntropyLoss\n\n對 N 筆、C 類，模型回傳 logits[N,C]，本課標籤是 long[N]，值在0到C-1。不要先 softmax 再送 CE，因為 CE 會以 logits 計算對數正規化。API 也支援特定機率目標形式，但本課一般分類以索引標籤為主，不混用兩種契約。\n\n$$\nL=-\\frac1N\\sum_i\\log\\frac{\\exp(z_{i,y_i})}{\\sum_c\\exp(z_{i,c})}\n$$\n\nlogits 是未正規化分數，可為任意實數。推論取 argmax 不需先 softmax；要展示相對機率才 softmax，仍要另行評估校準。\n\n## 二元與多標籤：BCEWithLogitsLoss\n\n單一二元任務可用 logits[N,1] 與 float targets[N,1]，值為0或1；多標籤則兩者 `[N,C]`，每類可獨立為真。本課先不加 sigmoid，直接用 BCEWithLogitsLoss。binary 單輸出若用 argmax(dim=1)，永遠只有第0欄，應依 sigmoid 機率或 logits 門檻決策。\n\n## 回歸：MSELoss\n\n預測與答案的 shape 明確相同，且均為浮點。`[N,1]` 與 `[N]` 會觸發非預期廣播；在 loss 前 assert。target 尺度會影響 MSE、梯度與 lr 的實際作用。比較不同資料集的 MSE 時，也要看單位與前處理。\n\n## reduction、權重與忽略位置\n\nmean、sum、none 決定縮放。token loss 忽略 PAD 時，分母通常是有效 token，而非樣本數；加入 class weight 後 mean 的分母也需按函數定義理解。本課 train_epoch 的樣本加權公式只對未加權、每樣本一筆的分類契約成立，不直接套到所有 segmentation 或 token 任務。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n三類單選：輸出[N,3] raw logits、target long[N]。三種可同時成立的標籤：輸出[N,3]、target float[N,3]，使用 BCEWithLogits。回歸兩個數：輸出及target都是float[N,2]。執行本章範例，刻意改錯dtype與shape，學會辨認錯誤訊息與不一定報錯的廣播陷阱。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/08_losses.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Raw logits, class indices, binary floating targets and matched regression.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    logits = torch.tensor([[2., -1., 0.], [0., -1., 2.]])\n    classes = torch.tensor([0, 2], dtype=torch.long)\n    binary_logits = torch.tensor([[1.], [-1.]])\n    binary_targets = torch.tensor([[1.], [0.]])\n    prediction, target = torch.zeros(3, 1), torch.ones(3, 1)\n    result = {\"cross_entropy\": F.cross_entropy(logits, classes).item(),\n              \"binary_cross_entropy\": F.binary_cross_entropy_with_logits(binary_logits, binary_targets).item(),\n              \"mse\": F.mse_loss(prediction, target).item()}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [損失函數列表與定義](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#loss-functions)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cebce-mse", "name": "損失函數的資料契約：CE、BCE 與 MSE", "html": "損失函數的資料契約：CE、BCE 與 MSE", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "crossentropyloss", "name": "多類單選：CrossEntropyLoss", "html": "多類單選：CrossEntropyLoss", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "bcewithlogitsloss", "name": "二元與多標籤：BCEWithLogitsLoss", "html": "二元與多標籤：BCEWithLogitsLoss", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "mseloss", "name": "回歸：MSELoss", "html": "回歸：MSELoss", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "reduction", "name": "reduction、權重與忽略位置", "html": "reduction、權重與忽略位置", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "19-optimizers", "group": "training", "title": "Optimizer：SGD、AdamW、param groups 與梯度清除", "summary": "理解更新規則、optimizer 狀態與參數清單，而非只調 learning rate。", "tags": ["SGD", "AdamW", "param groups", "weight decay"], "html": "<h1 id=\"optimizersgdadamwparam-groups\">Optimizer：SGD、AdamW、param groups 與梯度清除</h1>\n<p>理解更新規則、optimizer 狀態與參數清單，而非只調 learning rate。</p>\n<h2 id=\"optimizer\">optimizer 只管理交給它的參數</h2>\n<p>建立 optimizer 時傳入 model.parameters，之後 forward 新建立的層不會自動加入。凍結參數可以先 requires_grad_(False)，再用 filter 組清單。解凍後確認 optimizer 是否包含它，不能只改旗標就期待更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sgd-adamw\">SGD 與 AdamW 的起點</h2>\n<p>SGD 沿梯度下降，Momentum 加入歷史方向；AdamW 使用各參數的一階／二階估計並解耦 weight decay。這些狀態解釋了為何續訓不能只存模型。相同 lr 在不同 optimizer、loss 縮放與 batch 下，更新行為不同。AdamW 的 weight_decay 也不是任何情境都等同在 loss 手加 L2。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">參數分組</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ReLU</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AdamW</span><span class=\"p\">([</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;params&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"s1\">&#39;lr&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"mf\">1e-4</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;params&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"s1\">&#39;lr&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"mf\">1e-3</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n<span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">weight_decay</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.01</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">group</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">param_groups</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">group</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;lr&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">group</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;params&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">]))</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>分組常用於 pretrained backbone 與新 head。不要把同一參數重複放入兩組；記錄規則與參數名稱，續訓時以相同結構建 optimizer，避免狀態錯配。bias、norm 是否 decay 應依模型與訓練方案決定，不是所有專案都一律排除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"clipping\">梯度清除與 clipping</h2>\n<p>每次有效更新先 zero_grad，再 forward/backward。需要 clipping 時放 backward 之後、step 之前；AMP 則先 unscale。zero_grad(set_to_none=True) 不會把參數歸零，只清除梯度。optimizer.step 可能有動量與 decay，不能單憑本輪 grad 為零推定參數絕不變動。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>模型參數有10個Tensor，optimizer只有2個，你預期所有層都訓練嗎？答案：不會；比對 <code>id(p)</code> 清單與 requires_grad，找出遺漏或刻意凍結的部分。另一題：續訓 loss 曲線突然轉折但weights相同，可能缺了什麼？optimizer 動量、scheduler、scaler、RNG與資料位置都要檢查，而非只懷疑存檔壞掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html\">Optimizer 與 scheduler</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Optimizer：SGD、AdamW、param groups 與梯度清除\n\n理解更新規則、optimizer 狀態與參數清單，而非只調 learning rate。\n\n## optimizer 只管理交給它的參數\n\n建立 optimizer 時傳入 model.parameters，之後 forward 新建立的層不會自動加入。凍結參數可以先 requires_grad_(False)，再用 filter 組清單。解凍後確認 optimizer 是否包含它，不能只改旗標就期待更新。\n\n## SGD 與 AdamW 的起點\n\nSGD 沿梯度下降，Momentum 加入歷史方向；AdamW 使用各參數的一階／二階估計並解耦 weight decay。這些狀態解釋了為何續訓不能只存模型。相同 lr 在不同 optimizer、loss 縮放與 batch 下，更新行為不同。AdamW 的 weight_decay 也不是任何情境都等同在 loss 手加 L2。\n\n## 參數分組\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nmodel = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(4,8), nn.ReLU(), nn.Linear(8,3))\noptimizer = torch.optim.AdamW([\n    {'params': model[0].parameters(), 'lr': 1e-4},\n    {'params': model[2].parameters(), 'lr': 1e-3},\n], weight_decay=.01)\nfor group in optimizer.param_groups:\n    print(group['lr'], len(group['params']))\n```\n\n分組常用於 pretrained backbone 與新 head。不要把同一參數重複放入兩組；記錄規則與參數名稱，續訓時以相同結構建 optimizer，避免狀態錯配。bias、norm 是否 decay 應依模型與訓練方案決定，不是所有專案都一律排除。\n\n## 梯度清除與 clipping\n\n每次有效更新先 zero_grad，再 forward/backward。需要 clipping 時放 backward 之後、step 之前；AMP 則先 unscale。zero_grad(set_to_none=True) 不會把參數歸零，只清除梯度。optimizer.step 可能有動量與 decay，不能單憑本輪 grad 為零推定參數絕不變動。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n模型參數有10個Tensor，optimizer只有2個，你預期所有層都訓練嗎？答案：不會；比對 `id(p)` 清單與 requires_grad，找出遺漏或刻意凍結的部分。另一題：續訓 loss 曲線突然轉折但weights相同，可能缺了什麼？optimizer 動量、scheduler、scaler、RNG與資料位置都要檢查，而非只懷疑存檔壞掉。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Optimizer 與 scheduler](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "optimizersgdadamwparam-groups", "name": "Optimizer：SGD、AdamW、param groups 與梯度清除", "html": "Optimizer：SGD、AdamW、param groups 與梯度清除", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "optimizer", "name": "optimizer 只管理交給它的參數", "html": "optimizer 只管理交給它的參數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "sgd-adamw", "name": "SGD 與 AdamW 的起點", "html": "SGD 與 AdamW 的起點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "參數分組", "html": "參數分組", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "clipping", "name": "梯度清除與 clipping", "html": "梯度清除與 clipping", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "20-training-loop", "group": "training", "title": "完整訓練迴圈：每一步都知道在更新什麼", "summary": "從資料 batch 到指標累積，寫出可讀、可檢查的 train_epoch。", "tags": ["train loop", "backward", "metrics", "zero_grad"], "example": "09_training_loop.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">完整訓練迴圈：每一步都知道在更新什麼</h1>\n<p>從資料 batch 到指標累積，寫出可讀、可檢查的 train_epoch。</p>\n<h2 id=\"epoch\">一輪 epoch 的定義</h2>\n<p>本課一個 epoch 是 train loader 完整走過一次。每個 batch 先移device，清梯度，forward，計算scalar loss，backward，再step。model.train() 設定 Dropout／BatchNorm 等行為，它本身不會啟動 optimizer，也不會自動清除梯度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">權重、圖與日誌分開</h2>\n<p>loss 保持 Tensor 直到 backward；日誌才 detach().item。預測只用來計分時 detach 再argmax。當你先把loss轉float，梯度路徑就不在；把所有Tensor塞進history，則可能持續保留圖。範例清楚保留每批更新與整輪摘要的界線。</p>\n<h2 id=\"epoch-mean\">正確計算 epoch mean</h2>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\n\\bar L=\\frac{\\sum_b n_b\\bar L_b}{\\sum_b n_b}\n$$</div>\n<p>假設兩批大小4、2，batch mean分別1、3。正確全樣本平均為(4×1+2×3)/6=1.6667，而直接平均是2。accuracy也應累積正確筆數與總筆數。對token loss或class weight需改用符合實際分母的sum，不機械套用樣本數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">執行本章程式</h2>\n<p>範例將完整SGD train loop直接展開，走96筆資料。觀察samples=96、參數有變動、loss為有限值。這三項只代表迴圈基本可用；是否泛化由下一章驗證。訓練中以更新前的logits計分是常見方式，並不是所有batch都使用epoch最後同一組權重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">最小除錯順序</h2>\n<p>第一批先檢查x.shape、y.dtype、logits.shape。再確認loss是scalar、grad存在且有限、step後參數有差異。若未變，可能是lr=0、參數未交optimizer、凍結或沒有連到loss。不要一開始就加AMP、compile與多GPU，因為它們會增加失敗來源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將batch_size改成20，96筆尾批是16，仍應samples=96。解答：迴圈以 <code>n=y.numel()</code> 累積，不能一律加config.batch_size。再把optimizer.step暫時移除：grad仍存在，但參數不變；這能驗證你分清反向與更新的角色。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/09_training_loop.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A complete real optimizer update, weighted epoch metrics and parameter change.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">make_loaders</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">loaders</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">make_loaders</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">before</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">train</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">total_loss</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">count</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">loaders</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">logits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">total_loss</span> <span class=\"o\">+=</span> <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">numel</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">count</span> <span class=\"o\">+=</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">numel</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;samples&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">count</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;mean_loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">total_loss</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">count</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;weight_changed&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html\">Optimization 教學</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 完整訓練迴圈：每一步都知道在更新什麼\n\n從資料 batch 到指標累積，寫出可讀、可檢查的 train_epoch。\n\n## 一輪 epoch 的定義\n\n本課一個 epoch 是 train loader 完整走過一次。每個 batch 先移device，清梯度，forward，計算scalar loss，backward，再step。model.train() 設定 Dropout／BatchNorm 等行為，它本身不會啟動 optimizer，也不會自動清除梯度。\n\n## 權重、圖與日誌分開\n\nloss 保持 Tensor 直到 backward；日誌才 detach().item。預測只用來計分時 detach 再argmax。當你先把loss轉float，梯度路徑就不在；把所有Tensor塞進history，則可能持續保留圖。範例清楚保留每批更新與整輪摘要的界線。\n\n## 正確計算 epoch mean\n\n$$\n\\bar L=\\frac{\\sum_b n_b\\bar L_b}{\\sum_b n_b}\n$$\n\n假設兩批大小4、2，batch mean分別1、3。正確全樣本平均為(4×1+2×3)/6=1.6667，而直接平均是2。accuracy也應累積正確筆數與總筆數。對token loss或class weight需改用符合實際分母的sum，不機械套用樣本數。\n\n## 執行本章程式\n\n範例將完整SGD train loop直接展開，走96筆資料。觀察samples=96、參數有變動、loss為有限值。這三項只代表迴圈基本可用；是否泛化由下一章驗證。訓練中以更新前的logits計分是常見方式，並不是所有batch都使用epoch最後同一組權重。\n\n## 最小除錯順序\n\n第一批先檢查x.shape、y.dtype、logits.shape。再確認loss是scalar、grad存在且有限、step後參數有差異。若未變，可能是lr=0、參數未交optimizer、凍結或沒有連到loss。不要一開始就加AMP、compile與多GPU，因為它們會增加失敗來源。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將batch_size改成20，96筆尾批是16，仍應samples=96。解答：迴圈以 `n=y.numel()` 累積，不能一律加config.batch_size。再把optimizer.step暫時移除：grad仍存在，但參數不變；這能驗證你分清反向與更新的角色。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/09_training_loop.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A complete real optimizer update, weighted epoch metrics and parameter change.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import Config, make_loaders, setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    loaders, _, _ = make_loaders(Config())\n    model = nn.Linear(4, 3)\n    optimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=.1)\n    before = model.weight.detach().clone()\n    model.train()\n    total_loss, count = 0., 0\n    for x, y in loaders[0]:\n        optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n        logits = model(x)\n        loss = F.cross_entropy(logits, y)\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n        total_loss += loss.detach().item() * y.numel()\n        count += y.numel()\n    result = {\"samples\": count, \"mean_loss\": total_loss/count,\n              \"weight_changed\": not torch.equal(before, model.weight)}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Optimization 教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "完整訓練迴圈：每一步都知道在更新什麼", "html": "完整訓練迴圈：每一步都知道在更新什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "epoch", "name": "一輪 epoch 的定義", "html": "一輪 epoch 的定義", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "權重、圖與日誌分開", "html": "權重、圖與日誌分開", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "epoch-mean", "name": "正確計算 epoch mean", "html": "正確計算 epoch mean", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "執行本章程式", "html": "執行本章程式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "最小除錯順序", "html": "最小除錯順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "21-evaluation", "group": "training", "title": "驗證與推論：eval、no_grad、inference_mode", "summary": "兩種獨立開關：模組行為與Autograd記錄，必須各自設定。", "tags": ["eval", "no_grad", "inference_mode", "Dropout"], "example": "10_evaluation.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"evalno_gradinference_mode\">驗證與推論：eval、no_grad、inference_mode</h1>\n<p>兩種獨立開關：模組行為與Autograd記錄，必須各自設定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eval\">eval 不是關閉梯度</h2>\n<p>model.eval() 相當於將模組切到train(False)，使Dropout、BatchNorm等使用推論行為。一般Linear仍可建立計算圖，所以eval後output.requires_grad仍可能True。相反地，no_grad只改Autograd記錄，不會幫你關Dropout。正式驗證通常需要兩者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"no_grad-inference_mode\">選擇 no_grad 或 inference_mode</h2>\n<p>no_grad適合不需要記錄該段運算；inference_mode有額外限制與優化，適合輸出不會再投入需梯度記錄的推論路徑。不能把inference mode建立的Tensor任意帶回訓練並假設一切相同。兩者都不是參數凍結旗標，也不會替你改model.training。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Dropout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># True</span>\n<span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inference_mode</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">output</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>    <span class=\"c1\"># False</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_1\">模式還原與驗證資料</h2>\n<p>本課evaluate在進入時記錄原training旗標，以finally還原；若模型原本eval，結束仍eval。這個小型模型各層模式一致；若你刻意把部分backbone設eval，需逐模組管理混合模式，不可假設一次model.train(previous)能還原各子層差異。</p>\n<p>驗證不shuffle、不做隨機train增強，不用驗證答案反向更新參數。仍可依驗證結果選超參數／best checkpoint，因此最後需要獨立test衡量選擇後的結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>Dropout模型重複預測不同，只有包no_grad仍不同，原因是它還在train mode。加入eval後核對同一輸入輸出一致。若在驗證後忘記切回train，Dropout可能整個後半訓練都被關閉。解答：明確在train_epoch開始呼叫train，evaluate使用try/finally，並加入模式與grad行為測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/10_evaluation.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;eval changes layer behavior; no_grad/inference_mode change graph recording.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Dropout</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">recorded</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">no_grad_output</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inference_mode</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">inference_output</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;eval_still_records_grad&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">recorded</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;no_grad_records&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">no_grad_output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;inference_records&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">inference_output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;dropout_disabled&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad_output</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">inference_output</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html#evaluation-mode-nn-module-eval\">Evaluation mode 與 grad modes</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 驗證與推論：eval、no_grad、inference_mode\n\n兩種獨立開關：模組行為與Autograd記錄，必須各自設定。\n\n## eval 不是關閉梯度\n\nmodel.eval() 相當於將模組切到train(False)，使Dropout、BatchNorm等使用推論行為。一般Linear仍可建立計算圖，所以eval後output.requires_grad仍可能True。相反地，no_grad只改Autograd記錄，不會幫你關Dropout。正式驗證通常需要兩者。\n\n## 選擇 no_grad 或 inference_mode\n\nno_grad適合不需要記錄該段運算；inference_mode有額外限制與優化，適合輸出不會再投入需梯度記錄的推論路徑。不能把inference mode建立的Tensor任意帶回訓練並假設一切相同。兩者都不是參數凍結旗標，也不會替你改model.training。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nmodel = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(4,3), nn.Dropout(.5))\nx = torch.ones(2,4)\nmodel.eval()\nprint(model(x).requires_grad)  # True\nwith torch.inference_mode():\n    output = model(x)\nprint(output.requires_grad)    # False\n```\n\n## 模式還原與驗證資料\n\n本課evaluate在進入時記錄原training旗標，以finally還原；若模型原本eval，結束仍eval。這個小型模型各層模式一致；若你刻意把部分backbone設eval，需逐模組管理混合模式，不可假設一次model.train(previous)能還原各子層差異。\n\n驗證不shuffle、不做隨機train增強，不用驗證答案反向更新參數。仍可依驗證結果選超參數／best checkpoint，因此最後需要獨立test衡量選擇後的結果。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nDropout模型重複預測不同，只有包no_grad仍不同，原因是它還在train mode。加入eval後核對同一輸入輸出一致。若在驗證後忘記切回train，Dropout可能整個後半訓練都被關閉。解答：明確在train_epoch開始呼叫train，evaluate使用try/finally，並加入模式與grad行為測試。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/10_evaluation.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"eval changes layer behavior; no_grad/inference_mode change graph recording.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    model = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(4, 4), nn.Dropout(.5))\n    x = torch.ones(2, 4)\n    model.eval()\n    recorded = model(x)\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        no_grad_output = model(x)\n    with torch.inference_mode():\n        inference_output = model(x)\n    result = {\"eval_still_records_grad\": recorded.requires_grad,\n              \"no_grad_records\": no_grad_output.requires_grad,\n              \"inference_records\": inference_output.requires_grad,\n              \"dropout_disabled\": torch.equal(no_grad_output, inference_output)}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Evaluation mode 與 grad modes](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html#evaluation-mode-nn-module-eval)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "evalno_gradinference_mode", "name": "驗證與推論：eval、no_grad、inference_mode", "html": "驗證與推論：eval、no_grad、inference_mode", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "eval", "name": "eval 不是關閉梯度", "html": "eval 不是關閉梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "no_grad-inference_mode", "name": "選擇 no_grad 或 inference_mode", "html": "選擇 no_grad 或 inference_mode", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "模式還原與驗證資料", "html": "模式還原與驗證資料", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "22-metrics", "group": "training", "title": "評估指標與資料洩漏：accuracy 之外要看什麼", "summary": "以混淆矩陣、基準模型與切分策略，判斷訓練成效是否可信。", "tags": ["metrics", "accuracy", "precision", "recall", "leakage"], "html": "<h1 id=\"accuracy\">評估指標與資料洩漏：accuracy 之外要看什麼</h1>\n<p>以混淆矩陣、基準模型與切分策略，判斷訓練成效是否可信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先定義你真正關心的錯誤</h2>\n<p>100筆只有5筆正例，全部預測負例就有95% accuracy，但正例recall是0。分類需看每類支持筆數、混淆矩陣及precision／recall；回歸需看MAE／RMSE、單位、殘差與不同子群。loss用於更新，業務指標用於評估，兩者不必同名。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nP=\\frac{TP}{TP+FP},\\qquad R=\\frac{TP}{TP+FN},\\qquad F_1=\\frac{2PR}{P+R}\n$$</div>\n<p>分母為零時要有明確政策，例如回報0並附支持筆數。macro對每類平均，micro先合計計數，weighted依支持數；它們回答不同問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tensor\">直接用 Tensor 建混淆矩陣</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">target</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">pred</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">C</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n<span class=\"n\">matrix</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bincount</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">C</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">pred</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">minlength</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reshape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">matrix</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># row=true, column=predicted</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">matrix</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">diag</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">float</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"n\">matrix</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>先說明列與欄方向，否則precision和recall容易交換。累積整體計數再算比例，避免平均各batch的比例造成尾批權重錯誤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">防止用答案幫模型作弊</h2>\n<p>同一用戶、原圖增強版或文件切塊若跨split，會讓驗證過於樂觀。標準化、詞表、特徵選擇也只fit train。threshold、early stopping、架構選擇用val；test留到最終方案固定。本課合成資料沒有真實部署分布，因此test高分也只作為教學流程結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">與簡單基準比較</h2>\n<p>多數類、線性模型或固定平均值往往是必要基準。只有複雜MLP卻沒有比較，你不知道提升是否來自模型還是資料本來容易。每次結果保留seed與split資訊，不能拿不同切分下的0.9與0.91直接宣稱進步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>二元分類TP=8、FP=2、FN=4，precision=.8、recall=2/3、F1約.7273。若提高接受門檻，precision是否一定上升？不保證個別資料上單調，需重新計數；通常只是改變取捨。下一次換資料時沿用同一門檻也需要再驗證，而非把0.5當普遍正確答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/torch.html\">torch.bincount</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html\">資料與評估教學</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 評估指標與資料洩漏：accuracy 之外要看什麼\n\n以混淆矩陣、基準模型與切分策略，判斷訓練成效是否可信。\n\n## 先定義你真正關心的錯誤\n\n100筆只有5筆正例，全部預測負例就有95% accuracy，但正例recall是0。分類需看每類支持筆數、混淆矩陣及precision／recall；回歸需看MAE／RMSE、單位、殘差與不同子群。loss用於更新，業務指標用於評估，兩者不必同名。\n\n$$\nP=\\frac{TP}{TP+FP},\\qquad R=\\frac{TP}{TP+FN},\\qquad F_1=\\frac{2PR}{P+R}\n$$\n\n分母為零時要有明確政策，例如回報0並附支持筆數。macro對每類平均，micro先合計計數，weighted依支持數；它們回答不同問題。\n\n## 直接用 Tensor 建混淆矩陣\n\n```python\nimport torch\ntarget = torch.tensor([0,0,1,1,2])\npred = torch.tensor([0,1,1,0,2])\nC = 3\nmatrix = torch.bincount(target*C + pred, minlength=C*C).reshape(C,C)\nprint(matrix)  # row=true, column=predicted\nprint(matrix.diag().sum().float()/matrix.sum())\n```\n\n先說明列與欄方向，否則precision和recall容易交換。累積整體計數再算比例，避免平均各batch的比例造成尾批權重錯誤。\n\n## 防止用答案幫模型作弊\n\n同一用戶、原圖增強版或文件切塊若跨split，會讓驗證過於樂觀。標準化、詞表、特徵選擇也只fit train。threshold、early stopping、架構選擇用val；test留到最終方案固定。本課合成資料沒有真實部署分布，因此test高分也只作為教學流程結果。\n\n## 與簡單基準比較\n\n多數類、線性模型或固定平均值往往是必要基準。只有複雜MLP卻沒有比較，你不知道提升是否來自模型還是資料本來容易。每次結果保留seed與split資訊，不能拿不同切分下的0.9與0.91直接宣稱進步。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n二元分類TP=8、FP=2、FN=4，precision=.8、recall=2/3、F1約.7273。若提高接受門檻，precision是否一定上升？不保證個別資料上單調，需重新計數；通常只是改變取捨。下一次換資料時沿用同一門檻也需要再驗證，而非把0.5當普遍正確答案。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [torch.bincount](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/torch.html)\n- [資料與評估教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "accuracy", "name": "評估指標與資料洩漏：accuracy 之外要看什麼", "html": "評估指標與資料洩漏：accuracy 之外要看什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先定義你真正關心的錯誤", "html": "先定義你真正關心的錯誤", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "tensor", "name": "直接用 Tensor 建混淆矩陣", "html": "直接用 Tensor 建混淆矩陣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "防止用答案幫模型作弊", "html": "防止用答案幫模型作弊", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "與簡單基準比較", "html": "與簡單基準比較", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "23-scheduling", "group": "training", "title": "學習率排程、Early Stopping 與最佳模型", "summary": "讓停止條件與best checkpoint可解釋，也能在中斷後繼續。", "tags": ["scheduler", "early stopping", "best checkpoint"], "html": "<h1 id=\"early-stopping\">學習率排程、Early Stopping 與最佳模型</h1>\n<p>讓停止條件與best checkpoint可解釋，也能在中斷後繼續。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">排程需要知道更新單位</h2>\n<p>StepLR可每幾個epoch降低lr；CosineAnnealingLR依設定週期變化；ReduceLROnPlateau依傳入指標決定。先決定scheduler.step以batch還是epoch為單位，T_max或step_size也要使用同一單位。一般參數更新後再呼叫排程；plateau則在完成驗證、取得指標後呼叫。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">scheduler</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lr_scheduler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">StepLR</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">step_size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">gamma</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">epoch</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">epoch</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">param_groups</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;lr&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">scheduler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>上例只展示順序，實際是一整個train_epoch結束後再step。AMP若跳過optimizer更新，按更新次數排程的邏輯也要處理對應步數，不只照迴圈計數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"early-stopping_1\">early stopping的狀態</h2>\n<p>選定val loss越小越好，定義min_delta、patience與best。改善時清等待次數並保存快照；無改善累積至patience才停止。不要偷看test來重設patience，也不要因單一較差epoch立刻判定過擬合。若恢復訓練，best、wait、scheduler state都需要保存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"best-weights\">best weights要真的凍結</h2>\n<p><code>best_state=model.state_dict()</code>可能仍引用正在更新的Tensor。使用逐值detach().cpu().clone，或直接保存到獨立檔案。訓練結束先load best，再評估test；「最後一輪」與「驗證最佳」是不同選擇。課程專題保留current model供resume，另存best_model供最終推論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>val losses為[.8,.6,.61,.62,.59]，patience=2且min_delta=0時，會在第4輪停止；第5輪不會發生。若你事後看到.59才調patience，就是用額外資訊做選擇，需要誠實記錄。另一題：只存best weights可以續訓到完全相同結果嗎？答案：不足，仍缺current optimizer、RNG、scheduler與資料位置等狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html#how-to-adjust-learning-rate\">學習率排程與順序</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/saveloadrun_tutorial.html\">模型存取教學</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 學習率排程、Early Stopping 與最佳模型\n\n讓停止條件與best checkpoint可解釋，也能在中斷後繼續。\n\n## 排程需要知道更新單位\n\nStepLR可每幾個epoch降低lr；CosineAnnealingLR依設定週期變化；ReduceLROnPlateau依傳入指標決定。先決定scheduler.step以batch還是epoch為單位，T_max或step_size也要使用同一單位。一般參數更新後再呼叫排程；plateau則在完成驗證、取得指標後呼叫。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nmodel = torch.nn.Linear(4,3)\noptimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=.1)\nscheduler = torch.optim.lr_scheduler.StepLR(optimizer, step_size=2, gamma=.5)\nfor epoch in range(4):\n    optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n    model(torch.ones(2,4)).square().mean().backward()\n    optimizer.step()\n    print(epoch+1, optimizer.param_groups[0]['lr'])\n    scheduler.step()\n```\n\n上例只展示順序，實際是一整個train_epoch結束後再step。AMP若跳過optimizer更新，按更新次數排程的邏輯也要處理對應步數，不只照迴圈計數。\n\n## early stopping的狀態\n\n選定val loss越小越好，定義min_delta、patience與best。改善時清等待次數並保存快照；無改善累積至patience才停止。不要偷看test來重設patience，也不要因單一較差epoch立刻判定過擬合。若恢復訓練，best、wait、scheduler state都需要保存。\n\n## best weights要真的凍結\n\n`best_state=model.state_dict()`可能仍引用正在更新的Tensor。使用逐值detach().cpu().clone，或直接保存到獨立檔案。訓練結束先load best，再評估test；「最後一輪」與「驗證最佳」是不同選擇。課程專題保留current model供resume，另存best_model供最終推論。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\nval losses為[.8,.6,.61,.62,.59]，patience=2且min_delta=0時，會在第4輪停止；第5輪不會發生。若你事後看到.59才調patience，就是用額外資訊做選擇，需要誠實記錄。另一題：只存best weights可以續訓到完全相同結果嗎？答案：不足，仍缺current optimizer、RNG、scheduler與資料位置等狀態。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [學習率排程與順序](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/optim.html#how-to-adjust-learning-rate)\n- [模型存取教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/saveloadrun_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "early-stopping", "name": "學習率排程、Early Stopping 與最佳模型", "html": "學習率排程、Early Stopping 與最佳模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "排程需要知道更新單位", "html": "排程需要知道更新單位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "early-stopping_1", "name": "early stopping的狀態", "html": "early stopping的狀態", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "best-weights", "name": "best weights要真的凍結", "html": "best weights要真的凍結", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "24-regression", "group": "training", "title": "第一個完整回歸：讓 Linear 學會一條直線", "summary": "從已知答案的合成問題，核對loss下降、權重與偏移。", "tags": ["regression", "Linear", "MSE", "SGD"], "example": "11_regression.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"linear\">第一個完整回歸：讓 Linear 學會一條直線</h1>\n<p>從已知答案的合成問題，核對loss下降、權重與偏移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">選擇能知道答案的任務</h2>\n<p>資料由y=3x+0.5產生，模型Linear(1,1)也有一個w與b，理論上能表示正確直線。這不是追求真實資料高分，而是用可知答案檢查整個更新流程。先在無雜訊小資料學會，再加入雜訊、切分與泛化，能更快定位哪一層出錯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">輸入、輸出與損失</h2>\n<p>x與y都是float32[N,1]。forward得到同shape，MSE對全部樣本與輸出平均。標準SGD更新100次，範例回報initial_loss、final_loss、weight與bias。結果應接近w=3、b=.5，但精確尾數與更新預算有關，不能把最後一個浮點數寫死為跨平台保證。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL(w,b)=\\frac1N\\sum_i(wx_i+b-(3x_i+0.5))^2\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">讀出學到的規則</h2>\n<p>除了loss，也檢查參數是否合理：w接近3、b接近.5。再輸入未訓練過的x，比對3x+.5。因資料是理想直線，線性模型對範圍外也有正確結構；真實資料不能因此假定外插可靠。模型能擬合訓練點與理解生成機制不是同一種證據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">改動一次一個因素</h2>\n<p>將lr設太大，觀察loss震盪或發散；漏zero_grad，觀察更新含過去梯度；將y改[N]，觀察非預期廣播。每次只改一項並恢復原檔。若同時改optimizer、batch與模型，難以知道差異來自哪裡。這也是工程實驗記錄的基本原則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把資料改成y=-2x+1，保持相同架構，預期w接近-2、b接近1。再加<code>0.1*randn</code>雜訊，最佳參數不必剛好等於生成值，loss也不會降到零。若改成y=x²，單一Linear無法完整表示曲線；增加訓練次數不能解決模型表達能力的限制，應回到問題與架構。</p>\n<p>完整範例只有訓練資料，用於可學性sanity check；真實回歸專案應比照第25章建立train/val/test並只fit train的前處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/11_regression.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Learn y=3x+0.5 from synthetic data; target and prediction both have [N,1].&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">linspace</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">unsqueeze</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mf\">.5</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.15</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">initial</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mse_loss</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mse_loss</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;initial_loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">initial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;final_loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mse_loss</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;weight&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;bias&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">bias</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html\">Linear 與 MSE</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html\">訓練教學</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 第一個完整回歸：讓 Linear 學會一條直線\n\n從已知答案的合成問題，核對loss下降、權重與偏移。\n\n## 選擇能知道答案的任務\n\n資料由y=3x+0.5產生，模型Linear(1,1)也有一個w與b，理論上能表示正確直線。這不是追求真實資料高分，而是用可知答案檢查整個更新流程。先在無雜訊小資料學會，再加入雜訊、切分與泛化，能更快定位哪一層出錯。\n\n## 輸入、輸出與損失\n\nx與y都是float32[N,1]。forward得到同shape，MSE對全部樣本與輸出平均。標準SGD更新100次，範例回報initial_loss、final_loss、weight與bias。結果應接近w=3、b=.5，但精確尾數與更新預算有關，不能把最後一個浮點數寫死為跨平台保證。\n\n$$\nL(w,b)=\\frac1N\\sum_i(wx_i+b-(3x_i+0.5))^2\n$$\n\n## 讀出學到的規則\n\n除了loss，也檢查參數是否合理：w接近3、b接近.5。再輸入未訓練過的x，比對3x+.5。因資料是理想直線，線性模型對範圍外也有正確結構；真實資料不能因此假定外插可靠。模型能擬合訓練點與理解生成機制不是同一種證據。\n\n## 改動一次一個因素\n\n將lr設太大，觀察loss震盪或發散；漏zero_grad，觀察更新含過去梯度；將y改[N]，觀察非預期廣播。每次只改一項並恢復原檔。若同時改optimizer、batch與模型，難以知道差異來自哪裡。這也是工程實驗記錄的基本原則。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把資料改成y=-2x+1，保持相同架構，預期w接近-2、b接近1。再加`0.1*randn`雜訊，最佳參數不必剛好等於生成值，loss也不會降到零。若改成y=x²，單一Linear無法完整表示曲線；增加訓練次數不能解決模型表達能力的限制，應回到問題與架構。\n\n完整範例只有訓練資料，用於可學性sanity check；真實回歸專案應比照第25章建立train/val/test並只fit train的前處理。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/11_regression.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Learn y=3x+0.5 from synthetic data; target and prediction both have [N,1].\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x = torch.linspace(-1, 1, 32).unsqueeze(1)\n    y = 3*x + .5\n    model = nn.Linear(1, 1)\n    optimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=.15)\n    initial = F.mse_loss(model(x), y).item()\n    for _ in range(100):\n        optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n        loss = F.mse_loss(model(x), y)\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n    result = {\"initial_loss\": initial, \"final_loss\": F.mse_loss(model(x), y).item(),\n              \"weight\": model.weight.item(), \"bias\": model.bias.item()}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Linear 與 MSE](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html)\n- [訓練教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "linear", "name": "第一個完整回歸：讓 Linear 學會一條直線", "html": "第一個完整回歸：讓 Linear 學會一條直線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "選擇能知道答案的任務", "html": "選擇能知道答案的任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "輸入、輸出與損失", "html": "輸入、輸出與損失", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "讀出學到的規則", "html": "讀出學到的規則", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "改動一次一個因素", "html": "改動一次一個因素", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "25-classification", "group": "practice", "title": "表格分類專案：資料、MLP、驗證與測試", "summary": "沿著一份完整實驗，追蹤資料在哪裡產生、參數如何更新、成績如何取得。", "tags": ["classification", "MLP", "train", "val", "test"], "example": "12_classification.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"mlp\">表格分類專案：資料、MLP、驗證與測試</h1>\n<p>沿著一份完整實驗，追蹤資料在哪裡產生、參數如何更新、成績如何取得。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">專案輸入與產出</h2>\n<p>每筆4個浮點特徵，3類單選，總共160筆合成資料。teacher線性映射產生標籤，但學生只得到x與y。固定切分96/32/32，train-only標準化；TinyMLP使用4→12→3與Dropout。這是用來練工程流程的小問題，不是現實資料集的benchmark。</p>\n<h2 id=\"course_core\">按資料流讀 course_core</h2>\n<p><code>Config.validate</code>檢查尺寸與超參數；<code>make_data</code>生成與切分；<code>make_loaders</code>建立獨立shuffle generator；<code>TinyMLP</code>回傳logits；<code>train_epoch</code>更新；<code>evaluate</code>以inference mode回報加權指標；<code>experiment</code>串起epoch與best model。不要跳過共用模組，只看入口的十行就認為沒有訓練實作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">一輪實驗應回報什麼</h2>\n<p>initial_validation提供未訓練基準；history保存每輪train/val loss；final_validation使用最後權重；test使用驗證最佳權重。它們可能來自不同時間點。不要把test最好的一輪挑出來當成未調參的測試結果，也不要把train accuracy當成泛化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">將資料換成自己的</h2>\n<p>保留x[N,F]、y[N]、label mapping與split契約，更新features/classes與前處理。類別索引需連續映射到0..C-1，推論時保留反向名稱。缺失值、字串欄位與時間欄位需要額外處理；不能把任何CSV全轉float就當準備完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將dropout從.1改0，保持seed與split，觀察train與val而非只看單一最終值。增加hidden不保證test更高；小資料可能出現更大變異。先記錄兩個設定，再在val比較。若反覆看test做決策，它就變成另一個驗證集，需要另找未使用資料。</p>\n<p>最後檢查儲存產物：除了model state，還要有4個feature的順序、train mean/scale、class mapping、Torch版本與設定。這些共同定義可用模型；單獨的99個參數無法告訴你輸入欄位的意義。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/12_classification.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Disjoint synthetic splits; validation selects best weights, test is separate.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;initial_validation&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;initial_validation&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;final_validation&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;final_validation&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;test_of_best_validation_model&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;test&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;epochs&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;history&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;data&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;synthetic only&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html\">建立模型與最佳化</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 表格分類專案：資料、MLP、驗證與測試\n\n沿著一份完整實驗，追蹤資料在哪裡產生、參數如何更新、成績如何取得。\n\n## 專案輸入與產出\n\n每筆4個浮點特徵，3類單選，總共160筆合成資料。teacher線性映射產生標籤，但學生只得到x與y。固定切分96/32/32，train-only標準化；TinyMLP使用4→12→3與Dropout。這是用來練工程流程的小問題，不是現實資料集的benchmark。\n\n## 按資料流讀 course_core\n\n`Config.validate`檢查尺寸與超參數；`make_data`生成與切分；`make_loaders`建立獨立shuffle generator；`TinyMLP`回傳logits；`train_epoch`更新；`evaluate`以inference mode回報加權指標；`experiment`串起epoch與best model。不要跳過共用模組，只看入口的十行就認為沒有訓練實作。\n\n## 一輪實驗應回報什麼\n\ninitial_validation提供未訓練基準；history保存每輪train/val loss；final_validation使用最後權重；test使用驗證最佳權重。它們可能來自不同時間點。不要把test最好的一輪挑出來當成未調參的測試結果，也不要把train accuracy當成泛化。\n\n## 將資料換成自己的\n\n保留x[N,F]、y[N]、label mapping與split契約，更新features/classes與前處理。類別索引需連續映射到0..C-1，推論時保留反向名稱。缺失值、字串欄位與時間欄位需要額外處理；不能把任何CSV全轉float就當準備完成。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將dropout從.1改0，保持seed與split，觀察train與val而非只看單一最終值。增加hidden不保證test更高；小資料可能出現更大變異。先記錄兩個設定，再在val比較。若反覆看test做決策，它就變成另一個驗證集，需要另找未使用資料。\n\n最後檢查儲存產物：除了model state，還要有4個feature的順序、train mean/scale、class mapping、Torch版本與設定。這些共同定義可用模型；單獨的99個參數無法告訴你輸入欄位的意義。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/12_classification.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Disjoint synthetic splits; validation selects best weights, test is separate.\"\"\"\nimport json\nfrom course_core import experiment\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    run = experiment()\n    result = {\"initial_validation\": run[\"initial_validation\"], \"final_validation\": run[\"final_validation\"],\n              \"test_of_best_validation_model\": run[\"test\"], \"epochs\": len(run[\"history\"]), \"data\": \"synthetic only\"}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [建立模型與最佳化](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/optimization_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "mlp", "name": "表格分類專案：資料、MLP、驗證與測試", "html": "表格分類專案：資料、MLP、驗證與測試", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "專案輸入與產出", "html": "專案輸入與產出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "course_core", "name": "按資料流讀 course_core", "html": "按資料流讀 course_core", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "一輪實驗應回報什麼", "html": "一輪實驗應回報什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "將資料換成自己的", "html": "將資料換成自己的", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "26-cnn", "group": "practice", "title": "CNN 實作：從 NCHW 到可訓練的影像分類器", "summary": "在自行產生的橫線與直線圖片上驗證Conv2d、Flatten與分類流程。", "tags": ["CNN", "Conv2d", "NCHW", "images"], "example": "13_cnn.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"cnn-nchw\">CNN 實作：從 NCHW 到可訓練的影像分類器</h1>\n<p>在自行產生的橫線與直線圖片上驗證Conv2d、Flatten與分類流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">選擇不用下載的影像任務</h2>\n<p>範例生成32張1×8×8圖片，以橫帶與直帶區分兩類，加少量固定seed的雜訊。目的是確定CNN有梯度且能擬合簡單模式。所有train accuracy都只對這32張計算；它沒有真實圖片測試集，不能當作一般影像辨識能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">網路的形狀帳本</h2>\n<p>輸入[N,1,8,8]，Conv2d(1,4,3,padding=1)得到[N,4,8,8]，ReLU不改shape，Flatten(start_dim=1)得到[N,256]，Linear(256,2)得到[N,2] logits。答案long[N]搭配CE。每一層都可以用一個batch印shape來核對，而不是只在loss出錯時亂改維度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">真實圖片還需要的前處理</h2>\n<p>PIL常以HWC呈現；轉Tensor時需確認CHW、浮點範圍與channel順序。uint8的0..255與float的0..1不同。RGB、灰階、透明alpha也要決定。Resize、標準化與增強在train/val的規則不同，pretrained模型更需使用其要求的transforms，並配對torchvision相容版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"overfit\">為何先做 overfit 檢查</h2>\n<p>小資料都無法下降，先查輸入尺度、label、loss契約、lr與參數註冊。能擬合後再切資料與增加正則化。若一開始就加大量augmentation，小模型的失敗可能來自難度而非程式bug，很難判別。這不是鼓勵正式專案只報train分數，而是有目的的診斷實驗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將輸入改16×16，保持padding=1與stride1，Flatten變4×16×16=1024；可改Linear(1024,2)，或改用AdaptiveAvgPool2d降低對輸入尺寸的依賴。若加入pool2，每邊減半再計算。不要用batch_size乘入Linear輸入特徵數，batch軸應保留。</p>\n<p>進一步實作train/val切分與每類混淆矩陣，才能討論合成分布上的泛化。再加入更斜的線、位置偏移或不同雜訊，觀察模型學的是方向還是固定位置；這是資料設計與模型假設之間的實際連結。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/13_cnn.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train a tiny CNN on generated horizontal/vertical bands. No downloads.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">generator</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Generator</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">17</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">images</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mf\">.05</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">labels</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">%</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">images</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">:,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">:]</span> <span class=\"o\">+=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">images</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">:,</span> <span class=\"p\">:,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">+=</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Conv2d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">padding</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ReLU</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Flatten</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">initial</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">images</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">25</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">images</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inference_mode</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">logits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">images</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;input_shape&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">images</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;output_shape&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;initial_loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">initial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;final_loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;training_accuracy&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">argmax</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eq</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">float</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;scope&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;Synthetic training sanity check; not real-image accuracy&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#convolution-layers\">卷積層</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/blitz/cifar10_tutorial.html\">官方視覺教學</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# CNN 實作：從 NCHW 到可訓練的影像分類器\n\n在自行產生的橫線與直線圖片上驗證Conv2d、Flatten與分類流程。\n\n## 選擇不用下載的影像任務\n\n範例生成32張1×8×8圖片，以橫帶與直帶區分兩類，加少量固定seed的雜訊。目的是確定CNN有梯度且能擬合簡單模式。所有train accuracy都只對這32張計算；它沒有真實圖片測試集，不能當作一般影像辨識能力。\n\n## 網路的形狀帳本\n\n輸入[N,1,8,8]，Conv2d(1,4,3,padding=1)得到[N,4,8,8]，ReLU不改shape，Flatten(start_dim=1)得到[N,256]，Linear(256,2)得到[N,2] logits。答案long[N]搭配CE。每一層都可以用一個batch印shape來核對，而不是只在loss出錯時亂改維度。\n\n## 真實圖片還需要的前處理\n\nPIL常以HWC呈現；轉Tensor時需確認CHW、浮點範圍與channel順序。uint8的0..255與float的0..1不同。RGB、灰階、透明alpha也要決定。Resize、標準化與增強在train/val的規則不同，pretrained模型更需使用其要求的transforms，並配對torchvision相容版本。\n\n## 為何先做 overfit 檢查\n\n小資料都無法下降，先查輸入尺度、label、loss契約、lr與參數註冊。能擬合後再切資料與增加正則化。若一開始就加大量augmentation，小模型的失敗可能來自難度而非程式bug，很難判別。這不是鼓勵正式專案只報train分數，而是有目的的診斷實驗。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將輸入改16×16，保持padding=1與stride1，Flatten變4×16×16=1024；可改Linear(1024,2)，或改用AdaptiveAvgPool2d降低對輸入尺寸的依賴。若加入pool2，每邊減半再計算。不要用batch_size乘入Linear輸入特徵數，batch軸應保留。\n\n進一步實作train/val切分與每類混淆矩陣，才能討論合成分布上的泛化。再加入更斜的線、位置偏移或不同雜訊，觀察模型學的是方向還是固定位置；這是資料設計與模型假設之間的實際連結。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/13_cnn.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train a tiny CNN on generated horizontal/vertical bands. No downloads.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    generator = torch.Generator().manual_seed(17)\n    images = torch.randn(32, 1, 8, 8, generator=generator)*.05\n    labels = torch.arange(32) % 2\n    images[labels == 0, :, 3:5, :] += 1\n    images[labels == 1, :, :, 3:5] += 1\n    model = nn.Sequential(nn.Conv2d(1, 4, 3, padding=1), nn.ReLU(), nn.Flatten(), nn.Linear(4*8*8, 2))\n    optimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(), lr=.2)\n    initial = F.cross_entropy(model(images), labels).item()\n    for _ in range(25):\n        optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n        loss = F.cross_entropy(model(images), labels)\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n    model.eval()\n    with torch.inference_mode():\n        logits = model(images)\n    result = {\"input_shape\": list(images.shape), \"output_shape\": list(logits.shape),\n              \"initial_loss\": initial, \"final_loss\": F.cross_entropy(logits, labels).item(),\n              \"training_accuracy\": logits.argmax(1).eq(labels).float().mean().item(),\n              \"scope\": \"Synthetic training sanity check; not real-image accuracy\"}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [卷積層](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#convolution-layers)\n- [官方視覺教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/blitz/cifar10_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cnn-nchw", "name": "CNN 實作：從 NCHW 到可訓練的影像分類器", "html": "CNN 實作：從 NCHW 到可訓練的影像分類器", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "選擇不用下載的影像任務", "html": "選擇不用下載的影像任務", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "網路的形狀帳本", "html": "網路的形狀帳本", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "真實圖片還需要的前處理", "html": "真實圖片還需要的前處理", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "overfit", "name": "為何先做 overfit 檢查", "html": "為何先做 overfit 檢查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "27-sequences", "group": "practice", "title": "序列實作：Embedding、mask pooling 與文字分類", "summary": "用小詞表練習token ID、PAD梯度與序列到類別的轉換。", "tags": ["Embedding", "sequence", "pooling", "padding_idx"], "example": "14_sequences.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"embeddingmask-pooling\">序列實作：Embedding、mask pooling 與文字分類</h1>\n<p>用小詞表練習token ID、PAD梯度與序列到類別的轉換。</p>\n<h2 id=\"token\">從 token 到句子表示</h2>\n<p>輸入tokens[N,T]為long索引，Embedding把它轉成[N,T,D]，mask去除PAD後對有效位置平均，再由Linear(D,C)分類。這條路徑可完整訓練，與呼叫外部Embedding API不同。模型從這份極小合成資料開始學參數，不包含預訓練語言理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">最小架構的能力限制</h2>\n<p>mean pooling忽略順序，[1,2]與[2,1]得到相同句向量。若任務需要語序，需加入RNN、位置資訊或Attention等架構。本課先把資料與梯度工程講清楚，更完整的Transformer理論由獨立課程承接。不要把詞袋式示範說成已具備大語言模型能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"padding\">Padding 的兩個測試</h2>\n<p>增加尾部PAD不應改變句子表示；padding_idx=0那一列的梯度應為零。本課測試對兩項都驗證。label float或token ID超出vocabulary時，應先修資料契約，不用clamp把所有未知詞默默改成最後一個token。正式tokenizer應定義UNK與PAD規則。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">訓練與推論的相同契約</h2>\n<p>保存詞表／tokenizer版本、截斷長度、大小寫與正規化方式。推論沿用同一套ID，即使兩份詞表大小相同，只要ID對應不同，Embedding列的意義就全錯。這與向量模型的「同維度不代表同空間」有相似的工程風險。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>讓<code>[1,2,0,0]</code>和<code>[1,2]</code>分別推論，比較logits，應在容許誤差內相同。把mean改成普通<code>.mean(dim=1)</code>後，結果開始依PAD長度改變，證明錯誤來自分母。再比較[1,2]與[2,1]，mean模型完全相同是架構限制，不是訓練不夠久。</p>\n<p>最後嘗試用三類而非兩類標籤，修改head與資料，核對target範圍。不必為了擴類改Embedding的vocabulary，因為詞表大小與輸出類別數是兩個不同概念。執行本章範例，觀察loss與PAD梯度，而非只看模型印出幾個數。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/14_sequences.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Mask-aware mean pooling with a learned nn.Embedding and classification head.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">SequenceClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">collate_sequences</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">tokens</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">collate_sequences</span><span class=\"p\">([([</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">SequenceClassifier</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AdamW</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.05</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">initial</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tokens</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tokens</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loss</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tokens_shape&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tokens</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;initial_loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">initial</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;final_loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tokens</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">mask</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;pad_gradient&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">embedding</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tolist</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;scope&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;Tiny invented token labels, not language understanding&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#sparse-layers\">Embedding 層</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensors.html\">Pooling 與張量操作</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/nlp/word_embeddings_tutorial.html\">表示學習課程</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 序列實作：Embedding、mask pooling 與文字分類\n\n用小詞表練習token ID、PAD梯度與序列到類別的轉換。\n\n## 從 token 到句子表示\n\n輸入tokens[N,T]為long索引，Embedding把它轉成[N,T,D]，mask去除PAD後對有效位置平均，再由Linear(D,C)分類。這條路徑可完整訓練，與呼叫外部Embedding API不同。模型從這份極小合成資料開始學參數，不包含預訓練語言理解。\n\n## 最小架構的能力限制\n\nmean pooling忽略順序，[1,2]與[2,1]得到相同句向量。若任務需要語序，需加入RNN、位置資訊或Attention等架構。本課先把資料與梯度工程講清楚，更完整的Transformer理論由獨立課程承接。不要把詞袋式示範說成已具備大語言模型能力。\n\n## Padding 的兩個測試\n\n增加尾部PAD不應改變句子表示；padding_idx=0那一列的梯度應為零。本課測試對兩項都驗證。label float或token ID超出vocabulary時，應先修資料契約，不用clamp把所有未知詞默默改成最後一個token。正式tokenizer應定義UNK與PAD規則。\n\n## 訓練與推論的相同契約\n\n保存詞表／tokenizer版本、截斷長度、大小寫與正規化方式。推論沿用同一套ID，即使兩份詞表大小相同，只要ID對應不同，Embedding列的意義就全錯。這與向量模型的「同維度不代表同空間」有相似的工程風險。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n讓`[1,2,0,0]`和`[1,2]`分別推論，比較logits，應在容許誤差內相同。把mean改成普通`.mean(dim=1)`後，結果開始依PAD長度改變，證明錯誤來自分母。再比較[1,2]與[2,1]，mean模型完全相同是架構限制，不是訓練不夠久。\n\n最後嘗試用三類而非兩類標籤，修改head與資料，核對target範圍。不必為了擴類改Embedding的vocabulary，因為詞表大小與輸出類別數是兩個不同概念。執行本章範例，觀察loss與PAD梯度，而非只看模型印出幾個數。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/14_sequences.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Mask-aware mean pooling with a learned nn.Embedding and classification head.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import SequenceClassifier, collate_sequences, setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    tokens, mask, y = collate_sequences([([1, 2], 0), ([2, 1, 3], 0), ([4, 5], 1), ([5, 4, 6], 1)])\n    model = SequenceClassifier()\n    optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=.05)\n    initial = F.cross_entropy(model(tokens, mask), y).item()\n    for _ in range(30):\n        optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n        loss = F.cross_entropy(model(tokens, mask), y)\n        loss.backward()\n        optimizer.step()\n    result = {\"tokens_shape\": list(tokens.shape), \"initial_loss\": initial,\n              \"final_loss\": F.cross_entropy(model(tokens, mask), y).item(),\n              \"pad_gradient\": model.embedding.weight.grad[0].tolist(),\n              \"scope\": \"Tiny invented token labels, not language understanding\"}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Embedding 層](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/nn.html#sparse-layers)\n- [Pooling 與張量操作](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensors.html)\n- [表示學習課程](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/nlp/word_embeddings_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "embeddingmask-pooling", "name": "序列實作：Embedding、mask pooling 與文字分類", "html": "序列實作：Embedding、mask pooling 與文字分類", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "token", "name": "從 token 到句子表示", "html": "從 token 到句子表示", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "最小架構的能力限制", "html": "最小架構的能力限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "padding", "name": "Padding 的兩個測試", "html": "Padding 的兩個測試", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "訓練與推論的相同契約", "html": "訓練與推論的相同契約", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "28-transfer", "group": "practice", "title": "凍結與遷移學習：參數不更新，模組仍有模式", "summary": "分清requires_grad、optimizer覆蓋範圍與BatchNorm／Dropout的狀態。", "tags": ["freeze", "transfer learning", "requires_grad", "optimizer"], "example": "15_freezing.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">凍結與遷移學習：參數不更新，模組仍有模式</h1>\n<p>分清requires_grad、optimizer覆蓋範圍與BatchNorm／Dropout的狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">什麼叫凍結</h2>\n<p>把backbone參數requires_grad設False，代表它們不需計算參數梯度。只把head參數交給optimizer，確保更新範圍明確。這與eval不同：eval調整模組行為，不是鎖定weights；凍結weights也不一定阻止BatchNorm running statistics變化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">本課例子的界線</h2>\n<p>範例使用隨機初始化的Linear backbone，凍結後只訓練分類head，檢查backbone相等且head變化。它展示凍結機制，<strong>沒有下載或使用預訓練權重</strong>，因此不拿它宣稱遷移學習能提升準確率。真正transfer需另選適當預訓練模型、授權、前處理與相容套件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">凍結的執行順序</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"n\">backbone</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ReLU</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n<span class=\"n\">head</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">parameter</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parameter</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">AdamW</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.001</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">no_grad</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">features</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">logits</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logits</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>固定feature extractor時no_grad可減少圖；若你要讓前面的輸入或其他可訓練模組透過backbone反向，則不能直接把整段關掉。先畫出需要哪條梯度路徑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">分階段解凍</h2>\n<p>先訓練head，再解凍後幾層，使用較小backbone lr。重新建optimizer會失去原動量，add_param_group則需管理新增參數與scheduler相容性。每次改動都印可訓練參數數與group，確認沒有漏掉層或重複加入。若backbone需保持eval，外層model.train後要重新設定該子模組。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>凍結參數後running_mean仍變動，原因是BatchNorm仍train mode。解答：明確決定是否凍結統計，再對backbone.eval；這不是所有transfer方案一律必做，而是要符合資料與策略。測試weights不變只驗證參數，還要另外檢查buffer，才能完整描述狀態是否保持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/15_freezing.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Freeze parameters and optimize the head only; no pretrained download.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">backbone</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ReLU</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">head</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">parameter</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">parameter</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">requires_grad_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">False</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Sequential</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span> <span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">before_backbone</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">before_head</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">clone</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;backbone_unchanged&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">all</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">zip</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before_backbone</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">())),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;backbone_grad_none&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">all</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">grad</span> <span class=\"ow\">is</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">p</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">backbone</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;head_changed&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">before_head</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">head</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">weight</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_8\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/transfer_learning_tutorial.html\">Transfer learning</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">Module狀態</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 凍結與遷移學習：參數不更新，模組仍有模式\n\n分清requires_grad、optimizer覆蓋範圍與BatchNorm／Dropout的狀態。\n\n## 什麼叫凍結\n\n把backbone參數requires_grad設False，代表它們不需計算參數梯度。只把head參數交給optimizer，確保更新範圍明確。這與eval不同：eval調整模組行為，不是鎖定weights；凍結weights也不一定阻止BatchNorm running statistics變化。\n\n## 本課例子的界線\n\n範例使用隨機初始化的Linear backbone，凍結後只訓練分類head，檢查backbone相等且head變化。它展示凍結機制，**沒有下載或使用預訓練權重**，因此不拿它宣稱遷移學習能提升準確率。真正transfer需另選適當預訓練模型、授權、前處理與相容套件。\n\n## 凍結的執行順序\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nbackbone = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(4,6), nn.ReLU())\nhead = nn.Linear(6,3)\nfor parameter in backbone.parameters():\n    parameter.requires_grad_(False)\noptimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(head.parameters(), lr=.001)\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    features = backbone(torch.randn(2,4))\nlogits = head(features)\nprint(logits.shape)\n```\n\n固定feature extractor時no_grad可減少圖；若你要讓前面的輸入或其他可訓練模組透過backbone反向，則不能直接把整段關掉。先畫出需要哪條梯度路徑。\n\n## 分階段解凍\n\n先訓練head，再解凍後幾層，使用較小backbone lr。重新建optimizer會失去原動量，add_param_group則需管理新增參數與scheduler相容性。每次改動都印可訓練參數數與group，確認沒有漏掉層或重複加入。若backbone需保持eval，外層model.train後要重新設定該子模組。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n凍結參數後running_mean仍變動，原因是BatchNorm仍train mode。解答：明確決定是否凍結統計，再對backbone.eval；這不是所有transfer方案一律必做，而是要符合資料與策略。測試weights不變只驗證參數，還要另外檢查buffer，才能完整描述狀態是否保持。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/15_freezing.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Freeze parameters and optimize the head only; no pretrained download.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    backbone = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(4, 6), nn.ReLU())\n    head = nn.Linear(6, 3)\n    for parameter in backbone.parameters():\n        parameter.requires_grad_(False)\n    model = nn.Sequential(backbone, head)\n    optimizer = torch.optim.SGD(head.parameters(), lr=.1)\n    before_backbone = [p.detach().clone() for p in backbone.parameters()]\n    before_head = head.weight.detach().clone()\n    optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n    F.cross_entropy(model(torch.randn(8, 4)), torch.arange(8)%3).backward()\n    optimizer.step()\n    result = {\"backbone_unchanged\": all(torch.equal(a,b) for a,b in zip(before_backbone,backbone.parameters())),\n              \"backbone_grad_none\": all(p.grad is None for p in backbone.parameters()),\n              \"head_changed\": not torch.equal(before_head, head.weight)}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Transfer learning](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/transfer_learning_tutorial.html)\n- [Module狀態](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "凍結與遷移學習：參數不更新，模組仍有模式", "html": "凍結與遷移學習：參數不更新，模組仍有模式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "什麼叫凍結", "html": "什麼叫凍結", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "本課例子的界線", "html": "本課例子的界線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "凍結的執行順序", "html": "凍結的執行順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "分階段解凍", "html": "分階段解凍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "29-custom-data", "group": "practice", "title": "自訂檔案資料：解析、驗證與前處理邊界", "summary": "將JSON範例換成真實資料時，讓錯誤在進入模型之前被發現。", "tags": ["custom Dataset", "JSON", "validation", "data contract"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">自訂檔案資料：解析、驗證與前處理邊界</h1>\n<p>將JSON範例換成真實資料時，讓錯誤在進入模型之前被發現。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">檔案不是模型的直接輸入</h2>\n<p>本課JSON每列有features與label，先解析再建立FeatureDataset。正式資料還需欄位名稱、順序、單位、缺失值與來源版本；任何一項改變，都可能使相同shape代表不同意義。把讀檔與前處理規則獨立出來，方便測試與推論重用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">驗證項目</h2>\n<p>特徵數一致、數值有限、標籤可映射、樣本不空、group ID完整。不要遇到壞資料就廣泛except後continue，否則資料筆數與類別分布悄悄改變。可以收集錯誤列與原因，按明確政策停止或排除，並記錄總數；敏感欄位不用印完整內容。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">custom_dataset</span>\n<span class=\"n\">dataset</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">custom_dataset</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dataset</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">i</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dataset</span><span class=\"p\">)):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">label</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">dataset</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,)</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">features</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dtype</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">label</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>將片段放在examples內執行。第5例已透過DataLoader讀相同檔案，測試也會從另一cwd執行，避免相對路徑恰巧成功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">即時變換或預先計算</h2>\n<p>昂貴但固定的解析可預先處理並存版本；隨機augmentation通常留在train讀取流程。大量檔案應避免__init__一次全部解碼進記憶體，改保存索引與按需載入。Dataset若保存無法pickle的開啟連線或lambda，在spawn worker會出問題；先單程序驗證再擴充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>為JSON加入一筆只有3個features的資料，預期在資料驗證就得到明確錯誤，而不是Linear時才看見matmul錯誤。再加入NaN，確認拒絕非有限值。解答：shape、dtype、finite檢查屬於資料邊界；class範圍則需模型classes一起驗證。本課基本Dataset沒有代替所有業務規則，真實專案要加上你的欄位規格。</p>\n<p>若要切換到CSV，只改讀檔不代表完成資料遷移。需要重新固定split、fit train scaler、保存欄位清單，並拿已知樣本比對訓練與推論的轉換結果一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/data_tutorial.html\">自訂Dataset</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">DataLoader</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 自訂檔案資料：解析、驗證與前處理邊界\n\n將JSON範例換成真實資料時，讓錯誤在進入模型之前被發現。\n\n## 檔案不是模型的直接輸入\n\n本課JSON每列有features與label，先解析再建立FeatureDataset。正式資料還需欄位名稱、順序、單位、缺失值與來源版本；任何一項改變，都可能使相同shape代表不同意義。把讀檔與前處理規則獨立出來，方便測試與推論重用。\n\n## 驗證項目\n\n特徵數一致、數值有限、標籤可映射、樣本不空、group ID完整。不要遇到壞資料就廣泛except後continue，否則資料筆數與類別分布悄悄改變。可以收集錯誤列與原因，按明確政策停止或排除，並記錄總數；敏感欄位不用印完整內容。\n\n```python\nfrom course_core import custom_dataset\ndataset = custom_dataset()\nprint(len(dataset))\nfor i in range(len(dataset)):\n    features, label = dataset[i]\n    assert features.shape == (4,)\n    print(i, features.dtype, label.item())\n```\n\n將片段放在examples內執行。第5例已透過DataLoader讀相同檔案，測試也會從另一cwd執行，避免相對路徑恰巧成功。\n\n## 即時變換或預先計算\n\n昂貴但固定的解析可預先處理並存版本；隨機augmentation通常留在train讀取流程。大量檔案應避免__init__一次全部解碼進記憶體，改保存索引與按需載入。Dataset若保存無法pickle的開啟連線或lambda，在spawn worker會出問題；先單程序驗證再擴充。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n為JSON加入一筆只有3個features的資料，預期在資料驗證就得到明確錯誤，而不是Linear時才看見matmul錯誤。再加入NaN，確認拒絕非有限值。解答：shape、dtype、finite檢查屬於資料邊界；class範圍則需模型classes一起驗證。本課基本Dataset沒有代替所有業務規則，真實專案要加上你的欄位規格。\n\n若要切換到CSV，只改讀檔不代表完成資料遷移。需要重新固定split、fit train scaler、保存欄位清單，並拿已知樣本比對訓練與推論的轉換結果一致。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [自訂Dataset](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/data_tutorial.html)\n- [DataLoader](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "自訂檔案資料：解析、驗證與前處理邊界", "html": "自訂檔案資料：解析、驗證與前處理邊界", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "檔案不是模型的直接輸入", "html": "檔案不是模型的直接輸入", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "驗證項目", "html": "驗證項目", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "即時變換或預先計算", "html": "即時變換或預先計算", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "30-debugging", "group": "practice", "title": "訓練除錯實務：一個batch、hooks與梯度診斷", "summary": "用最小可重現問題定位錯誤，讓每個實驗都能排除一種原因。", "tags": ["debug", "overfit batch", "hooks", "gradient norm"], "html": "<h1 id=\"batchhooks\">訓練除錯實務：一個batch、hooks與梯度診斷</h1>\n<p>用最小可重現問題定位錯誤，讓每個實驗都能排除一種原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">從能否擬合一批開始</h2>\n<p>固定一個小batch，關掉複雜augmentation，先讓小模型反覆學它。如果loss完全不動，查參數註冊、grad、lr、loss契約與step；若能很快擬合，資料管線至少有基本學習訊號，再進入完整split。這是診斷，結果不能當泛化成績。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">逐層檢查有限值與尺度</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dropout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">handles</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[]</span>\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">inspect</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">inputs</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">module</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">tuple</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"nb\">bool</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isfinite</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">all</span><span class=\"p\">()))</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">layer</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">network</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">handles</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">append</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">layer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">register_forward_hook</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">inspect</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ones</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">handle</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">handles</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">handle</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">remove</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>hook只做觀察，不把output長期存入list保留圖；完成移除，避免後續訓練印出大量資訊或影響效能。真實模型可能回傳tuple/dict，需按介面處理，不能把這個Tensor-only hook原封不動套到所有架構。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">梯度與更新分別量測</h2>\n<p>backward後看grad是否存在、是否finite與norm；step前後用detach().clone比較參數差值。gradient大不等於update大，AdamW會使用狀態與縮放；相反地某些參數本輪grad為零，動量仍可能讓它改變。需要比較實際變化，而不是只印loss。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">調整的順序</h2>\n<p>先關AMP、compile、DDP回到CPU eager，固定資料與seed。找到最早壞值或最小shape錯誤，再逐一恢復功能。若CPU正確GPU不正確，檢查裝置、精度、非同步錯誤位置與不支援運算。不要同時修改多項來讓程式「看起來好了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>模型train loss下降、val明顯升高：查過擬合、資料分布與前處理，不能直接判斷是optimizer壞了。兩者都完全不動：查學習訊號與更新。只有batch_size=1失敗：查無參數squeeze、BatchNorm及shape假設。解答要附最小輸入與expected/actual shape，才有可追蹤的證據。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html\">Module hooks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/autograd.html\">Anomaly detection</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 訓練除錯實務：一個batch、hooks與梯度診斷\n\n用最小可重現問題定位錯誤，讓每個實驗都能排除一種原因。\n\n## 從能否擬合一批開始\n\n固定一個小batch，關掉複雜augmentation，先讓小模型反覆學它。如果loss完全不動，查參數註冊、grad、lr、loss契約與step；若能很快擬合，資料管線至少有基本學習訊號，再進入完整split。這是診斷，結果不能當泛化成績。\n\n## 逐層檢查有限值與尺度\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom course_core import TinyMLP\nmodel = TinyMLP(dropout=0)\nhandles = []\ndef inspect(module, inputs, output):\n    print(type(module).__name__, tuple(output.shape), bool(torch.isfinite(output).all()))\nfor layer in model.network:\n    handles.append(layer.register_forward_hook(inspect))\nmodel(torch.ones(2,4))\nfor handle in handles:\n    handle.remove()\n```\n\nhook只做觀察，不把output長期存入list保留圖；完成移除，避免後續訓練印出大量資訊或影響效能。真實模型可能回傳tuple/dict，需按介面處理，不能把這個Tensor-only hook原封不動套到所有架構。\n\n## 梯度與更新分別量測\n\nbackward後看grad是否存在、是否finite與norm；step前後用detach().clone比較參數差值。gradient大不等於update大，AdamW會使用狀態與縮放；相反地某些參數本輪grad為零，動量仍可能讓它改變。需要比較實際變化，而不是只印loss。\n\n## 調整的順序\n\n先關AMP、compile、DDP回到CPU eager，固定資料與seed。找到最早壞值或最小shape錯誤，再逐一恢復功能。若CPU正確GPU不正確，檢查裝置、精度、非同步錯誤位置與不支援運算。不要同時修改多項來讓程式「看起來好了」。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n模型train loss下降、val明顯升高：查過擬合、資料分布與前處理，不能直接判斷是optimizer壞了。兩者都完全不動：查學習訊號與更新。只有batch_size=1失敗：查無參數squeeze、BatchNorm及shape假設。解答要附最小輸入與expected/actual shape，才有可追蹤的證據。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Module hooks](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/modules.html)\n- [Anomaly detection](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/autograd.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "batchhooks", "name": "訓練除錯實務：一個batch、hooks與梯度診斷", "html": "訓練除錯實務：一個batch、hooks與梯度診斷", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "從能否擬合一批開始", "html": "從能否擬合一批開始", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "逐層檢查有限值與尺度", "html": "逐層檢查有限值與尺度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "梯度與更新分別量測", "html": "梯度與更新分別量測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "調整的順序", "html": "調整的順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "31-checkpoints", "group": "engineering", "title": "儲存與載入：state_dict、map_location 與信任來源", "summary": "把模型、前處理與設定一起交付，區分推論權重與續訓狀態。", "tags": ["torch.save", "torch.load", "weights_only", "map_location"], "example": "16_checkpoints.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"state_dictmap_location\">儲存與載入：state_dict、map_location 與信任來源</h1>\n<p>把模型、前處理與設定一起交付，區分推論權重與續訓狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">保存什麼才足夠</h2>\n<p>state_dict保存參數與persistent buffers，並不保存你任意寫的Python前處理或欄位意義。推論包至少要有模型設定、weights、train scaler、label mapping與版本。續訓另需optimizer、scheduler、scaler、RNG與進度。本課payload同時保存current model與best_model，兩者用途分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">載入與重建模型</h2>\n<p>先用相同結構建立Module，再load_state_dict。map_location='cpu'讓GPU存檔能先在CPU讀取，之後按需求移device。strict預設檢查key；若故意只載backbone，需讀missing/unexpected keys，不能一律strict=False把結構錯誤藏起來。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># 教學片段：路徑需為你自己產生且信任的檔案。</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># state = torch.load(&#39;weights.pt&#39;, map_location=&#39;cpu&#39;, weights_only=True)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># model.load_state_dict(state)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>本章完整例子使用temporary directory真正寫入、載入與比對，不會覆蓋你的檔案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"weights_only\">weights_only 的用途與限制</h2>\n<p>本課明確指定weights_only=True，payload僅含Tensor、字串、數字與一般容器。這限制unpickling可做的事情，但仍只載入可信來源，不視為任意檔案的安全沙盒。不要為了解決不相容就直接改False；先理解檔案格式、必要類別與來源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">保存瞬間要獨立</h2>\n<p>CPU Tensor若只detach可能仍共享儲存；best快照逐值clone。新run使用新路徑，本課save_checkpoint若檔案已存在會拒絕，避免不小心改掉上一次。正式長時間訓練可設計暫存檔與原子替換，還需考慮同檔案系統與失敗恢復，不要把教材小例當完整儲存服務。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>重新啟動Python載入檔案，對相同raw feature做預測，應與保存前一致。若只保存normalized輸入卻未保存mean/scale，真實新資料就無法按訓練方式轉換。解答：weights之外的資料契約也是模型產物，應一起版本化。不要以「檔案能打開」代替輸出一致性測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/16_checkpoints.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;A real weights_only checkpoint roundtrip inside a temporary directory.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">tempfile</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">load_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">save_checkpoint</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">epochs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">tempfile</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TemporaryDirectory</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">directory</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">path</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">directory</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checkpoint.pt&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">save_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checkpoint&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">restored</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">load_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">equal</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">all</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;model&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">key</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">key</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">value</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checkpoint&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;model&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;model_state_equal&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;saved_epoch&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;epoch&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n                  <span class=\"s2\">&quot;prediction&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">]])}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html\">Serialization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/saveloadrun_tutorial.html\">存取模型</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 儲存與載入：state_dict、map_location 與信任來源\n\n把模型、前處理與設定一起交付，區分推論權重與續訓狀態。\n\n## 保存什麼才足夠\n\nstate_dict保存參數與persistent buffers，並不保存你任意寫的Python前處理或欄位意義。推論包至少要有模型設定、weights、train scaler、label mapping與版本。續訓另需optimizer、scheduler、scaler、RNG與進度。本課payload同時保存current model與best_model，兩者用途分開。\n\n## 載入與重建模型\n\n先用相同結構建立Module，再load_state_dict。map_location='cpu'讓GPU存檔能先在CPU讀取，之後按需求移device。strict預設檢查key；若故意只載backbone，需讀missing/unexpected keys，不能一律strict=False把結構錯誤藏起來。\n\n```python\nimport torch\nfrom course_core import TinyMLP\nmodel = TinyMLP()\n# 教學片段：路徑需為你自己產生且信任的檔案。\n# state = torch.load('weights.pt', map_location='cpu', weights_only=True)\n# model.load_state_dict(state)\nmodel.eval()\n```\n\n本章完整例子使用temporary directory真正寫入、載入與比對，不會覆蓋你的檔案。\n\n## weights_only 的用途與限制\n\n本課明確指定weights_only=True，payload僅含Tensor、字串、數字與一般容器。這限制unpickling可做的事情，但仍只載入可信來源，不視為任意檔案的安全沙盒。不要為了解決不相容就直接改False；先理解檔案格式、必要類別與來源。\n\n## 保存瞬間要獨立\n\nCPU Tensor若只detach可能仍共享儲存；best快照逐值clone。新run使用新路徑，本課save_checkpoint若檔案已存在會拒絕，避免不小心改掉上一次。正式長時間訓練可設計暫存檔與原子替換，還需考慮同檔案系統與失敗恢復，不要把教材小例當完整儲存服務。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n重新啟動Python載入檔案，對相同raw feature做預測，應與保存前一致。若只保存normalized輸入卻未保存mean/scale，真實新資料就無法按訓練方式轉換。解答：weights之外的資料契約也是模型產物，應一起版本化。不要以「檔案能打開」代替輸出一致性測試。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/16_checkpoints.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"A real weights_only checkpoint roundtrip inside a temporary directory.\"\"\"\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport tempfile\nimport torch\nfrom course_core import Config, experiment, load_checkpoint, predict, save_checkpoint\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    run = experiment(Config(epochs=2))\n    with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as directory:\n        path = Path(directory)/\"checkpoint.pt\"\n        save_checkpoint(path, run[\"checkpoint\"])\n        restored = load_checkpoint(path)\n        equal = all(torch.equal(value, restored[\"model\"][key]) for key,value in run[\"checkpoint\"][\"model\"].items())\n        result = {\"model_state_equal\": equal, \"saved_epoch\": restored[\"epoch\"],\n                  \"prediction\": predict(restored, [[0., 0., 0., 0.]])}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Serialization](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html)\n- [存取模型](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/saveloadrun_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "state_dictmap_location", "name": "儲存與載入：state_dict、map_location 與信任來源", "html": "儲存與載入：state_dict、map_location 與信任來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "保存什麼才足夠", "html": "保存什麼才足夠", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "載入與重建模型", "html": "載入與重建模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "weights_only", "name": "weights_only 的用途與限制", "html": "weights_only 的用途與限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "保存瞬間要獨立", "html": "保存瞬間要獨立", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "32-resume", "group": "engineering", "title": "續訓與完全重現：從第2輪接回第4輪", "summary": "實際比較連續訓練與存檔再恢復，明確界定可重現的範圍。", "tags": ["resume", "checkpoint", "RNG", "optimizer state"], "example": "17_resume.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"24\">續訓與完全重現：從第2輪接回第4輪</h1>\n<p>實際比較連續訓練與存檔再恢復，明確界定可重現的範圍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">續訓不只是再載權重</h2>\n<p>AdamW有動量與step狀態，Dropout會用globalTorch RNG，shuffle loader用獨立Generator。若只存weights，下一輪資料順序與遮蔽都可能不同。範例先連續訓練4epoch，再訓練2epoch、實際寫檔載入、恢復到第4epoch，最後比較每個參數與history。</p>\n<h2 id=\"payload\">payload裡的狀態</h2>\n<p>model是目前權重；optimizer保存更新歷史；torch_rng保存CPU隨機狀態；loader_rng保存shuffle generator；epoch是已完成輪數；best_model/best_loss保存選模狀態；config與前處理定義介面。本課沒有scheduler與AMP續訓，若加上它們就必須也存state_dict。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">恢復順序</h2>\n<p>重建model/optimizer/loader並載入model與optimizer，接著恢復RNG，再建立下一輪iterator。重建模型本身會消耗隨機數，所以不要太早恢復RNG。先確認設定與版本一致，避免把不相容模型當同一實驗接續。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">本課精確相等的範圍</h2>\n<p>只驗證同一CPU環境、相同版本與設定、num_workers=0、epoch邊界。本課資料產生有獨立Generator，沒有Python/NumPy隨機augmentation。它不宣稱中途任意batch、多worker預取、跨GPU或跨版本完全相同。若加入其他RNG、CUDA RNG、sampler位置或stateful transforms，要一起設計保存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">實驗結果如何判讀</h2>\n<p>範例回報maximum_parameter_difference，受控CPU設定下應為0，測試也精確比較history。這比只看accuracy一樣更嚴格；兩個不同模型也可能在小test上有相同accuracy。恢復後的initial_validation是重建時基準，不拿它當新的訓練起點成績，主要追蹤保存history與current state。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>暫時不恢復loader_rng，觀察結果是否改變；再恢復它但漏torch_rng，Dropout仍可能不同。解答：兩個隨機來源獨立，缺一項都不能保證同一路徑。若改dropout或epochs設定，本課直接拒絕config不一致；想做新的微調實驗，應另開run並清楚記錄，與原實驗續訓分開。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/17_resume.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Compare continuous CPU training with an epoch-boundary save/load resume.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">tempfile</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">load_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">save_checkpoint</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">epochs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">continuous</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">partial</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">stop_after</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">tempfile</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TemporaryDirectory</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">directory</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">path</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">directory</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;resume.pt&quot;</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">save_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">partial</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checkpoint&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resumed</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">resume</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">load_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">error</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">resumed</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checkpoint&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;model&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"n\">key</span><span class=\"p\">])</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n                <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">key</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">value</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">continuous</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checkpoint&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">][</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;model&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;maximum_parameter_difference&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;epochs&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">resumed</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;history&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">]),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;scope&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;CPU, same config, full epoch boundary, workers=0&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html\">隨機性與重現限制</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html\">狀態序列化</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 續訓與完全重現：從第2輪接回第4輪\n\n實際比較連續訓練與存檔再恢復，明確界定可重現的範圍。\n\n## 續訓不只是再載權重\n\nAdamW有動量與step狀態，Dropout會用globalTorch RNG，shuffle loader用獨立Generator。若只存weights，下一輪資料順序與遮蔽都可能不同。範例先連續訓練4epoch，再訓練2epoch、實際寫檔載入、恢復到第4epoch，最後比較每個參數與history。\n\n## payload裡的狀態\n\nmodel是目前權重；optimizer保存更新歷史；torch_rng保存CPU隨機狀態；loader_rng保存shuffle generator；epoch是已完成輪數；best_model/best_loss保存選模狀態；config與前處理定義介面。本課沒有scheduler與AMP續訓，若加上它們就必須也存state_dict。\n\n## 恢復順序\n\n重建model/optimizer/loader並載入model與optimizer，接著恢復RNG，再建立下一輪iterator。重建模型本身會消耗隨機數，所以不要太早恢復RNG。先確認設定與版本一致，避免把不相容模型當同一實驗接續。\n\n## 本課精確相等的範圍\n\n只驗證同一CPU環境、相同版本與設定、num_workers=0、epoch邊界。本課資料產生有獨立Generator，沒有Python/NumPy隨機augmentation。它不宣稱中途任意batch、多worker預取、跨GPU或跨版本完全相同。若加入其他RNG、CUDA RNG、sampler位置或stateful transforms，要一起設計保存。\n\n## 實驗結果如何判讀\n\n範例回報maximum_parameter_difference，受控CPU設定下應為0，測試也精確比較history。這比只看accuracy一樣更嚴格；兩個不同模型也可能在小test上有相同accuracy。恢復後的initial_validation是重建時基準，不拿它當新的訓練起點成績，主要追蹤保存history與current state。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n暫時不恢復loader_rng，觀察結果是否改變；再恢復它但漏torch_rng，Dropout仍可能不同。解答：兩個隨機來源獨立，缺一項都不能保證同一路徑。若改dropout或epochs設定，本課直接拒絕config不一致；想做新的微調實驗，應另開run並清楚記錄，與原實驗續訓分開。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/17_resume.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Compare continuous CPU training with an epoch-boundary save/load resume.\"\"\"\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport tempfile\nimport torch\nfrom course_core import Config, experiment, load_checkpoint, save_checkpoint\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    config = Config(epochs=4)\n    continuous = experiment(config)\n    partial = experiment(config, stop_after=2)\n    with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as directory:\n        path = Path(directory)/\"resume.pt\"\n        save_checkpoint(path, partial[\"checkpoint\"])\n        resumed = experiment(config, resume=load_checkpoint(path))\n    error = max((value-resumed[\"checkpoint\"][\"model\"][key]).abs().max().item()\n                for key,value in continuous[\"checkpoint\"][\"model\"].items())\n    result = {\"maximum_parameter_difference\": error, \"epochs\": len(resumed[\"history\"]),\n              \"scope\": \"CPU, same config, full epoch boundary, workers=0\"}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [隨機性與重現限制](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html)\n- [狀態序列化](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "24", "name": "續訓與完全重現：從第2輪接回第4輪", "html": "續訓與完全重現：從第2輪接回第4輪", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "續訓不只是再載權重", "html": "續訓不只是再載權重", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "payload", "name": "payload裡的狀態", "html": "payload裡的狀態", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "恢復順序", "html": "恢復順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "本課精確相等的範圍", "html": "本課精確相等的範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "實驗結果如何判讀", "html": "實驗結果如何判讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "33-configuration", "group": "engineering", "title": "Config、CLI 與產物：讓實驗可以交給未來的自己", "summary": "將可變設定集中管理，明確拒絕錯誤輸入與覆蓋既有檔案。", "tags": ["config", "argparse", "CLI", "artifacts"], "html": "<h1 id=\"configcli\">Config、CLI 與產物：讓實驗可以交給未來的自己</h1>\n<p>將可變設定集中管理，明確拒絕錯誤輸入與覆蓋既有檔案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">可調參數需要有定義</h2>\n<p>epochs是完整訓練預算，batch_size是每批樣本上限，lr是optimizer使用的步長；seed描述特定隨機起點。不要讓相同變數名在不同函式代表不同單位。Config使用dataclass，validate對正整數尺寸、有限正lr、dropout範圍與類別數做檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cli\">CLI與可重現命令</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">24_capstone</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-epochs</span> <span class=\"n\">10</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-device</span> <span class=\"n\">cpu</span>\n<span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">24_capstone</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-epochs</span> <span class=\"n\">10</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-device</span> <span class=\"n\">cpu</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-output</span> <span class=\"n\">runs</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">001</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pt</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>第二個指令會建立新產物，請選新的檔名；本課遇到既有檔案直接拒絕。未指定output使用暫存資料夾並在示範結束移除，所以不能在程式結束後期待找到永久模型。命令與完整config一起記錄，才知道某次結果用了什麼預設值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">設定與資料版本一起保存</h2>\n<p>特徵順序、split、label mapping、scaler與原始資料版本可能比hidden=12更重要。dataset更新後仍用同seed，不代表同樣split或同樣資料。可以用資料清單hash與前處理版本識別，但不要把敏感內容直接寫進公開log。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">推論介面先明確</h2>\n<p>本課predict接受raw_features[N,4]，驗證有限值與欄數，再套保存的mean/scale，建立模型載best_state，以eval+inference_mode回傳類別索引。正式服務還應驗證欄位名稱、schema version、label名稱與空輸入政策。API服務的流量、認證與部署屬另一層工程，不等同有.pt就完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將learning_rate改NaN或batch_size改0，應在訓練前拒絕。把4欄輸入改2欄，predict應在Linear之前給出明確錯誤。解答：邊界檢查讓錯誤靠近來源，避免在長訓練之後才發現設定無效。再將CLI輸出的版本、epochs與save位置存一份run記錄，練習重建同一實驗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/argparse.html\">Python argparse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html\">PyTorch狀態管理</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Config、CLI 與產物：讓實驗可以交給未來的自己\n\n將可變設定集中管理，明確拒絕錯誤輸入與覆蓋既有檔案。\n\n## 可調參數需要有定義\n\nepochs是完整訓練預算，batch_size是每批樣本上限，lr是optimizer使用的步長；seed描述特定隨機起點。不要讓相同變數名在不同函式代表不同單位。Config使用dataclass，validate對正整數尺寸、有限正lr、dropout範圍與類別數做檢查。\n\n## CLI與可重現命令\n\n```powershell\npython pytorch/examples/24_capstone.py --epochs 10 --device cpu\npython pytorch/examples/24_capstone.py --epochs 10 --device cpu --output runs/pytorch-001/checkpoint.pt\n```\n\n第二個指令會建立新產物，請選新的檔名；本課遇到既有檔案直接拒絕。未指定output使用暫存資料夾並在示範結束移除，所以不能在程式結束後期待找到永久模型。命令與完整config一起記錄，才知道某次結果用了什麼預設值。\n\n## 設定與資料版本一起保存\n\n特徵順序、split、label mapping、scaler與原始資料版本可能比hidden=12更重要。dataset更新後仍用同seed，不代表同樣split或同樣資料。可以用資料清單hash與前處理版本識別，但不要把敏感內容直接寫進公開log。\n\n## 推論介面先明確\n\n本課predict接受raw_features[N,4]，驗證有限值與欄數，再套保存的mean/scale，建立模型載best_state，以eval+inference_mode回傳類別索引。正式服務還應驗證欄位名稱、schema version、label名稱與空輸入政策。API服務的流量、認證與部署屬另一層工程，不等同有.pt就完成。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將learning_rate改NaN或batch_size改0，應在訓練前拒絕。把4欄輸入改2欄，predict應在Linear之前給出明確錯誤。解答：邊界檢查讓錯誤靠近來源，避免在長訓練之後才發現設定無效。再將CLI輸出的版本、epochs與save位置存一份run記錄，練習重建同一實驗。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Python argparse](https://docs.python.org/3/library/argparse.html)\n- [PyTorch狀態管理](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "configcli", "name": "Config、CLI 與產物：讓實驗可以交給未來的自己", "html": "Config、CLI 與產物：讓實驗可以交給未來的自己", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "可調參數需要有定義", "html": "可調參數需要有定義", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "cli", "name": "CLI與可重現命令", "html": "CLI與可重現命令", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "設定與資料版本一起保存", "html": "設定與資料版本一起保存", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "推論介面先明確", "html": "推論介面先明確", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "34-reproducibility", "group": "engineering", "title": "隨機種子與可重現性：seed能保證什麼", "summary": "辨認不同隨機來源、運算非決定性與跨版本差異。", "tags": ["seed", "Generator", "deterministic", "reproducibility"], "example": "18_seeds.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"seed\">隨機種子與可重現性：seed能保證什麼</h1>\n<p>辨認不同隨機來源、運算非決定性與跨版本差異。</p>\n<h2 id=\"seed_1\">seed控制的是序列起點</h2>\n<p>同一RNG、相同狀態與相同呼叫次序，才會得到同一序列。先抽一組亂數再初始化模型，與先初始化模型再抽亂數，可能得到不同weights，即使最初manual_seed相同。獨立Generator可隔離資料切分、shuffle與其他隨機操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">範例中的獨立來源</h2>\n<p>第18例使用獨立Generator做randperm，再插入global torch.rand，確認不影響該Generator的序列。這不是說所有隨機性都被隔離；Dropout仍使用其裝置的RNG。Python random、NumPy、外部augmentation套件及worker都可能另有狀態。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">決定性演算法</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">random</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">random</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">use_deterministic_algorithms</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>這個選項會選擇決定性路徑或在無可用路徑時報錯，可能有速度代價。某些CUDA運算還需依官方說明設定額外環境。cuDNN benchmark控制演算法搜尋，與deterministic不是同一件事。不要只貼上幾行設定就保證跨所有硬體bitwise一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">重現與穩健性要分開</h2>\n<p>固定一個seed可協助除錯，但模型是否穩健要看多個seed、split與合理擾動。比較方案時使用配對seed與相同資料，回報平均與變異；只挑最好的seed會使成績偏樂觀。精確續訓與統計上可重現也有不同要求，第32章只測前者的受控CPU案例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>先設seed，再多呼叫一次torch.randn，模型初始化可能改變；為資料shuffle傳獨立Generator後，global呼叫不再影響它。解答：存seed只是記錄起點，resume要保存目前RNG state；從epoch2接續時重設最初seed會回到錯誤位置。正式產物還要記版本、OS、device與決定性設定，才能解釋相同seed卻不同的結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/18_seeds.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Separate torch.Generator streams help avoid accidental RNG coupling.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">first</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randperm</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Generator</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rand</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># Unrelated global RNG activity does not alter the new local generator.</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">second</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randperm</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Generator</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">third</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randperm</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">generator</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Generator</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">manual_seed</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;same_seed_same_order&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">second</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;different_seed_changes_order&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">equal</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">third</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;order&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tolist</span><span class=\"p\">()}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html\">Reproducibility</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 隨機種子與可重現性：seed能保證什麼\n\n辨認不同隨機來源、運算非決定性與跨版本差異。\n\n## seed控制的是序列起點\n\n同一RNG、相同狀態與相同呼叫次序，才會得到同一序列。先抽一組亂數再初始化模型，與先初始化模型再抽亂數，可能得到不同weights，即使最初manual_seed相同。獨立Generator可隔離資料切分、shuffle與其他隨機操作。\n\n## 範例中的獨立來源\n\n第18例使用獨立Generator做randperm，再插入global torch.rand，確認不影響該Generator的序列。這不是說所有隨機性都被隔離；Dropout仍使用其裝置的RNG。Python random、NumPy、外部augmentation套件及worker都可能另有狀態。\n\n## 決定性演算法\n\n```python\nimport random, torch\nrandom.seed(7)\ntorch.manual_seed(7)\ntorch.use_deterministic_algorithms(True)\n```\n\n這個選項會選擇決定性路徑或在無可用路徑時報錯，可能有速度代價。某些CUDA運算還需依官方說明設定額外環境。cuDNN benchmark控制演算法搜尋，與deterministic不是同一件事。不要只貼上幾行設定就保證跨所有硬體bitwise一致。\n\n## 重現與穩健性要分開\n\n固定一個seed可協助除錯，但模型是否穩健要看多個seed、split與合理擾動。比較方案時使用配對seed與相同資料，回報平均與變異；只挑最好的seed會使成績偏樂觀。精確續訓與統計上可重現也有不同要求，第32章只測前者的受控CPU案例。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n先設seed，再多呼叫一次torch.randn，模型初始化可能改變；為資料shuffle傳獨立Generator後，global呼叫不再影響它。解答：存seed只是記錄起點，resume要保存目前RNG state；從epoch2接續時重設最初seed會回到錯誤位置。正式產物還要記版本、OS、device與決定性設定，才能解釋相同seed卻不同的結果。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/18_seeds.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Separate torch.Generator streams help avoid accidental RNG coupling.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    first = torch.randperm(8, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(7))\n    torch.rand(100)  # Unrelated global RNG activity does not alter the new local generator.\n    second = torch.randperm(8, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(7))\n    third = torch.randperm(8, generator=torch.Generator().manual_seed(8))\n    result = {\"same_seed_same_order\": torch.equal(first,second),\n              \"different_seed_changes_order\": not torch.equal(first,third), \"order\": first.tolist()}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Reproducibility](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/randomness.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "seed", "name": "隨機種子與可重現性：seed能保證什麼", "html": "隨機種子與可重現性：seed能保證什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "seed_1", "name": "seed控制的是序列起點", "html": "seed控制的是序列起點", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "範例中的獨立來源", "html": "範例中的獨立來源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "決定性演算法", "html": "決定性演算法", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "重現與穩健性要分開", "html": "重現與穩健性要分開", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "35-input-performance", "group": "engineering", "title": "輸入管線與記憶體：先量測，再增加workers", "summary": "區分讀檔、轉換、搬移與模型計算的瓶頸。", "tags": ["performance", "DataLoader", "pin_memory", "prefetch"], "html": "<h1 id=\"workers\">輸入管線與記憶體：先量測，再增加workers</h1>\n<p>區分讀檔、轉換、搬移與模型計算的瓶頸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">慢在等資料還是算模型</h2>\n<p>把時間分成取得batch、CPU前處理、host-to-device搬移、forward/backward與optimizer。GPU利用率低可能是資料不足，也可能模型本來很小、同步太頻繁。只看工作管理員一個百分比，無法決定該加worker還是加batch。</p>\n<h2 id=\"workers_1\">workers會用額外資源</h2>\n<p>worker啟動、pickle、檔案句柄、預取buffer與每個程序的Dataset狀態都要成本。從0、1、2開始比較穩定吞吐，不直接設CPU核心數。小JSON已在記憶體時，多程序可能更慢；大量影像解碼則可能受益。測量應包含暖機後多批，另記首次啟動延遲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gpu\">GPU搬移的常見組合</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># CUDA 設定片段，需搭配實際GPU與DataLoader。</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># loader = DataLoader(dataset, batch_size=64, num_workers=2,</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#                     pin_memory=True, persistent_workers=True)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># for x, y in loader:</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     x = x.to(&#39;cuda&#39;, non_blocking=True)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     y = y.to(&#39;cuda&#39;, non_blocking=True)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>這不是本課CPU成績的已驗證加速方案。pinning佔用主機記憶體；non_blocking不保證與計算重疊，還取決於stream與依賴。先驗證數值一致，再比較吞吐、延遲與記憶體峰值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">減少重複工作</h2>\n<p>固定解析可以預先快取，但需包含資料／前處理版本，避免舊結果混用；隨機增強通常不能整份無條件快取。避免每batch重新讀同一個大型metadata檔，或每筆都建立大型tokenizer。更改cache後要有失效規則，不讓效能改動偷偷改變資料內容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>設計一張比較表，欄位含workers、batch、first-batch時間、暖機後samples/s、主機記憶體與結果一致性。解答：以相同資料順序與模型比較，每項重複幾次並記錄變異；單次快20%不能排除OS快取差異。若加worker後RAM暴增，先看Dataset是否在每個程序複製大Python物件、prefetch量與persistent狀態，不只調GPU設定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">DataLoader 效能選項</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/cuda.html\">CUDA非同步語意</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 輸入管線與記憶體：先量測，再增加workers\n\n區分讀檔、轉換、搬移與模型計算的瓶頸。\n\n## 慢在等資料還是算模型\n\n把時間分成取得batch、CPU前處理、host-to-device搬移、forward/backward與optimizer。GPU利用率低可能是資料不足，也可能模型本來很小、同步太頻繁。只看工作管理員一個百分比，無法決定該加worker還是加batch。\n\n## workers會用額外資源\n\nworker啟動、pickle、檔案句柄、預取buffer與每個程序的Dataset狀態都要成本。從0、1、2開始比較穩定吞吐，不直接設CPU核心數。小JSON已在記憶體時，多程序可能更慢；大量影像解碼則可能受益。測量應包含暖機後多批，另記首次啟動延遲。\n\n## GPU搬移的常見組合\n\n```python\n# CUDA 設定片段，需搭配實際GPU與DataLoader。\n# loader = DataLoader(dataset, batch_size=64, num_workers=2,\n#                     pin_memory=True, persistent_workers=True)\n# for x, y in loader:\n#     x = x.to('cuda', non_blocking=True)\n#     y = y.to('cuda', non_blocking=True)\n```\n\n這不是本課CPU成績的已驗證加速方案。pinning佔用主機記憶體；non_blocking不保證與計算重疊，還取決於stream與依賴。先驗證數值一致，再比較吞吐、延遲與記憶體峰值。\n\n## 減少重複工作\n\n固定解析可以預先快取，但需包含資料／前處理版本，避免舊結果混用；隨機增強通常不能整份無條件快取。避免每batch重新讀同一個大型metadata檔，或每筆都建立大型tokenizer。更改cache後要有失效規則，不讓效能改動偷偷改變資料內容。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n設計一張比較表，欄位含workers、batch、first-batch時間、暖機後samples/s、主機記憶體與結果一致性。解答：以相同資料順序與模型比較，每項重複幾次並記錄變異；單次快20%不能排除OS快取差異。若加worker後RAM暴增，先看Dataset是否在每個程序複製大Python物件、prefetch量與persistent狀態，不只調GPU設定。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [DataLoader 效能選項](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n- [CUDA非同步語意](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/cuda.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "workers", "name": "輸入管線與記憶體：先量測，再增加workers", "html": "輸入管線與記憶體：先量測，再增加workers", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "慢在等資料還是算模型", "html": "慢在等資料還是算模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "workers_1", "name": "workers會用額外資源", "html": "workers會用額外資源", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "gpu", "name": "GPU搬移的常見組合", "html": "GPU搬移的常見組合", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "減少重複工作", "html": "減少重複工作", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "36-accumulation", "group": "engineering", "title": "梯度累積：有效batch與不等長尾批的正確加權", "summary": "以4、4、2筆microbatch，驗證一次大batch更新的數值等價條件。", "tags": ["gradient accumulation", "microbatch", "weighted loss"], "example": "19_accumulation.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"batch\">梯度累積：有效batch與不等長尾批的正確加權</h1>\n<p>以4、4、2筆microbatch，驗證一次大batch更新的數值等價條件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">為什麼累積梯度</h2>\n<p>記憶體不足放完整batch時，可將同一有效群組分成microbatch，逐個backward，最後只step一次。zero_grad在群組開始，不在每個microbatch。若每個microbatch都step，那是多次小batch更新，與同一點計算大batch梯度不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"k\">尾批不能總是除固定K</h2>\n<p>若一組有4、4、2筆，直接把每個batch mean除以3，兩筆尾批會佔三分之一權重。正確做法是各批loss sum除以本組總樣本10；等長batch時才等同mean除K。最後有效群組也可能少於設定accumulation_steps，仍需依實際分母。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\">$$\nL_{group}=\\frac{1}{\\sum_b n_b}\\sum_b\\sum_{i\\in b}\\ell_i,\\qquad\n\\nabla L_{group}=\\sum_b\\frac{n_b}{\\sum_j n_j}\\nabla\\bar L_b\n$$</div>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">實際等價測試</h2>\n<p>本章複製同一Linear，一個用10筆完整batch更新，另一個用4/4/2三批加權累積，使用相同SGD。比較所有參數最大差值，應只剩浮點運算次序誤差。這個測試能抓出尾批縮放錯誤，比只看loss有下降更精確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">哪些情境不保證相同</h2>\n<p>BatchNorm使用每個microbatch統計；Dropout隨機遮蔽與運算順序可不同，因此不必與真正大batch逐值一致。class weights、有效tokens、分散式各rank樣本數不等時，分母要按任務重新推導。有效batch變大也不代表lr必須按比例增加，需驗證收斂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ampddp\">AMP與DDP的延伸</h2>\n<p>AMP在整個有效群組內保持相同scale，累積完成才unscale、clip、step、update。DDP可用no_sync降低前幾批同步，但最後一次必須正常同步，且各rank控制流一致。先把本章CPU數值等價測試通過，再組合這些功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>資料11筆、microbatch4、每組最多2批，兩組分別是[4,4]和[3]，分母為8與3。解答：不是每批都除8，也不是第二組仍除2。若只想整個epoch一次更新，分母才是11，但會改變更新次數與optimizer狀態，應明確記錄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/19_accumulation.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Unequal microbatches: sum losses / actual group sample count matches full mean.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">copy</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">accumulated_step</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">large</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">accumulated</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">copy</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">deepcopy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">first</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">second</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">accumulated</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">first</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">microbatches</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">start</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">start</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">accumulated_step</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">accumulated</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">second</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">microbatches</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">difference</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">max</span><span class=\"p\">((</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">b</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">zip</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">accumulated</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">()))</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;microbatch_sizes&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">labels</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">microbatches</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;maximum_parameter_difference&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">difference</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;scope&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;Linear model, no Dropout or BatchNorm&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/amp_examples.html#gradient-accumulation\">梯度累積與AMP</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 梯度累積：有效batch與不等長尾批的正確加權\n\n以4、4、2筆microbatch，驗證一次大batch更新的數值等價條件。\n\n## 為什麼累積梯度\n\n記憶體不足放完整batch時，可將同一有效群組分成microbatch，逐個backward，最後只step一次。zero_grad在群組開始，不在每個microbatch。若每個microbatch都step，那是多次小batch更新，與同一點計算大batch梯度不同。\n\n## 尾批不能總是除固定K\n\n若一組有4、4、2筆，直接把每個batch mean除以3，兩筆尾批會佔三分之一權重。正確做法是各批loss sum除以本組總樣本10；等長batch時才等同mean除K。最後有效群組也可能少於設定accumulation_steps，仍需依實際分母。\n\n$$\nL_{group}=\\frac{1}{\\sum_b n_b}\\sum_b\\sum_{i\\in b}\\ell_i,\\qquad\n\\nabla L_{group}=\\sum_b\\frac{n_b}{\\sum_j n_j}\\nabla\\bar L_b\n$$\n\n## 實際等價測試\n\n本章複製同一Linear，一個用10筆完整batch更新，另一個用4/4/2三批加權累積，使用相同SGD。比較所有參數最大差值，應只剩浮點運算次序誤差。這個測試能抓出尾批縮放錯誤，比只看loss有下降更精確。\n\n## 哪些情境不保證相同\n\nBatchNorm使用每個microbatch統計；Dropout隨機遮蔽與運算順序可不同，因此不必與真正大batch逐值一致。class weights、有效tokens、分散式各rank樣本數不等時，分母要按任務重新推導。有效batch變大也不代表lr必須按比例增加，需驗證收斂。\n\n## AMP與DDP的延伸\n\nAMP在整個有效群組內保持相同scale，累積完成才unscale、clip、step、update。DDP可用no_sync降低前幾批同步，但最後一次必須正常同步，且各rank控制流一致。先把本章CPU數值等價測試通過，再組合這些功能。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n資料11筆、microbatch4、每組最多2批，兩組分別是[4,4]和[3]，分母為8與3。解答：不是每批都除8，也不是第二組仍除2。若只想整個epoch一次更新，分母才是11，但會改變更新次數與optimizer狀態，應明確記錄。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/19_accumulation.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Unequal microbatches: sum losses / actual group sample count matches full mean.\"\"\"\nimport copy\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom course_core import accumulated_step, setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    x, y = torch.randn(10, 4), torch.arange(10)%3\n    large = nn.Linear(4, 3)\n    accumulated = copy.deepcopy(large)\n    first = torch.optim.SGD(large.parameters(),lr=.1)\n    second = torch.optim.SGD(accumulated.parameters(),lr=.1)\n    first.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n    F.cross_entropy(large(x),y).backward()\n    first.step()\n    microbatches = [(x[start:start+4],y[start:start+4]) for start in range(0,len(y),4)]\n    accumulated_step(accumulated,second,microbatches)\n    difference = max((a-b).abs().max().item() for a,b in zip(large.parameters(),accumulated.parameters()))\n    result = {\"microbatch_sizes\": [len(labels) for _,labels in microbatches],\n              \"maximum_parameter_difference\": difference, \"scope\": \"Linear model, no Dropout or BatchNorm\"}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [梯度累積與AMP](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/amp_examples.html#gradient-accumulation)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "batch", "name": "梯度累積：有效batch與不等長尾批的正確加權", "html": "梯度累積：有效batch與不等長尾批的正確加權", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "為什麼累積梯度", "html": "為什麼累積梯度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "k", "name": "尾批不能總是除固定K", "html": "尾批不能總是除固定K", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "實際等價測試", "html": "實際等價測試", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "哪些情境不保證相同", "html": "哪些情境不保證相同", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "ampddp", "name": "AMP與DDP的延伸", "html": "AMP與DDP的延伸", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "37-cuda-memory", "group": "performance", "title": "CUDA實務：非同步、OOM、allocated與reserved", "summary": "讀懂GPU記憶體與計時，避免用錯誤量測做效能決策。", "tags": ["CUDA", "OOM", "memory", "async", "benchmark"], "html": "<h1 id=\"cudaoomallocatedreserved\">CUDA實務：非同步、OOM、allocated與reserved</h1>\n<p>讀懂GPU記憶體與計時，避免用錯誤量測做效能決策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">非同步如何影響觀察</h2>\n<p>GPU運算常以非同步方式提交，Python函式回傳不表示裝置已算完。只用perf_counter包一次forward，可能主要量到排程開銷。錯誤也可能在較晚同步點才浮現。除錯時可使用官方建議的同步設定縮小位置，但不應把除錯同步模式當正式效能結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">一個基本量測片段</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># GPU片段：model與x需已在CUDA，且先完成暖機。</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">time</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_available</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">synchronize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">started</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">perf_counter</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># output = model(x)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">synchronize</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">perf_counter</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">started</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>這個空區塊本身不是模型benchmark，請放入你的實際運算並重複多次。分開量首次編譯、暖機與穩態；清楚記錄batch、shape、dtype、train/eval與是否包含搬移。也可用CUDA events量裝置時間，但同樣要理解同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"allocatedreserved\">allocated與reserved</h2>\n<p>allocated描述Tensor等實際使用的記憶體，reserved含allocator保留區域。nvidia-smi還可能包含context與其他程序。empty_cache主要釋放未使用cache，不會把仍被引用的Tensor消掉，也不應每batch呼叫當萬用OOM解法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oom\">OOM的處理順序</h2>\n<p>先看batch／sequence長度與中間Tensor是否意外擴成N×N×D，清除history對圖的引用，驗證流程使用inference mode。再考慮小batch+正確累積、AMP、activation checkpointing。activation checkpointing以重新計算換記憶體，與訓練存檔checkpoint不同；Dropout／RNG與模組副作用需按API語意檢查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">多裝置生態</h2>\n<p>PyTorch也有MPS、XPU、ROCm等路徑，支援運算、profiler與dtype不同。本課CPU實測不代表其他硬體都相同；GPU部署應記build、driver與裝置，按官方平台文件驗證。最新2.15增加多種硬體能力，但本課不為沒有的硬體報效能數字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>每輪GPU記憶體持續上升，先查是否append未detach的loss或activation。若allocated穩定、reserved高，不一定是洩漏；可能是allocator保留。解答：先比較同shape多輪的趨勢與peak，再區分引用、cache與工作負載變動，不能只看一次nvidia-smi就下結論。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/cuda.html\">CUDA與記憶體語意</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/checkpoint.html\">Activation checkpointing</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# CUDA實務：非同步、OOM、allocated與reserved\n\n讀懂GPU記憶體與計時，避免用錯誤量測做效能決策。\n\n## 非同步如何影響觀察\n\nGPU運算常以非同步方式提交，Python函式回傳不表示裝置已算完。只用perf_counter包一次forward，可能主要量到排程開銷。錯誤也可能在較晚同步點才浮現。除錯時可使用官方建議的同步設定縮小位置，但不應把除錯同步模式當正式效能結果。\n\n## 一個基本量測片段\n\n```python\n# GPU片段：model與x需已在CUDA，且先完成暖機。\nimport time, torch\nif torch.cuda.is_available():\n    torch.cuda.synchronize()\n    started = time.perf_counter()\n    # output = model(x)\n    torch.cuda.synchronize()\n    print(time.perf_counter() - started)\n```\n\n這個空區塊本身不是模型benchmark，請放入你的實際運算並重複多次。分開量首次編譯、暖機與穩態；清楚記錄batch、shape、dtype、train/eval與是否包含搬移。也可用CUDA events量裝置時間，但同樣要理解同步。\n\n## allocated與reserved\n\nallocated描述Tensor等實際使用的記憶體，reserved含allocator保留區域。nvidia-smi還可能包含context與其他程序。empty_cache主要釋放未使用cache，不會把仍被引用的Tensor消掉，也不應每batch呼叫當萬用OOM解法。\n\n## OOM的處理順序\n\n先看batch／sequence長度與中間Tensor是否意外擴成N×N×D，清除history對圖的引用，驗證流程使用inference mode。再考慮小batch+正確累積、AMP、activation checkpointing。activation checkpointing以重新計算換記憶體，與訓練存檔checkpoint不同；Dropout／RNG與模組副作用需按API語意檢查。\n\n## 多裝置生態\n\nPyTorch也有MPS、XPU、ROCm等路徑，支援運算、profiler與dtype不同。本課CPU實測不代表其他硬體都相同；GPU部署應記build、driver與裝置，按官方平台文件驗證。最新2.15增加多種硬體能力，但本課不為沒有的硬體報效能數字。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n每輪GPU記憶體持續上升，先查是否append未detach的loss或activation。若allocated穩定、reserved高，不一定是洩漏；可能是allocator保留。解答：先比較同shape多輪的趨勢與peak，再區分引用、cache與工作負載變動，不能只看一次nvidia-smi就下結論。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [CUDA與記憶體語意](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/cuda.html)\n- [Activation checkpointing](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/checkpoint.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "cudaoomallocatedreserved", "name": "CUDA實務：非同步、OOM、allocated與reserved", "html": "CUDA實務：非同步、OOM、allocated與reserved", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "非同步如何影響觀察", "html": "非同步如何影響觀察", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "一個基本量測片段", "html": "一個基本量測片段", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "allocatedreserved", "name": "allocated與reserved", "html": "allocated與reserved", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "oom", "name": "OOM的處理順序", "html": "OOM的處理順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "多裝置生態", "html": "多裝置生態", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "38-amp", "group": "performance", "title": "混合精度AMP：autocast、GradScaler與clipping順序", "summary": "使用目前API，先保留float32基準，再選配CUDA混合精度。", "tags": ["AMP", "autocast", "GradScaler", "float16", "bfloat16"], "example": "20_amp.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"ampautocastgradscalerclipping\">混合精度AMP：autocast、GradScaler與clipping順序</h1>\n<p>使用目前API，先保留float32基準，再選配CUDA混合精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"half\">不把整個模型盲目half</h2>\n<p>autocast依運算選擇合適精度，搭配float32參數與必要的高精度運算。float16可能發生梯度underflow，GradScaler將loss放大後反向，再還原梯度供更新。bfloat16的動態範圍不同，是否需要scaler與裝置支援要依實際配置決定，不把所有低精度混為一談。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api\">目前的API與正確順序</h2>\n<p>本課使用torch.autocast與torch.amp.GradScaler，不以舊的torch.cuda.amp命名空間作主線。scaler在完整訓練中應建立一次並跨step沿用，續訓保存scaler.state_dict。core中的amp_step是一個獨立更新的教學函式，不把每次新建scaler當長期訓練建議。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># CUDA訓練片段：model、x、y、optimizer需先準備好。</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">scaler</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">amp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">GradScaler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;cuda&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\"># for x, y in loader:</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     with torch.autocast(&#39;cuda&#39;, dtype=torch.float16):</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#         loss = criterion(model(x), y)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     scaler.scale(loss).backward()</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     scaler.unscale_(optimizer)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_(model.parameters(), 1.)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     scaler.step(optimizer)</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">#     scaler.update()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>先unscale再clip，才是在真實梯度尺度裁切。累積多批時，同一有效群組完成後才unscale／step／update；不可中途改scale後把不同縮放梯度混在一起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">本章預設與選配</h2>\n<p><code>20_amp.py</code>預設在CPU做AMP停用的float32更新，測試比對普通step；它不是CPU AMP加速成績。明確加<code>--cuda-amp</code>才要求CUDA，不可用時直接錯誤。GPU路徑需在你的硬體檢查finite loss、梯度、數值差異、吞吐與記憶體，不能從CPU fallback推定已通過。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>若clipping在unscale前，閾值相當於被scale改變，可能把梯度裁得過小。解答：先還原，再檢查／裁切。若AMP後NaN，回到FP32定位、檢查不穩定算子與輸入，必要時局部停用autocast；不能靠scaler修正原本就除零或錯誤標籤的問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/20_amp.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Default FP32 CPU path; --cuda-amp explicitly requires an available CUDA GPU.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">argparse</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">amp_step</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">choose_device</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ArgumentParser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"vm\">__doc__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;--cuda-amp&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">action</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;store_true&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">args</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">device</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">choose_device</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;cuda&quot;</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda_amp</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;cpu&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">amp_step</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda_amp</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/amp_examples.html\">AMP examples</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/amp.html\">AMP API</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 混合精度AMP：autocast、GradScaler與clipping順序\n\n使用目前API，先保留float32基準，再選配CUDA混合精度。\n\n## 不把整個模型盲目half\n\nautocast依運算選擇合適精度，搭配float32參數與必要的高精度運算。float16可能發生梯度underflow，GradScaler將loss放大後反向，再還原梯度供更新。bfloat16的動態範圍不同，是否需要scaler與裝置支援要依實際配置決定，不把所有低精度混為一談。\n\n## 目前的API與正確順序\n\n本課使用torch.autocast與torch.amp.GradScaler，不以舊的torch.cuda.amp命名空間作主線。scaler在完整訓練中應建立一次並跨step沿用，續訓保存scaler.state_dict。core中的amp_step是一個獨立更新的教學函式，不把每次新建scaler當長期訓練建議。\n\n```python\n# CUDA訓練片段：model、x、y、optimizer需先準備好。\nimport torch\nscaler = torch.amp.GradScaler('cuda')\n# for x, y in loader:\n#     optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n#     with torch.autocast('cuda', dtype=torch.float16):\n#         loss = criterion(model(x), y)\n#     scaler.scale(loss).backward()\n#     scaler.unscale_(optimizer)\n#     torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_(model.parameters(), 1.)\n#     scaler.step(optimizer)\n#     scaler.update()\n```\n\n先unscale再clip，才是在真實梯度尺度裁切。累積多批時，同一有效群組完成後才unscale／step／update；不可中途改scale後把不同縮放梯度混在一起。\n\n## 本章預設與選配\n\n`20_amp.py`預設在CPU做AMP停用的float32更新，測試比對普通step；它不是CPU AMP加速成績。明確加`--cuda-amp`才要求CUDA，不可用時直接錯誤。GPU路徑需在你的硬體檢查finite loss、梯度、數值差異、吞吐與記憶體，不能從CPU fallback推定已通過。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n若clipping在unscale前，閾值相當於被scale改變，可能把梯度裁得過小。解答：先還原，再檢查／裁切。若AMP後NaN，回到FP32定位、檢查不穩定算子與輸入，必要時局部停用autocast；不能靠scaler修正原本就除零或錯誤標籤的問題。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/20_amp.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Default FP32 CPU path; --cuda-amp explicitly requires an available CUDA GPU.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom course_core import amp_step, choose_device, setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n    parser.add_argument(\"--cuda-amp\", action=\"store_true\")\n    args = parser.parse_args(argv)\n    setup()\n    device = choose_device(\"cuda\" if args.cuda_amp else \"cpu\")\n    model = nn.Linear(4,3).to(device)\n    optimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(),lr=.1)\n    x,y = torch.randn(8,4,device=device),torch.arange(8,device=device)%3\n    result = amp_step(model,optimizer,x,y,args.cuda_amp)\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [AMP examples](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/amp_examples.html)\n- [AMP API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/amp.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "ampautocastgradscalerclipping", "name": "混合精度AMP：autocast、GradScaler與clipping順序", "html": "混合精度AMP：autocast、GradScaler與clipping順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "half", "name": "不把整個模型盲目half", "html": "不把整個模型盲目half", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "api", "name": "目前的API與正確順序", "html": "目前的API與正確順序", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "本章預設與選配", "html": "本章預設與選配", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "39-profiler", "group": "performance", "title": "Profiler：找瓶頸，而不是猜哪一行慢", "summary": "使用CPU事件與shape記錄建立分析方法，再延伸到GPU。", "tags": ["profiler", "record_function", "performance"], "example": "21_profiler.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"profiler\">Profiler：找瓶頸，而不是猜哪一行慢</h1>\n<p>使用CPU事件與shape記錄建立分析方法，再延伸到GPU。</p>\n<h2 id=\"profiler_1\">Profiler回答什麼問題</h2>\n<p>它可以記錄算子時間、呼叫次數、shape與自訂區間，協助判斷時間集中在矩陣運算、資料搬移還是大量小操作。Profiler本身有額外成本，因此結果適合定位熱點，最終吞吐還要用獨立benchmark核對。開啟更多stack／memory選項會增加記錄量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">本章執行的範圍</h2>\n<p>範例真的用torch.profiler.profile記錄CPU forward/backward，將一段區間命名teaching_step，再檢查事件表是否包含它。預設不寫trace檔、不連外，也不需要GPU。測試保證觀察機制可用，不把某台機器單次微秒數當普遍成績。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">怎麼讀事件表</h2>\n<p>區分self time與包含子呼叫的total，重複巢狀時間不能直接全部相加。先看耗時與呼叫次數，再看input shape與記憶體。大量小op可能受Python或launch限制，大矩陣可能是算力／頻寬；同一算子快慢也依shape、dtype與硬體而變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">較長訓練的取樣</h2>\n<p>使用schedule控制wait／warmup／active，迴圈中prof.step前進，避免把整個數小時訓練所有事件都存下。需要Chrome trace時明確指定新檔案與保存政策，trace可能含模組名稱、路徑與shape。GPU需加入CUDA activity並確認硬體／build支援。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">從發現到修改</h2>\n<p>若每batch有大量item或CPU搬移，先減少同步與重複傳輸；若資料等待久，查DataLoader；若compute是主瓶頸，再比較AMP／compile。每次改動都保留相同輸入與數值檢查。效能提升若同時丟了尾批或縮短序列，就已改工作量，必須揭露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>將一個Linear改成Python迴圈逐筆forward，再比較呼叫次數與整體吞吐。解答：向量化通常減少呼叫，但仍要實測相同樣本數。若Profiler顯示某區間很大，先看它是否包了子區間，不直接把self與total加成「總耗時」。本章輸出event_count不是越小越好，需連回實際運算內容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/21_profiler.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Profile a small CPU forward/backward; no trace files are written by default.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">del</span> <span class=\"n\">argv</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">x</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">profiler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">profile</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">activities</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">profiler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ProfilerActivity</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CPU</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">record_shapes</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">profile</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">profiler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">record_function</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;teaching_step&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">square</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">events</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">profile</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">key_averages</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;event_count&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">len</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">events</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;has_teaching_step&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">any</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">event</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">key</span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;teaching_step&quot;</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">events</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;device&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;cpu&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;scope&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;Instrumentation example, not a speed benchmark&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_7\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/profiler.html\">Profiler API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/recipes/recipes/profiler_recipe.html\">Profiler recipe</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# Profiler：找瓶頸，而不是猜哪一行慢\n\n使用CPU事件與shape記錄建立分析方法，再延伸到GPU。\n\n## Profiler回答什麼問題\n\n它可以記錄算子時間、呼叫次數、shape與自訂區間，協助判斷時間集中在矩陣運算、資料搬移還是大量小操作。Profiler本身有額外成本，因此結果適合定位熱點，最終吞吐還要用獨立benchmark核對。開啟更多stack／memory選項會增加記錄量。\n\n## 本章執行的範圍\n\n範例真的用torch.profiler.profile記錄CPU forward/backward，將一段區間命名teaching_step，再檢查事件表是否包含它。預設不寫trace檔、不連外，也不需要GPU。測試保證觀察機制可用，不把某台機器單次微秒數當普遍成績。\n\n## 怎麼讀事件表\n\n區分self time與包含子呼叫的total，重複巢狀時間不能直接全部相加。先看耗時與呼叫次數，再看input shape與記憶體。大量小op可能受Python或launch限制，大矩陣可能是算力／頻寬；同一算子快慢也依shape、dtype與硬體而變。\n\n## 較長訓練的取樣\n\n使用schedule控制wait／warmup／active，迴圈中prof.step前進，避免把整個數小時訓練所有事件都存下。需要Chrome trace時明確指定新檔案與保存政策，trace可能含模組名稱、路徑與shape。GPU需加入CUDA activity並確認硬體／build支援。\n\n## 從發現到修改\n\n若每batch有大量item或CPU搬移，先減少同步與重複傳輸；若資料等待久，查DataLoader；若compute是主瓶頸，再比較AMP／compile。每次改動都保留相同輸入與數值檢查。效能提升若同時丟了尾批或縮短序列，就已改工作量，必須揭露。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n將一個Linear改成Python迴圈逐筆forward，再比較呼叫次數與整體吞吐。解答：向量化通常減少呼叫，但仍要實測相同樣本數。若Profiler顯示某區間很大，先看它是否包了子區間，不直接把self與total加成「總耗時」。本章輸出event_count不是越小越好，需連回實際運算內容。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/21_profiler.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Profile a small CPU forward/backward; no trace files are written by default.\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom course_core import setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    del argv\n    setup()\n    model = nn.Linear(4,3)\n    x = torch.randn(8,4)\n    with torch.profiler.profile(activities=[torch.profiler.ProfilerActivity.CPU],record_shapes=True) as profile:\n        with torch.profiler.record_function(\"teaching_step\"):\n            model(x).square().mean().backward()\n    events = profile.key_averages()\n    result = {\"event_count\": len(events), \"has_teaching_step\": any(event.key==\"teaching_step\" for event in events),\n              \"device\": \"cpu\", \"scope\": \"Instrumentation example, not a speed benchmark\"}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Profiler API](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/profiler.html)\n- [Profiler recipe](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/recipes/recipes/profiler_recipe.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "profiler", "name": "Profiler：找瓶頸，而不是猜哪一行慢", "html": "Profiler：找瓶頸，而不是猜哪一行慢", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "profiler_1", "name": "Profiler回答什麼問題", "html": "Profiler回答什麼問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "本章執行的範圍", "html": "本章執行的範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "怎麼讀事件表", "html": "怎麼讀事件表", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "較長訓練的取樣", "html": "較長訓練的取樣", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "從發現到修改", "html": "從發現到修改", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}, {"id": "40-compile", "group": "performance", "title": "torch.compile：圖擷取、graph break與效能驗證", "summary": "理解編譯的條件與成本，區分數值正確、成功擷取及真正加速。", "tags": ["torch.compile", "Dynamo", "Inductor", "graph break"], "example": "22_compile.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"torchcompilegraph-break\">torch.compile：圖擷取、graph break與效能驗證</h1>\n<p>理解編譯的條件與成本，區分數值正確、成功擷取及真正加速。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eagercompile\">eager與compile的關係</h2>\n<p>eager直接逐步執行Tensor操作，適合學習與除錯。torch.compile嘗試擷取並編譯可支援區段，預設常使用Inductor後端。它不是換一個函式就保證更快：首次編譯成本、shape變動、graph break與模型大小都會影響收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">本課實際驗證什麼</h2>\n<p>第22例預設只印選配說明；加<code>--compile --backend eager</code>會真的呼叫torch.compile並比對logits。eager backend測圖擷取與相容性，<strong>不代表使用Inductor優化，也不宣稱加速</strong>。測試套件會執行這條捕捉路徑；完整Inductor需相容編譯工具鏈與你的平台驗證。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">22_compile</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-compile</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-backend</span> <span class=\"n\">eager</span>\n<span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">22_compile</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-compile</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-backend</span> <span class=\"n\">inductor</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>第二條為選配，可能需額外工具，未列入本課CPU已驗證的效能承諾。不要為了使編譯通過而刪掉必要驗證或改模型輸出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"graph-break\">graph break與重編譯</h2>\n<p>Tensor.item轉Python控制流、不可支援的Python副作用或資料相依分支可能切圖。fullgraph=True有助在例子中直接顯示不支援點；真實模型可有多圖。輸入shape／dtype／device與Python值改變可能觸發guard不符及重編譯，不能只測固定一個batch就推論任意輸入都同樣快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">效能比較的最低要求</h2>\n<p>先比較數值與必要梯度，再分開記首次延遲、暖機後延遲／吞吐、記憶體與形狀分布。GPU要同步或使用正確events。保存checkpoint優先使用原模型state_dict，避免讓編譯wrapper的名稱細節污染交付格式；載入後再按環境compile。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>同一模型用backend eager與原模型輸出相同，能說快兩倍嗎？答案：完全不能；這只是相容性證據。改batch_size再跑，觀察是否觸發新編譯；處理動態shape需按官方模型與guard語意測試。最新版本的compiler持續擴充，但本課仍以實測後端與範圍記錄結果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/22_compile.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Default explains the opt-in; --compile --backend eager tests graph capture.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">argparse</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ArgumentParser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"vm\">__doc__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;--compile&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">action</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;store_true&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;--backend&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">choices</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;eager&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;inductor&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">default</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;eager&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">args</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">compile</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;mode&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;eager_baseline&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;next&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Add --compile --backend eager to check capture; inductor needs a compatible toolchain&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dropout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">sample</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">compiled</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">compile</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">backend</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backend</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">fullgraph</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inference_mode</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">error</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">compiled</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sample</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sample</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">max</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;backend&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backend</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;maximum_error&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                  <span class=\"s2\">&quot;scope&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;eager backend checks graph capture, not optimized performance&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/user_guide/torch_compiler/torch.compiler.html\">Compiler指南</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/intermediate/torch_compile_tutorial.html\">官方compile入門</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# torch.compile：圖擷取、graph break與效能驗證\n\n理解編譯的條件與成本，區分數值正確、成功擷取及真正加速。\n\n## eager與compile的關係\n\neager直接逐步執行Tensor操作，適合學習與除錯。torch.compile嘗試擷取並編譯可支援區段，預設常使用Inductor後端。它不是換一個函式就保證更快：首次編譯成本、shape變動、graph break與模型大小都會影響收益。\n\n## 本課實際驗證什麼\n\n第22例預設只印選配說明；加`--compile --backend eager`會真的呼叫torch.compile並比對logits。eager backend測圖擷取與相容性，**不代表使用Inductor優化，也不宣稱加速**。測試套件會執行這條捕捉路徑；完整Inductor需相容編譯工具鏈與你的平台驗證。\n\n```powershell\npython pytorch/examples/22_compile.py --compile --backend eager\npython pytorch/examples/22_compile.py --compile --backend inductor\n```\n\n第二條為選配，可能需額外工具，未列入本課CPU已驗證的效能承諾。不要為了使編譯通過而刪掉必要驗證或改模型輸出。\n\n## graph break與重編譯\n\nTensor.item轉Python控制流、不可支援的Python副作用或資料相依分支可能切圖。fullgraph=True有助在例子中直接顯示不支援點；真實模型可有多圖。輸入shape／dtype／device與Python值改變可能觸發guard不符及重編譯，不能只測固定一個batch就推論任意輸入都同樣快。\n\n## 效能比較的最低要求\n\n先比較數值與必要梯度，再分開記首次延遲、暖機後延遲／吞吐、記憶體與形狀分布。GPU要同步或使用正確events。保存checkpoint優先使用原模型state_dict，避免讓編譯wrapper的名稱細節污染交付格式；載入後再按環境compile。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n同一模型用backend eager與原模型輸出相同，能說快兩倍嗎？答案：完全不能；這只是相容性證據。改batch_size再跑，觀察是否觸發新編譯；處理動態shape需按官方模型與guard語意測試。最新版本的compiler持續擴充，但本課仍以實測後端與範圍記錄結果。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/22_compile.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Default explains the opt-in; --compile --backend eager tests graph capture.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport torch\nfrom course_core import TinyMLP, setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n    parser.add_argument(\"--compile\",action=\"store_true\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--backend\",choices=[\"eager\",\"inductor\"],default=\"eager\")\n    args = parser.parse_args(argv)\n    if not args.compile:\n        result = {\"mode\":\"eager_baseline\",\"next\":\"Add --compile --backend eager to check capture; inductor needs a compatible toolchain\"}\n    else:\n        setup()\n        model = TinyMLP(dropout=0).eval()\n        sample = torch.randn(2,4)\n        compiled = torch.compile(model,backend=args.backend,fullgraph=True)\n        with torch.inference_mode():\n            error = (compiled(sample)-model(sample)).abs().max().item()\n        result = {\"backend\":args.backend,\"maximum_error\":error,\n                  \"scope\":\"eager backend checks graph capture, not optimized performance\"}\n    print(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Compiler指南](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/user_guide/torch_compiler/torch.compiler.html)\n- [官方compile入門](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/intermediate/torch_compile_tutorial.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "torchcompilegraph-break", "name": "torch.compile：圖擷取、graph break與效能驗證", "html": "torch.compile：圖擷取、graph break與效能驗證", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "eagercompile", "name": "eager與compile的關係", "html": "eager與compile的關係", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "本課實際驗證什麼", "html": "本課實際驗證什麼", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "graph-break", "name": "graph break與重編譯", "html": "graph break與重編譯", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "效能比較的最低要求", "html": "效能比較的最低要求", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "41-distributed", "group": "performance", "title": "DDP與多GPU入門：rank、sampler、同步與分母", "summary": "先理解資料平行的契約，再選配啟動CPU兩程序或真正多GPU。", "tags": ["DDP", "torchrun", "DistributedSampler", "rank", "FSDP"], "example": "23_distributed.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"ddpgpuranksampler\">DDP與多GPU入門：rank、sampler、同步與分母</h1>\n<p>先理解資料平行的契約，再選配啟動CPU兩程序或真正多GPU。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rank\">一個rank一份模型</h2>\n<p>DistributedDataParallel通常每個程序持有完整模型、處理不同資料，backward時同步梯度。world_size是程序總數，rank是全域編號，local_rank常對應本機裝置。DDP不會自動替你切分Dataset，需DistributedSampler；每個epoch呼叫set_epoch，讓shuffle隨epoch改變。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">本課選配入口</h2>\n<p>第23例預設只印plan，不開port。明確以torchrun加--run才建立CPU/Gloo process group、分片16筆資料、包DDP、更新並all_gather checksum，finally清理。它是CPU多程序示範，不是多GPU效能測試。本課已驗證sampler覆蓋與epoch變化；未將實際多程序通訊列入預設測試。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">torchrun</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-standalone</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-nproc-per-node</span><span class=\"p\">=</span><span class=\"n\">2</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">23_distributed</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-run</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>使用本課venv時可透過<code>.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m torch.distributed.run</code>啟動。需要支援Gloo與允許本機通訊的環境。NVIDIA GPU通常使用NCCL及每程序一GPU；2.15改以重寫NCCL後端為預設，遷移時要讀官方release notes，而不是沿用舊版環境假設。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">指標與樣本數</h2>\n<p>各rank先累積loss sum、correct、count，再all_reduce總和後除。不要直接平均不同樣本數rank的平均值。DistributedSampler在非整除時可能補重複樣本，或drop_last丟掉尾部；驗證要處理重複／覆蓋，不能把補樣本當新增資料。梯度的全域mean也需考慮各rank有效分母。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hang\">容易hang的原因</h2>\n<p>不同rank進入不同collective或backward次數、某rank提前拋錯、裝置mapping錯誤，都可能讓其他rank等待。先設合理timeout、記rank與階段，以最小模型測通。只在rank0寫共同checkpoint，其他rank仍按相同同步流程前進；儲存DDP原始module的state_dict便於單機載入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">延伸與練習</h2>\n<p>DDP每rank保存完整模型，模型本身放不下時才進一步研究FSDP2、tensor/pipeline parallel與distributed checkpoint。它們有不同的分片、通訊與保存契約，不能只換類別名稱。練習N=10、world_size=3，說明為何sampler需要補樣本或丟資料；解答：不能整除，需明確決定策略並讓評估分母與覆蓋一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/23_distributed.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Default prints a plan. --run requires torchrun and an environment supporting Gloo.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">argparse</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">os</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">datetime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">timedelta</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">nn</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">functional</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">F</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.nn.parallel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DistributedDataParallel</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.utils.data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DataLoader</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">TensorDataset</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.utils.data.distributed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">DistributedSampler</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">setup</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ArgumentParser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"vm\">__doc__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;--run&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">action</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;store_true&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">args</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;mode&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;plan_only&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;command&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;torchrun --standalone --nproc-per-node=2 23_distributed.py --run&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n                  <span class=\"s2\">&quot;scope&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;CPU/Gloo, optional multi-process execution; default opens no ports&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;RANK&quot;</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">environ</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;WORLD_SIZE&quot;</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">environ</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Launch --run with torchrun&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch.distributed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">dist</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">dist</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_available</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">dist</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_gloo_available</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">raise</span> <span class=\"ne\">RuntimeError</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;This build does not provide Gloo&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">setup</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">dist</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">init_process_group</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;gloo&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">timedelta</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">seconds</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">try</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">randn</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">16</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">arange</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">16</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">dataset</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">TensorDataset</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">sampler</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">DistributedSampler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dataset</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">shuffle</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">seed</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">loader</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">DataLoader</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dataset</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">batch_size</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sampler</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">sampler</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">DistributedDataParallel</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">nn</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Linear</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">optim</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SGD</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"n\">lr</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">sampler</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set_epoch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">batch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">target</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">loader</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_grad</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">set_to_none</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cross_entropy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">batch</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">target</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">backward</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">optimizer</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">checksum</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">parameter</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">detach</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">parameter</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parameters</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">gathered</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros_like</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">checksum</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">_</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"nb\">range</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dist</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_world_size</span><span class=\"p\">())]</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">dist</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">all_gather</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">gathered</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">checksum</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;rank&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">dist</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_rank</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checksums&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:[</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">value</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">gathered</span><span class=\"p\">]}</span>\n        <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">finally</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">dist</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">destroy_process_group</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_5\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/ddp.html\">DDP設計</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">分散式sampler</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0\">2.15正式發布</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# DDP與多GPU入門：rank、sampler、同步與分母\n\n先理解資料平行的契約，再選配啟動CPU兩程序或真正多GPU。\n\n## 一個rank一份模型\n\nDistributedDataParallel通常每個程序持有完整模型、處理不同資料，backward時同步梯度。world_size是程序總數，rank是全域編號，local_rank常對應本機裝置。DDP不會自動替你切分Dataset，需DistributedSampler；每個epoch呼叫set_epoch，讓shuffle隨epoch改變。\n\n## 本課選配入口\n\n第23例預設只印plan，不開port。明確以torchrun加--run才建立CPU/Gloo process group、分片16筆資料、包DDP、更新並all_gather checksum，finally清理。它是CPU多程序示範，不是多GPU效能測試。本課已驗證sampler覆蓋與epoch變化；未將實際多程序通訊列入預設測試。\n\n```powershell\ntorchrun --standalone --nproc-per-node=2 pytorch/examples/23_distributed.py --run\n```\n\n使用本課venv時可透過`.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m torch.distributed.run`啟動。需要支援Gloo與允許本機通訊的環境。NVIDIA GPU通常使用NCCL及每程序一GPU；2.15改以重寫NCCL後端為預設，遷移時要讀官方release notes，而不是沿用舊版環境假設。\n\n## 指標與樣本數\n\n各rank先累積loss sum、correct、count，再all_reduce總和後除。不要直接平均不同樣本數rank的平均值。DistributedSampler在非整除時可能補重複樣本，或drop_last丟掉尾部；驗證要處理重複／覆蓋，不能把補樣本當新增資料。梯度的全域mean也需考慮各rank有效分母。\n\n## 容易hang的原因\n\n不同rank進入不同collective或backward次數、某rank提前拋錯、裝置mapping錯誤，都可能讓其他rank等待。先設合理timeout、記rank與階段，以最小模型測通。只在rank0寫共同checkpoint，其他rank仍按相同同步流程前進；儲存DDP原始module的state_dict便於單機載入。\n\n## 延伸與練習\n\nDDP每rank保存完整模型，模型本身放不下時才進一步研究FSDP2、tensor/pipeline parallel與distributed checkpoint。它們有不同的分片、通訊與保存契約，不能只換類別名稱。練習N=10、world_size=3，說明為何sampler需要補樣本或丟資料；解答：不能整除，需明確決定策略並讓評估分母與覆蓋一致。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/23_distributed.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Default prints a plan. --run requires torchrun and an environment supporting Gloo.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport os\nfrom datetime import timedelta\nimport torch\nfrom torch import nn\nfrom torch.nn import functional as F\nfrom torch.nn.parallel import DistributedDataParallel\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader, TensorDataset\nfrom torch.utils.data.distributed import DistributedSampler\nfrom course_core import setup\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n    parser.add_argument(\"--run\",action=\"store_true\")\n    args = parser.parse_args(argv)\n    if not args.run:\n        result = {\"mode\":\"plan_only\",\"command\":\"torchrun --standalone --nproc-per-node=2 23_distributed.py --run\",\n                  \"scope\":\"CPU/Gloo, optional multi-process execution; default opens no ports\"}\n        print(json.dumps(result,indent=2))\n        return result\n    if \"RANK\" not in os.environ or \"WORLD_SIZE\" not in os.environ:\n        parser.error(\"Launch --run with torchrun\")\n    import torch.distributed as dist\n    if not dist.is_available() or not dist.is_gloo_available():\n        raise RuntimeError(\"This build does not provide Gloo\")\n    setup()\n    dist.init_process_group(\"gloo\",timeout=timedelta(seconds=60))\n    try:\n        x,y = torch.randn(16,4),torch.arange(16)%3\n        dataset = TensorDataset(x,y)\n        sampler = DistributedSampler(dataset,shuffle=True,seed=7)\n        loader = DataLoader(dataset,batch_size=4,sampler=sampler)\n        model = DistributedDataParallel(nn.Linear(4,3))\n        optimizer = torch.optim.SGD(model.parameters(),lr=.1)\n        sampler.set_epoch(0)\n        for batch,target in loader:\n            optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n            F.cross_entropy(model(batch),target).backward()\n            optimizer.step()\n        checksum = sum(parameter.detach().sum() for parameter in model.parameters())\n        gathered = [torch.zeros_like(checksum) for _ in range(dist.get_world_size())]\n        dist.all_gather(gathered,checksum)\n        result = {\"rank\":dist.get_rank(),\"checksums\":[value.item() for value in gathered]}\n        print(json.dumps(result,indent=2))\n        return result\n    finally:\n        dist.destroy_process_group()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [DDP設計](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/ddp.html)\n- [分散式sampler](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n- [2.15正式發布](https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "ddpgpuranksampler", "name": "DDP與多GPU入門：rank、sampler、同步與分母", "html": "DDP與多GPU入門：rank、sampler、同步與分母", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "rank", "name": "一個rank一份模型", "html": "一個rank一份模型", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "本課選配入口", "html": "本課選配入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "指標與樣本數", "html": "指標與樣本數", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "hang", "name": "容易hang的原因", "html": "容易hang的原因", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "延伸與練習", "html": "延伸與練習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 7}, {"id": "42-export", "group": "performance", "title": "交付與匯出：state_dict、torch.export與ONNX入口", "summary": "將模型格式、shape限制與執行runtime分清楚，避免把匯出成功當部署完成。", "tags": ["torch.export", "ONNX", "TorchScript", "deployment"], "html": "<h1 id=\"state_dicttorchexportonnx\">交付與匯出：state_dict、torch.export與ONNX入口</h1>\n<p>將模型格式、shape限制與執行runtime分清楚，避免把匯出成功當部署完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">先選交付對象</h2>\n<p>同一Python程式重建模型可使用state_dict；需要可分析的運算圖則研究torch.export；跨runtime常會考慮ONNX與目標runtime的支援。格式檔案本身不包含完整服務：仍需前處理、欄位契約、版本、效能與監控。新教材以torch.export方向介紹圖匯出，TorchScript只用於辨認舊程式與遷移背景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"export\">本課真實export往返</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">tempfile</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">export_roundtrip</span>\n<span class=\"n\">model</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">TinyMLP</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"n\">sample</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zeros</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">tempfile</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TemporaryDirectory</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">folder</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">error</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">export_roundtrip</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">model</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">sample</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">folder</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;model.pt2&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>在examples資料夾執行。它真的export、save、load，再使用loaded.module推論並比對同一輸入；CPU測試已覆蓋。<code>.pt2</code>是此流程的產物，與任意<code>.pt</code> state_dict並非單靠副檔名就可交換。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shape\">shape與控制流限制</h2>\n<p>以[2,4]匯出不表示任意batch／任意feature都可用。動態維度需以dynamic_shapes／Dim等機制明確指定範圍並測試邊界。資料相依Python分支與不支援運算需按export限制處理，不可為了成功匯出悄悄改模型語意。eval模式與模型常數也要在匯出前決定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"onnx\">ONNX的選配路線</h2>\n<p>依最新版torch.onnx文件選擇exporter，安裝相容onnx／onnxscript及runtime，指定輸入輸出與動態shape，再在目標runtime比較logits、類別與誤差。此課沒有安裝或執行ONNX runtime，故只列交付流程，不把可匯出範例冒充已驗證的跨runtime部署。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">交付驗收</h2>\n<p>至少一份golden input/output、極小與最大合理batch、dtype／欄位錯誤處理、模型hash與前處理版本、延遲與記憶體範圍。低精度／量化後再做數值與任務評估；格式轉換不是免費且無誤差的步驟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>把[2,4]輸入改[3,4]，若靜態匯出拒絕，不是weights壞了，而是shape契約不同。解答：保留靜態限制或明確匯出動態batch並測試；不能刪掉檢查後假裝支援。若Python與runtime分類相同但logits差很多，也應查數值，因為臨界樣本可能翻轉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/user_guide/torch_compiler/export.html\">torch.export指南</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/onnx.html\">ONNX文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2-10-release-blog/\">2.10起TorchScript棄用背景</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 交付與匯出：state_dict、torch.export與ONNX入口\n\n將模型格式、shape限制與執行runtime分清楚，避免把匯出成功當部署完成。\n\n## 先選交付對象\n\n同一Python程式重建模型可使用state_dict；需要可分析的運算圖則研究torch.export；跨runtime常會考慮ONNX與目標runtime的支援。格式檔案本身不包含完整服務：仍需前處理、欄位契約、版本、效能與監控。新教材以torch.export方向介紹圖匯出，TorchScript只用於辨認舊程式與遷移背景。\n\n## 本課真實export往返\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport tempfile, torch\nfrom course_core import TinyMLP, export_roundtrip\nmodel = TinyMLP().eval()\nsample = torch.zeros(2,4)\nwith tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as folder:\n    error = export_roundtrip(model, sample, Path(folder)/'model.pt2')\n    print(error)\n```\n\n在examples資料夾執行。它真的export、save、load，再使用loaded.module推論並比對同一輸入；CPU測試已覆蓋。`.pt2`是此流程的產物，與任意`.pt` state_dict並非單靠副檔名就可交換。\n\n## shape與控制流限制\n\n以[2,4]匯出不表示任意batch／任意feature都可用。動態維度需以dynamic_shapes／Dim等機制明確指定範圍並測試邊界。資料相依Python分支與不支援運算需按export限制處理，不可為了成功匯出悄悄改模型語意。eval模式與模型常數也要在匯出前決定。\n\n## ONNX的選配路線\n\n依最新版torch.onnx文件選擇exporter，安裝相容onnx／onnxscript及runtime，指定輸入輸出與動態shape，再在目標runtime比較logits、類別與誤差。此課沒有安裝或執行ONNX runtime，故只列交付流程，不把可匯出範例冒充已驗證的跨runtime部署。\n\n## 交付驗收\n\n至少一份golden input/output、極小與最大合理batch、dtype／欄位錯誤處理、模型hash與前處理版本、延遲與記憶體範圍。低精度／量化後再做數值與任務評估；格式轉換不是免費且無誤差的步驟。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n把[2,4]輸入改[3,4]，若靜態匯出拒絕，不是weights壞了，而是shape契約不同。解答：保留靜態限制或明確匯出動態batch並測試；不能刪掉檢查後假裝支援。若Python與runtime分類相同但logits差很多，也應查數值，因為臨界樣本可能翻轉。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [torch.export指南](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/user_guide/torch_compiler/export.html)\n- [ONNX文件](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/onnx.html)\n- [2.10起TorchScript棄用背景](https://pytorch.org/blog/pytorch-2-10-release-blog/)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "state_dicttorchexportonnx", "name": "交付與匯出：state_dict、torch.export與ONNX入口", "html": "交付與匯出：state_dict、torch.export與ONNX入口", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "先選交付對象", "html": "先選交付對象", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "export", "name": "本課真實export往返", "html": "本課真實export往返", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "shape", "name": "shape與控制流限制", "html": "shape與控制流限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "onnx", "name": "ONNX的選配路線", "html": "ONNX的選配路線", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "交付驗收", "html": "交付驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "43-testing", "group": "finish", "title": "有意義的PyTorch測試：shape、梯度、續訓與數值等價", "summary": "測行為與工程保證，避免把每行程式原封不動抄成測試。", "tags": ["testing", "unittest", "assert_close", "gradcheck"], "html": "<h1 id=\"pytorchshape\">有意義的PyTorch測試：shape、梯度、續訓與數值等價</h1>\n<p>測行為與工程保證，避免把每行程式原封不動抄成測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">哪些保證值得測</h2>\n<p>資料不洩漏、尾批平均正確、PAD不影響預測、參數確實更新、驗證不改梯度、快照不被後續更新污染、保存後輸出相同、受控續訓精確一致。這些測試能抓出實際錯誤；只測某函式呼叫幾次或某欄位等於寫死常數，不一定證明模型行為正確。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">數值比較需有尺度</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n<span class=\"n\">actual</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.1</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mf\">.2</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">expected</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">tensor</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"mf\">.3</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">testing</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">assert_close</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">atol</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1e-6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">rtol</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">1e-5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">assert</span> <span class=\"n\">actual</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"n\">expected</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>一般浮點使用容許值，shape、索引、label、樣本數精確比較。gradcheck用double與小平滑函數。訓練測試以明確可學的合成問題確認下降，避免外部模型下載與浮動API造成不穩定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"40\">本課40項測試的範圍</h2>\n<p>測試包含Tensor／Autograd、資料契約與train-only scaler、collate／PAD、訓練／驗證、尾批累積、state_dict與resume、CPU profiler、compile eager backend與export往返。24個預設入口在另一cwd一起執行，測試攔截socket連線，確保預設流程不下載資料或呼叫服務。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">-m</span> <span class=\"n\">unittest</span> <span class=\"n\">discover</span> <span class=\"n\">-s</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span> <span class=\"n\">-p</span> <span class=\"n\">test_examples</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"n\">-v</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>需先安裝2.15.0。本課CPU實測與CI使用同一鎖版；CUDA AMP、Inductor工具鏈、DDP真正通訊需額外環境，沒有用mock成功取代硬體驗證。</p>\n<h2 id=\"benchmark\">測試與benchmark分開</h2>\n<p>功能測試不把某台電腦50ms當通過條件。Profiler測事件確實存在，compile測輸出相容，並不測加速倍數。精確CPU resume在相同環境可要求零差；跨硬體則要先明確定義需要數值相近還是統計一致，不能一律複製容許值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>想驗證gradient accumulation，最有力的對照是複製同一模型，以完整batch與不等長microbatch各更新一次再比參數；只檢查loss有限不足。想驗證checkpoint，實際寫檔、重建、載入與推論，比只mock torch.save更能發現payload或weights_only的相容問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/testing.html\">Testing utilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/gradcheck.html\">Gradcheck</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 有意義的PyTorch測試：shape、梯度、續訓與數值等價\n\n測行為與工程保證，避免把每行程式原封不動抄成測試。\n\n## 哪些保證值得測\n\n資料不洩漏、尾批平均正確、PAD不影響預測、參數確實更新、驗證不改梯度、快照不被後續更新污染、保存後輸出相同、受控續訓精確一致。這些測試能抓出實際錯誤；只測某函式呼叫幾次或某欄位等於寫死常數，不一定證明模型行為正確。\n\n## 數值比較需有尺度\n\n```python\nimport torch\nactual = torch.tensor([.1 + .2])\nexpected = torch.tensor([.3])\ntorch.testing.assert_close(actual, expected, atol=1e-6, rtol=1e-5)\nassert actual.shape == expected.shape\n```\n\n一般浮點使用容許值，shape、索引、label、樣本數精確比較。gradcheck用double與小平滑函數。訓練測試以明確可學的合成問題確認下降，避免外部模型下載與浮動API造成不穩定。\n\n## 本課40項測試的範圍\n\n測試包含Tensor／Autograd、資料契約與train-only scaler、collate／PAD、訓練／驗證、尾批累積、state_dict與resume、CPU profiler、compile eager backend與export往返。24個預設入口在另一cwd一起執行，測試攔截socket連線，確保預設流程不下載資料或呼叫服務。\n\n```powershell\npython -m unittest discover -s pytorch/examples -p test_examples.py -v\n```\n\n需先安裝2.15.0。本課CPU實測與CI使用同一鎖版；CUDA AMP、Inductor工具鏈、DDP真正通訊需額外環境，沒有用mock成功取代硬體驗證。\n\n## 測試與benchmark分開\n\n功能測試不把某台電腦50ms當通過條件。Profiler測事件確實存在，compile測輸出相容，並不測加速倍數。精確CPU resume在相同環境可要求零差；跨硬體則要先明確定義需要數值相近還是統計一致，不能一律複製容許值。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n想驗證gradient accumulation，最有力的對照是複製同一模型，以完整batch與不等長microbatch各更新一次再比參數；只檢查loss有限不足。想驗證checkpoint，實際寫檔、重建、載入與推論，比只mock torch.save更能發現payload或weights_only的相容問題。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Testing utilities](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/testing.html)\n- [Gradcheck](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/gradcheck.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "pytorchshape", "name": "有意義的PyTorch測試：shape、梯度、續訓與數值等價", "html": "有意義的PyTorch測試：shape、梯度、續訓與數值等價", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "哪些保證值得測", "html": "哪些保證值得測", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "數值比較需有尺度", "html": "數值比較需有尺度", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "40", "name": "本課40項測試的範圍", "html": "本課40項測試的範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "benchmark", "name": "測試與benchmark分開", "html": "測試與benchmark分開", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "44-experiments", "group": "finish", "title": "實驗管理：記錄、比較、資源與模型卡", "summary": "讓每一次結果能被解讀，也能被下一次實驗可靠比較。", "tags": ["experiment", "logging", "model card", "artifacts"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">實驗管理：記錄、比較、資源與模型卡</h1>\n<p>讓每一次結果能被解讀，也能被下一次實驗可靠比較。</p>\n<h2 id=\"run\">每個run是一次完整決策</h2>\n<p>記錄問題、資料版本、split、前處理、模型與設定、環境、seed、選模準則、訓練與驗證曲線、test使用時點。不要只留best_accuracy.txt，否則你無法判斷它是否換了資料或偷看test。run命名可以使用時間加簡短識別，但內容仍以config檔為準。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">日誌最小欄位</h2>\n<p>每epoch至少有epoch、train_loss、val_loss、lr、樣本數與耗時；長訓練另記global_step、有效batch與precision。loss日誌存Python數字，避免保留計算圖。必要時記gradient norm或memory peak，頻率要避免每step昂貴同步影響訓練。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"json\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"nt\">&quot;run&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;pytorch-001&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nt\">&quot;torch&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;2.15.0+cpu&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nt\">&quot;seed&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nt\">&quot;split&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;96/32/32 synthetic&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nt\">&quot;selection&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;minimum validation loss&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nt\">&quot;precision&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;float32&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>這是記錄格式示意，實際版本從環境讀取，資料也要換成真正識別值。TensorBoard等工具可視化曲線，但工具不能替你決定指標含義；先有正確資料再加入dashboard。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">比較需要控制條件</h2>\n<p>相同資料與split，至少改一個明確因素，使用配對seed與固定預算。報告精度提升同時也看訓練時間、推論成本與記憶體。若方案A訓練100epoch、B只10epoch，結果可以比較但要說清楚不同預算，不能宣稱純架構優勢。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">模型卡與限制</h2>\n<p>描述訓練資料來源、用途、輸入輸出、評估分布、失敗案例與不適用場景。本課模型卡應寫「合成資料教學，未驗證真實任務」，即使test有高分。正式交付也要包含label mapping、前處理與版本，讓使用者不必猜測欄位順序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>兩個run分數.92與.93，能宣稱後者更好嗎？解答：先確認相同test、切分、選模與預算，再看多seed變異和實際錯誤類型。若差異只一個樣本，可能不值得多十倍成本。把一個失敗案例寫進模型卡，比只留下最好數字更能幫助之後維護。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensorboard.html\">TensorBoard介面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html\">模型狀態與保存</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 實驗管理：記錄、比較、資源與模型卡\n\n讓每一次結果能被解讀，也能被下一次實驗可靠比較。\n\n## 每個run是一次完整決策\n\n記錄問題、資料版本、split、前處理、模型與設定、環境、seed、選模準則、訓練與驗證曲線、test使用時點。不要只留best_accuracy.txt，否則你無法判斷它是否換了資料或偷看test。run命名可以使用時間加簡短識別，但內容仍以config檔為準。\n\n## 日誌最小欄位\n\n每epoch至少有epoch、train_loss、val_loss、lr、樣本數與耗時；長訓練另記global_step、有效batch與precision。loss日誌存Python數字，避免保留計算圖。必要時記gradient norm或memory peak，頻率要避免每step昂貴同步影響訓練。\n\n```json\n{\"run\":\"pytorch-001\",\"torch\":\"2.15.0+cpu\",\"seed\":7,\"split\":\"96/32/32 synthetic\",\"selection\":\"minimum validation loss\",\"precision\":\"float32\"}\n```\n\n這是記錄格式示意，實際版本從環境讀取，資料也要換成真正識別值。TensorBoard等工具可視化曲線，但工具不能替你決定指標含義；先有正確資料再加入dashboard。\n\n## 比較需要控制條件\n\n相同資料與split，至少改一個明確因素，使用配對seed與固定預算。報告精度提升同時也看訓練時間、推論成本與記憶體。若方案A訓練100epoch、B只10epoch，結果可以比較但要說清楚不同預算，不能宣稱純架構優勢。\n\n## 模型卡與限制\n\n描述訓練資料來源、用途、輸入輸出、評估分布、失敗案例與不適用場景。本課模型卡應寫「合成資料教學，未驗證真實任務」，即使test有高分。正式交付也要包含label mapping、前處理與版本，讓使用者不必猜測欄位順序。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n兩個run分數.92與.93，能宣稱後者更好嗎？解答：先確認相同test、切分、選模與預算，再看多seed變異和實際錯誤類型。若差異只一個樣本，可能不值得多十倍成本。把一個失敗案例寫進模型卡，比只留下最好數字更能幫助之後維護。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [TensorBoard介面](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/tensorboard.html)\n- [模型狀態與保存](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "實驗管理：記錄、比較、資源與模型卡", "html": "實驗管理：記錄、比較、資源與模型卡", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "run", "name": "每個run是一次完整決策", "html": "每個run是一次完整決策", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "日誌最小欄位", "html": "日誌最小欄位", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "比較需要控制條件", "html": "比較需要控制條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "模型卡與限制", "html": "模型卡與限制", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "45-failure-guide", "group": "finish", "title": "故障診斷手冊：從錯誤訊息找到最小原因", "summary": "把常見失敗整理成證據、判斷與下一步，練習有順序地除錯。", "tags": ["troubleshooting", "shape", "NaN", "OOM", "hang"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">故障診斷手冊：從錯誤訊息找到最小原因</h1>\n<p>把常見失敗整理成證據、判斷與下一步，練習有順序地除錯。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">執行前就失敗</h2>\n<p>找不到torch：確認sys.executable與pip位置。DLL／runtime錯誤：先看官方平台wheel需求與環境，不用重複裝不同來源套件。找不到course_core或資料：保留整個examples，確認檔案路徑相對__file__。與模型數學無關的錯誤，先不要改learning rate。</p>\n<h2 id=\"forwardloss\">forward或loss失敗</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>現象</th>\n<th>先查證據</th>\n<th>常見修正方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>mat1/mat2無法相乘</td>\n<td>每層shape</td>\n<td>檢查Flatten、feature順序與Linear輸入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>expected Long</td>\n<td>target.dtype與shape</td>\n<td>CE索引使用long；不是所有標籤都轉long</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>device不一致</td>\n<td>model/x/y/buffer裝置</td>\n<td>明確搬移與註冊buffer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>batch=1才失敗</td>\n<td>squeeze、BN、額外軸</td>\n<td>指定squeeze軸與明確介面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>loss有值但預測錯位</td>\n<td>pred/target相減shape</td>\n<td>排除[N,1]對[N]廣播</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"backward\">backward與更新失敗</h2>\n<p>grad=None先查loss路徑、detach/item、參數註冊與requires_grad。重複backward錯誤先重新forward，非必要不retain_graph。in-place版本錯誤追蹤修改位置，避免.data。grad有值但weights不變，檢查optimizer是否包含、lr、step與AMP是否跳過更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">訓練中途問題</h2>\n<p>NaN找最早nonfinite位置，固定一批回FP32；OOM先找保留圖、意外pairwise維度與sequence長度；val不穩看eval、前處理與分布；DataLoader卡住先workers=0；DDP hang看各rank有無一致collective次序。每種現象都有不同證據，不統一用empty_cache或重設seed處理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">寫一份可重現錯誤報告</h2>\n<p>保留Torch/Python/build/device、最小模型、隨機生成的同shape輸入、完整traceback、expected/actual，以及是否eager／AMP／compile／DDP。敏感資料可用合成值替代，但shape、dtype與控制流要維持問題。報告「不能跑」無法區分安裝、資料與數值問題。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>拿第2例的廣播錯誤寫報告：pred=[4,1]float、target=[4]float，預期逐筆[4,1]，實際差值[4,4]。解答：這是合法廣播造成語意錯誤，修正target.unsqueeze(1)，並在loss前加shape相等檢查。它不需要重裝Torch，也不是硬體不相容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Autograd除錯背景</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/cuda.html\">CUDA語意</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html\">DataLoader平台說明</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 故障診斷手冊：從錯誤訊息找到最小原因\n\n把常見失敗整理成證據、判斷與下一步，練習有順序地除錯。\n\n## 執行前就失敗\n\n找不到torch：確認sys.executable與pip位置。DLL／runtime錯誤：先看官方平台wheel需求與環境，不用重複裝不同來源套件。找不到course_core或資料：保留整個examples，確認檔案路徑相對__file__。與模型數學無關的錯誤，先不要改learning rate。\n\n## forward或loss失敗\n\n| 現象 | 先查證據 | 常見修正方向 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| mat1/mat2無法相乘 | 每層shape | 檢查Flatten、feature順序與Linear輸入 |\n| expected Long | target.dtype與shape | CE索引使用long；不是所有標籤都轉long |\n| device不一致 | model/x/y/buffer裝置 | 明確搬移與註冊buffer |\n| batch=1才失敗 | squeeze、BN、額外軸 | 指定squeeze軸與明確介面 |\n| loss有值但預測錯位 | pred/target相減shape | 排除[N,1]對[N]廣播 |\n\n## backward與更新失敗\n\ngrad=None先查loss路徑、detach/item、參數註冊與requires_grad。重複backward錯誤先重新forward，非必要不retain_graph。in-place版本錯誤追蹤修改位置，避免.data。grad有值但weights不變，檢查optimizer是否包含、lr、step與AMP是否跳過更新。\n\n## 訓練中途問題\n\nNaN找最早nonfinite位置，固定一批回FP32；OOM先找保留圖、意外pairwise維度與sequence長度；val不穩看eval、前處理與分布；DataLoader卡住先workers=0；DDP hang看各rank有無一致collective次序。每種現象都有不同證據，不統一用empty_cache或重設seed處理。\n\n## 寫一份可重現錯誤報告\n\n保留Torch/Python/build/device、最小模型、隨機生成的同shape輸入、完整traceback、expected/actual，以及是否eager／AMP／compile／DDP。敏感資料可用合成值替代，但shape、dtype與控制流要維持問題。報告「不能跑」無法區分安裝、資料與數值問題。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n拿第2例的廣播錯誤寫報告：pred=[4,1]float、target=[4]float，預期逐筆[4,1]，實際差值[4,4]。解答：這是合法廣播造成語意錯誤，修正target.unsqueeze(1)，並在loss前加shape相等檢查。它不需要重裝Torch，也不是硬體不相容。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Autograd除錯背景](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [CUDA語意](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/cuda.html)\n- [DataLoader平台說明](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/data.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "故障診斷手冊：從錯誤訊息找到最小原因", "html": "故障診斷手冊：從錯誤訊息找到最小原因", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "執行前就失敗", "html": "執行前就失敗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "forwardloss", "name": "forward或loss失敗", "html": "forward或loss失敗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "backward", "name": "backward與更新失敗", "html": "backward與更新失敗", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "訓練中途問題", "html": "訓練中途問題", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "寫一份可重現錯誤報告", "html": "寫一份可重現錯誤報告", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "46-capstone", "group": "finish", "title": "完整專題：訓練、選模、存檔、載入與新資料推論", "summary": "把前面所有契約組成一條實際可執行、能檢查產物的流程。", "tags": ["capstone", "training", "checkpoint", "inference"], "example": "24_capstone.py", "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">完整專題：訓練、選模、存檔、載入與新資料推論</h1>\n<p>把前面所有契約組成一條實際可執行、能檢查產物的流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">專題驗收條件</h2>\n<p>從全新Python程序執行，生成固定資料，train-only前處理，訓練MLP，以val loss選best，最後才test，實際存檔再載入，對raw feature推論。預設CPU與暫存產物，沒有API或下載。指定output才永久保存到新檔案，避免示範污染你的工作區。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">操作方式</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"powershell\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">24_capstone</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-epochs</span> <span class=\"n\">10</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-device</span> <span class=\"n\">cpu</span>\n<span class=\"n\">python</span> <span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">examples</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">24_capstone</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">py</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-epochs</span> <span class=\"n\">10</span> <span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">-output</span> <span class=\"n\">runs</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">pytorch</span><span class=\"p\">-</span><span class=\"n\">001</span><span class=\"p\">/</span><span class=\"n\">checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pt</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>需要GPU時明確選--device cuda並先完成裝置章檢查。本課CLI的auto可依環境選裝置，但比較實驗時最好固定device，避免同一命令在不同電腦代表不同precision／kernel環境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">如何讀輸出</h2>\n<p>torch_baseline從執行環境讀取；initial_validation是訓練前；final_validation是最後權重；test_of_best_validation_model是選模完成後；prediction對一筆raw feature；saved_to說明持久或暫存。高test只代表這份合成資料的結果，並沒有提供真實服務評估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">從入口追進核心</h2>\n<p>入口Config→experiment→make_loaders→train_epoch/evaluate→frozen_state，結束save_checkpoint/load_checkpoint→predict。讀者可以從入口往下找到每項行為，不需要依賴隱藏服務。測試確認24個入口從另一cwd仍可執行，下載ZIP後保留共用模組與data目錄即可重現。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">換成自己的專案</h2>\n<p>先替換Dataset與資料契約，保留split、scaler與label mapping；再評估MLP是否適合。加入scheduler、early stopping與AMP時，對應狀態都要進checkpoint；改成多GPU時，sampler、全域指標與單rank保存都需重寫。不要一次把所有功能拼上去，先保留本課CPU版本作對照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_7\">練習與解答</h2>\n<p>在新run保存後重啟載入，確認相同raw input預測一致。再錯置兩個feature欄位，即使shape相同也可能不同；解答是保存欄位名稱與順序並在輸入邊界驗證，而非只依[N,4]。最後寫一份模型卡，明確說明合成資料限制、版本與尚未測試的硬體。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_8\">完整可執行範例</h2>\n<p>從專案根目錄執行 <code>python pytorch/examples/24_capstone.py</code>。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-language=\"python\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">&quot;&quot;&quot;Train, validate, checkpoint and predict. Default artifacts live in a temporary folder.&quot;&quot;&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">argparse</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">pathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">tempfile</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">course_core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">load_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">save_checkpoint</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">argparse</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ArgumentParser</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">description</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"vm\">__doc__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;--epochs&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">default</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;--device&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">choices</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;cpu&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;cuda&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"n\">default</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;cpu&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;--output&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">help</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Optional new checkpoint filename; existing files are preserved&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">args</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">parse_args</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">argv</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span> <span class=\"ow\">and</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exists</span><span class=\"p\">():</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">parser</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;Choose a new output filename&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">run</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">experiment</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">epochs</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">epochs</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">save_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checkpoint&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">restored</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">load_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"n\">tempfile</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">TemporaryDirectory</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">directory</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">path</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Path</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">directory</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;capstone.pt&quot;</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">save_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;checkpoint&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">restored</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">load_checkpoint</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;torch_baseline&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;torch_version&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;epochs&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;epoch&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;initial_validation&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;initial_validation&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;final_validation&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;final_validation&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;test_of_best_validation_model&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;test&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;prediction&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">predict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">restored</span><span class=\"p\">,[[</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mf\">0.</span><span class=\"p\">]]),</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;saved_to&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">output</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;temporary directory, removed after demonstration&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n              <span class=\"s2\">&quot;data&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;synthetic; no production accuracy claim&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dumps</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">result</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">indent</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">result</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_9\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html\">官方完整流程</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html\">Serialization</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 完整專題：訓練、選模、存檔、載入與新資料推論\n\n把前面所有契約組成一條實際可執行、能檢查產物的流程。\n\n## 專題驗收條件\n\n從全新Python程序執行，生成固定資料，train-only前處理，訓練MLP，以val loss選best，最後才test，實際存檔再載入，對raw feature推論。預設CPU與暫存產物，沒有API或下載。指定output才永久保存到新檔案，避免示範污染你的工作區。\n\n## 操作方式\n\n```powershell\npython pytorch/examples/24_capstone.py --epochs 10 --device cpu\npython pytorch/examples/24_capstone.py --epochs 10 --output runs/pytorch-001/checkpoint.pt\n```\n\n需要GPU時明確選--device cuda並先完成裝置章檢查。本課CLI的auto可依環境選裝置，但比較實驗時最好固定device，避免同一命令在不同電腦代表不同precision／kernel環境。\n\n## 如何讀輸出\n\ntorch_baseline從執行環境讀取；initial_validation是訓練前；final_validation是最後權重；test_of_best_validation_model是選模完成後；prediction對一筆raw feature；saved_to說明持久或暫存。高test只代表這份合成資料的結果，並沒有提供真實服務評估。\n\n## 從入口追進核心\n\n入口Config→experiment→make_loaders→train_epoch/evaluate→frozen_state，結束save_checkpoint/load_checkpoint→predict。讀者可以從入口往下找到每項行為，不需要依賴隱藏服務。測試確認24個入口從另一cwd仍可執行，下載ZIP後保留共用模組與data目錄即可重現。\n\n## 換成自己的專案\n\n先替換Dataset與資料契約，保留split、scaler與label mapping；再評估MLP是否適合。加入scheduler、early stopping與AMP時，對應狀態都要進checkpoint；改成多GPU時，sampler、全域指標與單rank保存都需重寫。不要一次把所有功能拼上去，先保留本課CPU版本作對照。\n\n## 練習與解答\n\n在新run保存後重啟載入，確認相同raw input預測一致。再錯置兩個feature欄位，即使shape相同也可能不同；解答是保存欄位名稱與順序並在輸入邊界驗證，而非只依[N,4]。最後寫一份模型卡，明確說明合成資料限制、版本與尚未測試的硬體。\n\n## 完整可執行範例\n\n從專案根目錄執行 `python pytorch/examples/24_capstone.py`。下載包內另含共用模組、資料與測試，請一起保留。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Train, validate, checkpoint and predict. Default artifacts live in a temporary folder.\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport tempfile\nfrom course_core import Config, experiment, load_checkpoint, predict, save_checkpoint\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=__doc__)\n    parser.add_argument(\"--epochs\",type=int,default=10)\n    parser.add_argument(\"--device\",choices=[\"cpu\",\"cuda\",\"auto\"],default=\"cpu\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--output\",type=Path,help=\"Optional new checkpoint filename; existing files are preserved\")\n    args = parser.parse_args(argv)\n    if args.output and args.output.exists():\n        parser.error(\"Choose a new output filename\")\n    run = experiment(Config(epochs=args.epochs),device=args.device)\n    if args.output:\n        save_checkpoint(args.output,run[\"checkpoint\"])\n        restored = load_checkpoint(args.output)\n    else:\n        with tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() as directory:\n            path = Path(directory)/\"capstone.pt\"\n            save_checkpoint(path,run[\"checkpoint\"])\n            restored = load_checkpoint(path)\n    result = {\"torch_baseline\":restored[\"torch_version\"],\"epochs\":restored[\"epoch\"],\n              \"initial_validation\":run[\"initial_validation\"],\"final_validation\":run[\"final_validation\"],\n              \"test_of_best_validation_model\":run[\"test\"],\"prediction\":predict(restored,[[0.,0.,0.,0.]]),\n              \"saved_to\":str(args.output) if args.output else \"temporary directory, removed after demonstration\",\n              \"data\":\"synthetic; no production accuracy claim\"}\n    print(json.dumps(result,indent=2))\n    return result\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [官方完整流程](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/quickstart_tutorial.html)\n- [Serialization](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/serialization.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "完整專題：訓練、選模、存檔、載入與新資料推論", "html": "完整專題：訓練、選模、存檔、載入與新資料推論", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "專題驗收條件", "html": "專題驗收條件", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "操作方式", "html": "操作方式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "如何讀輸出", "html": "如何讀輸出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "從入口追進核心", "html": "從入口追進核心", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "換成自己的專案", "html": "換成自己的專案", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_7", "name": "練習與解答", "html": "練習與解答", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_8", "name": "完整可執行範例", "html": "完整可執行範例", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_9", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 6}, {"id": "47-exercises", "group": "finish", "title": "整合練習與解答：從看懂到獨立寫出", "summary": "用可驗收的題目檢查理解，依序練資料、梯度、訓練與工程產物。", "tags": ["exercises", "answers", "practice"], "html": "<h1 id=\"_1\">整合練習與解答：從看懂到獨立寫出</h1>\n<p>用可驗收的題目檢查理解，依序練資料、梯度、訓練與工程產物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shape\">第一組：shape與微分</h2>\n<p>題1：pred[5,1]、target[5]的MSE為何不對？解答：廣播成[5,5]，逐筆契約應相同shape。加入assert，測batch_size=1與大於1。題2：x=2,w=3,t=8，L=(wx-t)²，導數是-8；SGD lr=.1更新w=3.8。用Tensor核對，並確認backward之前／之後／step之後各狀態。</p>\n<p>題3：對同一loss backward兩次為何可能失敗？解答：中間保存量已釋放；重新forward建立新圖。如果只是想累積兩批梯度，每批新forward，群組開始才zero_grad，無需保留上一批完整圖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">第二組：資料與模式</h2>\n<p>題4：12筆資料batch5，尾批大小[5,5,2]，batch loss[1,2,4]，正確epoch loss=(5+10+8)/12=23/12，而非7/3。題5：no_grad後Dropout仍隨機，修正model.eval；驗證完恢復原模式，並測parameters.grad沒有新增。</p>\n<p>題6：兩句長度2與4，把短句補PAD後應維持表示不變。解答：有效mask加權和除有效長度，不能直接mean整個T。PAD ID固定0，未知token另外設計，不將所有未知字視為padding。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">第三組：更新與產物</h2>\n<p>題7：10筆microbatch4/4/2，用同一Linear比較大batch。解答：每批sum/10，最後step一次；參數在浮點容許內一致。題8：best_state在後續更新後改變，解答：state_dict引用需逐值clone，測快照不受model.add_影響。</p>\n<p>題9：第2輪續訓到4輪，答案至少包含model、optimizer、CPU RNG、loader generator、epoch、best/history/config。本課限定同版本CPU、workers0與epoch邊界；若加AMP或scheduler，保存其state；加augmentation或worker就擴充RNG與資料狀態設計。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">第四組：效能與交付</h2>\n<p>題10：compile eager backend通過是否等於加速？答案：否，只測圖擷取與數值。題11：reserved大於allocated是否一定洩漏？答案：否，看引用與長期趨勢。題12：export成功但新batch不接受？答案：先查靜態shape契約，明確宣告動態範圍後重新匯出與測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">自我驗收</h2>\n<p>不看範例寫出一個完整train/val腳本，至少有train-only前處理、正確尾批指標、eval+inference mode、best快照與載入推論。用你自己的測試抓到一次刻意植入的錯誤，再修復。能解釋每個狀態何時建立與改變，比背下整段模板更接近獨立實作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html\">Tensor與Autograd</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/intro.html\">官方基本教學</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 整合練習與解答：從看懂到獨立寫出\n\n用可驗收的題目檢查理解，依序練資料、梯度、訓練與工程產物。\n\n## 第一組：shape與微分\n\n題1：pred[5,1]、target[5]的MSE為何不對？解答：廣播成[5,5]，逐筆契約應相同shape。加入assert，測batch_size=1與大於1。題2：x=2,w=3,t=8，L=(wx-t)²，導數是-8；SGD lr=.1更新w=3.8。用Tensor核對，並確認backward之前／之後／step之後各狀態。\n\n題3：對同一loss backward兩次為何可能失敗？解答：中間保存量已釋放；重新forward建立新圖。如果只是想累積兩批梯度，每批新forward，群組開始才zero_grad，無需保留上一批完整圖。\n\n## 第二組：資料與模式\n\n題4：12筆資料batch5，尾批大小[5,5,2]，batch loss[1,2,4]，正確epoch loss=(5+10+8)/12=23/12，而非7/3。題5：no_grad後Dropout仍隨機，修正model.eval；驗證完恢復原模式，並測parameters.grad沒有新增。\n\n題6：兩句長度2與4，把短句補PAD後應維持表示不變。解答：有效mask加權和除有效長度，不能直接mean整個T。PAD ID固定0，未知token另外設計，不將所有未知字視為padding。\n\n## 第三組：更新與產物\n\n題7：10筆microbatch4/4/2，用同一Linear比較大batch。解答：每批sum/10，最後step一次；參數在浮點容許內一致。題8：best_state在後續更新後改變，解答：state_dict引用需逐值clone，測快照不受model.add_影響。\n\n題9：第2輪續訓到4輪，答案至少包含model、optimizer、CPU RNG、loader generator、epoch、best/history/config。本課限定同版本CPU、workers0與epoch邊界；若加AMP或scheduler，保存其state；加augmentation或worker就擴充RNG與資料狀態設計。\n\n## 第四組：效能與交付\n\n題10：compile eager backend通過是否等於加速？答案：否，只測圖擷取與數值。題11：reserved大於allocated是否一定洩漏？答案：否，看引用與長期趨勢。題12：export成功但新batch不接受？答案：先查靜態shape契約，明確宣告動態範圍後重新匯出與測試。\n\n## 自我驗收\n\n不看範例寫出一個完整train/val腳本，至少有train-only前處理、正確尾批指標、eval+inference mode、best快照與載入推論。用你自己的測試抓到一次刻意植入的錯誤，再修復。能解釋每個狀態何時建立與改變，比背下整段模板更接近獨立實作。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [Tensor與Autograd](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/notes/autograd.html)\n- [官方基本教學](https://docs.pytorch.org/tutorials/beginner/basics/intro.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "_1", "name": "整合練習與解答：從看懂到獨立寫出", "html": "整合練習與解答：從看懂到獨立寫出", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "shape", "name": "第一組：shape與微分", "html": "第一組：shape與微分", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "第二組：資料與模式", "html": "第二組：資料與模式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "第三組：更新與產物", "html": "第三組：更新與產物", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "第四組：效能與交付", "html": "第四組：效能與交付", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "自我驗收", "html": "自我驗收", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 4}, {"id": "48-reference", "group": "finish", "title": "速查、版本與下一步：用最新API持續學習", "summary": "整理目前版本基準、已驗證範圍、常用契約與後續延伸。", "tags": ["reference", "2.15.0", "migration", "glossary"], "html": "<h1 id=\"api\">速查、版本與下一步：用最新API持續學習</h1>\n<p>整理目前版本基準、已驗證範圍、常用契約與後續延伸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">版本與查核方式</h2>\n<p>本課建立日2026-10-30，以官方最新穩定版PyTorch2.15.0為基準，正式發布日2026-10-28。官方發布、PyPI與CPU wheel索引已交叉查核。安裝選擇器的靜態頁面可能顯示舊版本，所以不是只讀首頁就下結論；以正式發布與可安裝套件確認，再固定requirements。</p>\n<p>2.15新增多種硬體與分散式能力，NCCL後端預設也有變動；入門仍從Tensor、Autograd與資料契約開始。新版特性涉及特定硬體者清楚列為延伸，不把release notes每一項都包成未測試的入門範例。下一次更新會重新查核，不宣稱此版本永遠最新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">常用契約速查</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任務／元件</th>\n<th>輸入</th>\n<th>輸出／要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Linear(F,C)</td>\n<td>float[...,F]</td>\n<td>float[...,C]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conv2d</td>\n<td>float[N,C,H,W]</td>\n<td>依kernel/stride/padding推算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Embedding</td>\n<td>long[N,T]</td>\n<td>float[N,T,D]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>單選CE</td>\n<td>logits[N,C], long[N]</td>\n<td>scalar loss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BCEWithLogits</td>\n<td>logits與float target同shape</td>\n<td>不先sigmoid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MSE</td>\n<td>float pred/target同shape</td>\n<td>避免隱含廣播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eval</td>\n<td>模組模式切換</td>\n<td>不自動關Autograd</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>inference_mode</td>\n<td>停止記錄且有額外限制</td>\n<td>不自動設eval</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">目前實測範圍</h2>\n<p>Python3.11與PyTorch2.15.0+cpu，40項測試，24個預設入口。真實CPU訓練、save/load、epoch-boundary resume、尾批梯度等價、Profiler、compile的eager backend與torch.export往返均有執行。沒有聲稱CUDA AMP、多GPU/DDP通訊、Inductor效能或ONNX runtime已通過。網頁實驗是JavaScript數值示範，不在瀏覽器執行Torch。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">舊寫法的遷移提示</h2>\n<p>AMP採torch.amp與torch.autocast主線；讀checkpoint明確weights_only與map_location；新圖匯出先看torch.export，TorchScript列歷史背景；參數更新不要.data。升版時閱讀破壞性變更與棄用，不只改requirements的數字。重新跑數值、儲存、resume與交付測試，再更新下載包及查核日期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_5\">名詞與下一條路</h2>\n<p>epoch是資料完整一輪，step是一次optimizer更新，microbatch是有效群組的一部分，logits是未正規化分數，buffer是需管理但非可訓練參數的狀態。loss下降、預測正確、效能提升與部署完成分別需要不同證據。</p>\n<p>接著可學更完整深度學習原理、Transformer、模型微調或訓練基礎設施；Embedding課程則把表示連到搜尋與應用。先完成第46章專題，再挑你需要的一條路。練習：用自己的話解釋eval與zero_grad為何不能互換，並寫一個會因漏掉其中一項而失敗的測試。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_6\">官方來源與延伸閱讀</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0\">正式發布</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://pypi.org/project/torch/2.15.0/\">版本套件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/index.html\">2.15文件</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/index.html\">持續更新的stable入口</a></li>\n</ul>", "text": "# 速查、版本與下一步：用最新API持續學習\n\n整理目前版本基準、已驗證範圍、常用契約與後續延伸。\n\n## 版本與查核方式\n\n本課建立日2026-10-30，以官方最新穩定版PyTorch2.15.0為基準，正式發布日2026-10-28。官方發布、PyPI與CPU wheel索引已交叉查核。安裝選擇器的靜態頁面可能顯示舊版本，所以不是只讀首頁就下結論；以正式發布與可安裝套件確認，再固定requirements。\n\n2.15新增多種硬體與分散式能力，NCCL後端預設也有變動；入門仍從Tensor、Autograd與資料契約開始。新版特性涉及特定硬體者清楚列為延伸，不把release notes每一項都包成未測試的入門範例。下一次更新會重新查核，不宣稱此版本永遠最新。\n\n## 常用契約速查\n\n| 任務／元件 | 輸入 | 輸出／要求 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Linear(F,C) | float[...,F] | float[...,C] |\n| Conv2d | float[N,C,H,W] | 依kernel/stride/padding推算 |\n| Embedding | long[N,T] | float[N,T,D] |\n| 單選CE | logits[N,C], long[N] | scalar loss |\n| BCEWithLogits | logits與float target同shape | 不先sigmoid |\n| MSE | float pred/target同shape | 避免隱含廣播 |\n| eval | 模組模式切換 | 不自動關Autograd |\n| inference_mode | 停止記錄且有額外限制 | 不自動設eval |\n\n## 目前實測範圍\n\nPython3.11與PyTorch2.15.0+cpu，40項測試，24個預設入口。真實CPU訓練、save/load、epoch-boundary resume、尾批梯度等價、Profiler、compile的eager backend與torch.export往返均有執行。沒有聲稱CUDA AMP、多GPU/DDP通訊、Inductor效能或ONNX runtime已通過。網頁實驗是JavaScript數值示範，不在瀏覽器執行Torch。\n\n## 舊寫法的遷移提示\n\nAMP採torch.amp與torch.autocast主線；讀checkpoint明確weights_only與map_location；新圖匯出先看torch.export，TorchScript列歷史背景；參數更新不要.data。升版時閱讀破壞性變更與棄用，不只改requirements的數字。重新跑數值、儲存、resume與交付測試，再更新下載包及查核日期。\n\n## 名詞與下一條路\n\nepoch是資料完整一輪，step是一次optimizer更新，microbatch是有效群組的一部分，logits是未正規化分數，buffer是需管理但非可訓練參數的狀態。loss下降、預測正確、效能提升與部署完成分別需要不同證據。\n\n接著可學更完整深度學習原理、Transformer、模型微調或訓練基礎設施；Embedding課程則把表示連到搜尋與應用。先完成第46章專題，再挑你需要的一條路。練習：用自己的話解釋eval與zero_grad為何不能互換，並寫一個會因漏掉其中一項而失敗的測試。\n\n## 官方來源與延伸閱讀\n\n- [正式發布](https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/v2.15.0)\n- [版本套件](https://pypi.org/project/torch/2.15.0/)\n- [2.15文件](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/2.15/index.html)\n- [持續更新的stable入口](https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/index.html)\n", "toc": [{"level": 1, "id": "api", "name": "速查、版本與下一步：用最新API持續學習", "html": "速查、版本與下一步：用最新API持續學習", "data-toc-label": "", "children": [{"level": 2, "id": "_1", "name": "版本與查核方式", "html": "版本與查核方式", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_2", "name": "常用契約速查", "html": "常用契約速查", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_3", "name": "目前實測範圍", "html": "目前實測範圍", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_4", "name": "舊寫法的遷移提示", "html": "舊寫法的遷移提示", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_5", "name": "名詞與下一條路", "html": "名詞與下一條路", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}, {"level": 2, "id": "_6", "name": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "html": "官方來源與延伸閱讀", "data-toc-label": "", "children": []}]}], "minutes": 5}]};
